--- !u!114 &2320895990988415996
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 87800545635511906}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Currently, there are discussions among World Leaders to make a universal
    currency, and with it, dramatic changes and responsibilities. \n\nThere are both
    pros and cons to this, with many worried about losing their cultural identity.
    It\u2019s still an ongoing conflict. Rightfully so. Our differences should be
    celebrated, not homogenized. \n\nBalance between unification and independent
    thought.\n\nThe future is unknown: a dark path never really taken before on a
    world stage. \n\nAre we truly ready to take that step? \n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9137770337806101678, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0,
    type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
