--- !u!114 &4151179974239608548
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 113527599099434908}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 5673832303103846267}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "It\u2019s just a place to sleep and stream with a high tech computer, and a
    small fridge, most of the food that comes through here is from Duber Eats. \n\nWhy
    are groceries so expensive?!\n"
  - "Es ist einfach ein Ort zum Schlafen und Streamen mit einem High-Tech-Computer
    und einem kleinen K\xFChlschrank. Die meisten Lebensmittel, die hier durchkommen,
    stammen von Duber Eats. \n\nWarum sind Lebensmittel so teuer?!"
  - "\u3053\u3053\u306F\u30CF\u30A4\u30C6\u30AF \u30B3\u30F3\u30D4\u30E5\u30FC\u30BF\u30FC\u3068\u5C0F\u3055\u306A\u51B7\u8535\u5EAB\u3092\u5099\u3048\u305F\u3001\u305F\u3060\u5BDD\u305F\u308A\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DF\u30F3\u30B0\u3057\u305F\u308A\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306E\u5834\u6240\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3053\u3053\u3067\u51FA\u3066\u304F\u308B\u98DF\u3079\u7269\u306E\u307B\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306F
    Duber Eats \u304B\u3089\u306E\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3002 \n\n\u306A\u305C\u98DF\u6599\u54C1\u306F\u3042\u3093\u306A\u306B\u9AD8\u3044\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F"
  - "Es solo un lugar para dormir y transmitir con una computadora de alta tecnolog\xEDa
    y un refrigerador peque\xF1o; la mayor parte de la comida que llega aqu\xED es
    de Duber Eats. \n\n\xBFPor qu\xE9 los alimentos son tan caros?"
