  m_text: "There is now government colonies on the Moon, preparing bases to act as
    fueling stations for broader exploration of the Solar System. Most are working
    together to make this dream a reality. \n\nFusion is now powering most homes
    in the more developed nations, with renewables like solar, wind, and geothermal
    being set up in less technological countries. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
