--- !u!114 &7356865511301094167
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 126482784110427131}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7264413600310816663}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Regal, quick to laugh, and slow to anger, Asterella Star is not what you expect 
    of a Demon Lord. \n\nShe handles her responsibility with an air of command and
    ease. However,  you observe cracks in that facade, sprinkled with little sparks
    of childish indignation, and wonder. \n\nSlightly sadomasochistic, she has tendencies
    to delve in dark humor at a moments notice. \n"
  - "Asterella Star ist majest\xE4tisch, lacht schnell und wird langsam w\xFCtend
    \u2013 sie ist nicht das, was man von einem D\xE4monenlord erwartet. \n\nSie
    geht mit ihrer Verantwortung souver\xE4n und locker um. Sie bemerken jedoch Risse
    in dieser Fassade, die mit kleinen Funken kindlicher Emp\xF6rung und Verwunderung
    \xFCbers\xE4t sind. \n\nSie ist leicht sadomasochistisch und neigt dazu, sich
    spontan mit schwarzem Humor zu besch\xE4ftigen."
  - "\u5802\u3005\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3044\u3066\u3001\u3059\u3050\u306B\u7B11\u3044\u3001\u305D\u3057\u3066\u6012\u308B\u306E\u304C\u9045\u3044\u30A2\u30B9\u30C6\u30EC\u30E9\u30B9\u30BF\u30FC\u306F\u3001\u9B54\u738B\u306B\u671F\u5F85\u3055\u308C\u308B\u3082\u306E\u3067\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002
    \n\n\u5F7C\u5973\u306F\u6307\u63EE\u5B98\u304B\u3064\u6C17\u697D\u306A\u96F0\u56F2\u6C17\u3067\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u8CAC\u4EFB\u3092\u3053\u306A\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306F\u305D\u306E\u30D5\u30A1\u30B5\u30FC\u30C9\u306B\u4E80\u88C2\u304C\u3042\u308A\u3001\u5E7C\u7A1A\u306A\u61A4\u308A\u306E\u5C0F\u3055\u306A\u706B\u82B1\u304C\u6563\u308A\u3070\u3081\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3092\u89B3\u5BDF\u3057\u3001\u4E0D\u601D\u8B70\u306B\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u3084\u3084\u30B5\u30C9\u30DE\u30BE\u30D2\u30B9\u30C8\u306A\u5F7C\u5973\u306F\u3001\u3075\u3068\u3057\u305F\u77AC\u9593\u306B\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30AF
    \u30E6\u30FC\u30E2\u30A2\u306B\u6D78\u308B\u50BE\u5411\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Regia, r\xE1pida para re\xEDr y lenta para enojarse, Asterella Star no es lo
    que esperar\xEDas de un Se\xF1or Demonio. \n\nManeja su responsabilidad con aire
    de mando y facilidad. Sin embargo, se observan grietas en esa fachada, salpicadas
    de peque\xF1as chispas de indignaci\xF3n y asombro infantil. \n\nLigeramente
    sadomasoquista, tiene tendencia a ahondar en el humor negro en cualquier momento."
--- !u!1 &128804855877074579
