--- !u!114 &238588702920007407
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 139345430730958977}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 3828583033945805134}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "In the real world, you are an aspiring Streamer, with ties at Digital Horizons.
    You are hoping that the experiments will open up new and exciting tech for the
    streaming community. \nWith curiosity driving you, nothing can stop you! The
    future awaits, and you are eager to be a pivotal part of it. \nYou are still
    scared, but the payoff is so much higher than the risks to you. \n"
  - "In der realen Welt sind Sie ein aufstrebender Streamer mit Verbindungen zu Digital
    Horizons. Sie hoffen, dass die Experimente der Streaming-Community neue und aufregende
    Technologien er\xF6ffnen werden. \nMit der Neugier, die Sie antreibt, kann Sie
    nichts aufhalten! Die Zukunft wartet auf Sie und Sie sind bestrebt, ein entscheidender
    Teil davon zu sein. \nSie haben immer noch Angst, aber der Gewinn ist viel h\xF6her
    als die Risiken f\xFCr Sie."
  - "\u73FE\u5B9F\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u3067\u306F\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306F Digital
    Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u306B\u6240\u5C5E\u3059\u308B\u91CE\u5FC3\u7684\u306A\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DE\u30FC\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306F\u3001\u3053\u306E\u5B9F\u9A13\u306B\u3088\u3063\u3066\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DF\u30F3\u30B0
    \u30B3\u30DF\u30E5\u30CB\u30C6\u30A3\u306B\u65B0\u3057\u304F\u30A8\u30AD\u30B5\u30A4\u30C6\u30A3\u30F3\u30B0\u306A\u30C6\u30AF\u30CE\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u304C\u958B\u304B\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u671F\u5F85\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\u597D\u5947\u5FC3\u304C\u3042\u306A\u305F\u3092\u99C6\u308A\u7ACB\u3066\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u3092\u6B62\u3081\u308B\u3082\u306E\u306F\u4F55\u3082\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002\u672A\u6765\u304C\u5F85\u3063\u3066\u304A\u308A\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306F\u305D\u306E\u4E2D\u6838\u3068\u306A\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u71B1\u671B\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306F\u307E\u3060\u6016\u304C\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u304C\u3001\u305D\u306E\u898B\u8FD4\u308A\u306F\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u306E\u30EA\u30B9\u30AF\u3088\u308A\u3082\u306F\u308B\u304B\u306B\u5927\u304D\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - "En el mundo real, eres un aspirante a Streamer y tienes v\xEDnculos con Digital
    Horizons. Espera que los experimentos abran la puerta a tecnolog\xEDas nuevas
    y emocionantes para la comunidad de streaming. \n\xA1Si la curiosidad te impulsa,
    nada podr\xE1 detenerte! El futuro aguarda y usted est\xE1 ansioso por ser una
    parte fundamental de \xE9l. \nTodav\xEDa tienes miedo, pero la recompensa es
    mucho mayor que los riesgos para ti."
