--- !u!114 &5946265818859113627
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 152294941929898391}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 6883910744921373560}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Chat viewers will sometimes be allowed to make their own content. \n\nGood examples
    of this are small hot dog stands and kimonos during live events, with moderators
    ensuring the chat is behaving within terms of service. \n\nOther streams will
    be themed around the game they are playing, with viewers enveloped inside game\u2019s
    mechanics. \n"
  - "Chat-Zuschauer d\xFCrfen manchmal ihre eigenen Inhalte erstellen. \n\nGute Beispiele
    hierf\xFCr sind kleine Hot-Dog-St\xE4nde und Kimonos bei Live-Events, bei denen
    Moderatoren daf\xFCr sorgen, dass sich der Chat im Rahmen der Nutzungsbedingungen
    verh\xE4lt. \n\nAndere Streams drehen sich thematisch um das Spiel, das sie spielen,
    und lassen die Zuschauer in die Spielmechanik eintauchen."
  - "\u30C1\u30E3\u30C3\u30C8\u95B2\u89A7\u8005\u306F\u72EC\u81EA\u306E\u30B3\u30F3\u30C6\u30F3\u30C4\u3092\u4F5C\u6210\u3067\u304D\u308B\u5834\u5408\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u3053\u306E\u597D\u4F8B\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306F\u3001\u30E9\u30A4\u30D6
    \u30A4\u30D9\u30F3\u30C8\u4E2D\u306E\u5C0F\u3055\u306A\u30DB\u30C3\u30C8\u30C9\u30C3\u30B0
    \u30B9\u30BF\u30F3\u30C9\u3084\u7740\u7269\u304C\u6319\u3052\u3089\u308C\u307E\u3059\u3002\u30E2\u30C7\u30EC\u30FC\u30BF\u306F\u3001\u30C1\u30E3\u30C3\u30C8\u304C\u30B5\u30FC\u30D3\u30B9\u898F\u7D04\u5185\u3067\u52D5\u4F5C\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u78BA\u8A8D\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u4ED6\u306E\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30E0\u306F\u30D7\u30EC\u30A4\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u3092\u30C6\u30FC\u30DE\u306B\u3057\u3066\u304A\u308A\u3001\u8996\u8074\u8005\u306F\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u306E\u4ED5\u7D44\u307F\u306B\u5305\u307E\u308C\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "En ocasiones, a los espectadores del chat se les permitir\xE1 crear su propio
    contenido. \n\nBuenos ejemplos de esto son los peque\xF1os puestos de perritos
    calientes y kimonos durante eventos en vivo, en los que los moderadores se aseguran
    de que el chat se comporte dentro de los t\xE9rminos del servicio. \n\nOtras
    transmisiones tendr\xE1n como tema el juego que est\xE1n jugando, y los espectadores
    se ver\xE1n envueltos en la mec\xE1nica del juego."
