  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 1441730826629198085}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "An expensive italian restaurant in the ritzy part of the Twatch server. Long
    wait times, and cost is per plate of food. \n\nI hope the breadsticks are good\u2026\n"
  - "Ein teures italienisches Restaurant im noblen Teil des Twatch-Servers. Lange
    Wartezeiten und die Kosten betragen pro Teller Essen. \n\nIch hoffe, die Grissini
    sind gut..."
  - "Twatch \u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u306E\u8C6A\u83EF\u306A\u30A8\u30EA\u30A2\u306B\u3042\u308B\u9AD8\u7D1A\u30A4\u30BF\u30EA\u30A2\u30F3
    \u30EC\u30B9\u30C8\u30E9\u30F3\u3002\u5F85\u3061\u6642\u9593\u304C\u9577\u304F\u3001\u6599\u91D1\u306F\u6599\u7406\u4E00\u76BF\u3042\u305F\u308A\u306E\u6599\u91D1\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u30B9\u30C6\u30A3\u30C3\u30AF\u30D1\u30F3\u304C\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u3044\u3068\u3044\u3044\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304C\u2026"
  - "Un restaurante italiano caro en la parte lujosa del servidor Twatch. Tiempos
    de espera largos y el costo es por plato de comida. \n\nEspero que los palitos
    de pan est\xE9n buenos..."
