--- !u!114 &1544473124553301710
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 387179702304992750}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 2312782008832564245}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Height:  5\u2019 5\u201D (165 CM)\nWeight:  115 Pounds ( 52KG)\nBloodtype: O-\n\nLikes:
    \n* Knitting * Naps * Iced Coffee * Rain * Big Dogs\n\nDislikes: \n\n* Hot Weather
    * Bright Lights * Early Mornings * Really Long Cutscenes*\n"
  - "H\xF6he: 5 Fu\xDF 10 Zoll (178 cm)\nGewicht: 175 Pfund (82 kg)\nBlutgruppe:
    AB-\n\nGef\xE4llt mir: \n\n* Hei\xDFe B\xE4der * Thunfischpizza * Fanfics lesen
    * Fesselnde Geschichten * Rum * \n\nAbneigungen: \n\n* Heuchler * Kalte Duschen
    * Sommer * M\xFCcken * Langeweile * Bethesda *"
  - "\u8EAB\u9577: 5' 5\" (165 \u30BB\u30F3\u30C1\u30E1\u30FC\u30C8\u30EB)\n\u91CD\u91CF:
    115 \u30DD\u30F3\u30C9 (52KG)\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B\uFF1AO-\n\n\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E:
    \n* \u7DE8\u307F\u7269 * \u304A\u663C\u5BDD * \u30A2\u30A4\u30B9\u30B3\u30FC\u30D2\u30FC
    * \u96E8 * \u5927\u578B\u72AC\n\n\u5ACC\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E\uFF1A \n\n* \u6691\u3044\u5929\u5019
    * \u660E\u308B\u3044\u5149 * \u65E9\u671D * \u975E\u5E38\u306B\u9577\u3044\u30AB\u30C3\u30C8\u30B7\u30FC\u30F3
    *"
  - "Altura: 5' 5\" (165 CM)\nPeso: 115 libras (52 kg)\nTipo de sangre: O-\n\nGustos:
    \n* Tejer * Siestas * Caf\xE9 helado * Lluvia * Perros grandes\n\nNo le gusta:
    \n\n* Clima c\xE1lido * Luces brillantes * Temprano en la ma\xF1ana * Escenas
    realmente largas *"
