  text: {fileID: 2769983388061831149}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Nestled in what looks like New York City back alley, the punk bar is surrounded
    by buildings with scaffolding. \n\n"
  - "Die Punkbar liegt in einer Seitengasse von New York City und ist von Geb\xE4uden
    mit Ger\xFCsten umgeben."
  - "\u30CB\u30E5\u30FC\u30E8\u30FC\u30AF\u306E\u8DEF\u5730\u88CF\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u5834\u6240\u306B\u4F47\u3080\u30D1\u30F3\u30AF\u30D0\u30FC\u306F\u3001\u8DB3\u5834\u304C\u7D44\u307E\u308C\u305F\u5EFA\u7269\u306B\u56F2\u307E\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3002"
  - "Ubicado en lo que parece un callej\xF3n de la ciudad de Nueva York, el bar punk
    est\xE1 rodeado de edificios con andamios."
