--- !u!114 &6515487485379303726
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 614344052878962562}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 1825931786119623515}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Since the advent of the new internet, with the inclusion of high level AI programs,
    and synthgens, whispers in chat rooms have increased about residue \u2018ghosts\u2019
    ; entities that you see from the corner of your eye. \n"
  - "Seit dem Aufkommen des neuen Internets, mit der Einbindung von hochentwickelten
    KI-Programmen und Synthgenen, hat sich in Chatrooms das Gefl\xFCster \xFCber
    \u201ER\xFCckstandsgeister\u201C verst\xE4rkt; Entit\xE4ten, die Sie aus dem
    Augenwinkel sehen."
  - "\u9AD8\u30EC\u30D9\u30EB\u306E AI \u30D7\u30ED\u30B0\u30E9\u30E0\u3084\u30B7\u30F3\u30BB\u30B8\u30A7\u30F3\u304C\u7D44\u307F\u8FBC\u307E\u308C\u305F\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306E\u51FA\u73FE\u4EE5\u6765\u3001\u30C1\u30E3\u30C3\u30C8
    \u30EB\u30FC\u30E0\u3067\u306E\u6B8B\u7559\u7269\u300C\u30B4\u30FC\u30B9\u30C8\u300D\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u306E\u3055\u3055\u3084\u304D\u304C\u5897\u52A0\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u76EE\u306E\u7AEF\u304B\u3089\u898B\u3048\u308B\u5B9F\u4F53\u3002"
  - "Desde la llegada de la nueva Internet, con la inclusi\xF3n de programas de inteligencia
    artificial de alto nivel y sintetizadores, han aumentado los rumores en las salas
    de chat sobre los residuos \u201Cfantasmas\u201D; entidades que ves por el rabillo
    del ojo."
