--- !u!114 &877105898871185605
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 656124313491656720}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7604931764426336955}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "A lab tech working at Digital Horizons. He is bright, easy to talk to, and driven
    to unravel any mystery in the digital world, even at the cost of his own health.
    \n\nHe thoroughly considers every detail before he makes decisions. \n\nShirobi\u2019s
    friends mean a lot to him. He maintains social relationships almost religiously.
    \n\nHis work is his life though. Puzzles consume his curiosity until he solves
    them. \n"
  - "Ein Labortechniker, der bei Digital Horizons arbeitet. Er ist klug, man kann
    leicht mit ihm reden und er ist bestrebt, jedes Geheimnis in der digitalen Welt
    zu l\xFCften, auch wenn es dabei auf Kosten seiner eigenen Gesundheit geht. \n\nEr
    denkt gr\xFCndlich \xFCber jedes Detail nach, bevor er Entscheidungen trifft.
    \n\nShirobis Freunde bedeuten ihm sehr viel. Er pflegt soziale Beziehungen fast
    religi\xF6s. \n\nSeine Arbeit ist jedoch sein Leben. R\xE4tsel fesseln seine
    Neugier, bis er sie l\xF6st."
  - "Digital Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u3067\u50CD\u304F\u30E9\u30DC\u6280\u8853\u8005\u3002\u5F7C\u306F\u660E\u308B\u304F\u3001\u8A71\u3057\u3084\u3059\u304F\u3001\u305F\u3068\u3048\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u5065\u5EB7\u3092\u72A0\u7272\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3067\u3082\u3001\u30C7\u30B8\u30BF\u30EB\u4E16\u754C\u306E\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308B\u8B0E\u3092\u89E3\u304D\u660E\u304B\u305D\u3046\u3068\u3059\u308B\u610F\u6B32\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u5F7C\u306F\u6C7A\u65AD\u3092\u4E0B\u3059\u524D\u306B\u3001\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308B\u7D30\u90E8\u3092\u5FB9\u5E95\u7684\u306B\u691C\u8A0E\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u30B7\u30ED\u30D3\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u53CB\u9054\u306F\u3068\u3066\u3082\u5927\u5207\u306A\u5B58\u5728\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5F7C\u306F\u307B\u3068\u3093\u3069\u5B97\u6559\u7684\u306B\u793E\u4F1A\u7684\u95A2\u4FC2\u3092\u7DAD\u6301\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3001\u5F7C\u306E\u4ED5\u4E8B\u306F\u5F7C\u306E\u4EBA\u751F\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30D1\u30BA\u30EB\u306F\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3092\u89E3\u304F\u307E\u3067\u5F7C\u306E\u597D\u5947\u5FC3\u3092\u6D88\u8017\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Un t\xE9cnico de laboratorio que trabaja en Digital Horizons. Es brillante,
    f\xE1cil de hablar y est\xE1 motivado a desentra\xF1ar cualquier misterio en
    el mundo digital, incluso a costa de su propia salud. \n\nConsidera minuciosamente
    cada detalle antes de tomar decisiones. \n\nLos amigos de Shirobi significan
    mucho para \xE9l. Mantiene relaciones sociales casi religiosamente. \n\nAunque
    su trabajo es su vida. Los acertijos consumen su curiosidad hasta que los resuelve."
