--- !u!114 &8322743897971179317
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 715951983037900818}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 8305773446200840156}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Where all of the big wigs conduct their 10-hour teleconference meetings using
    crappy software, this is where Cliff sits. \n\nHis personal office is a corner
    office: what you would love to have if you worked here for 10 years. \n\nAssorted
    pictures of his extended family sprinkle the entire office: on walls, on his
    desk, and trophy shelf. \n\nA laptop approved for top secret experiments sits
    on his desk. It is top of the line with full holographic screen projectors. "
  - "Dort, wo alle gro\xDFen K\xF6pfe ihre 10-st\xFCndigen Telefonkonferenzen mit
    beschissener Software abhalten, sitzt Cliff. \n\nSein pers\xF6nliches B\xFCro
    ist ein Eckb\xFCro: das, was Sie gerne h\xE4tten, wenn Sie 10 Jahre hier arbeiten
    w\xFCrden. \n\nVerschiedene Bilder seiner Gro\xDFfamilie schm\xFCcken das gesamte
    B\xFCro: an den W\xE4nden, auf seinem Schreibtisch und auf dem Troph\xE4enregal.
    \n\nAuf seinem Schreibtisch steht ein Laptop, der f\xFCr streng geheime Experimente
    zugelassen ist. Mit vollst\xE4ndig holografischen Bildschirmprojektoren ist es
    das Spitzenmodell."
  - "\u5927\u624B\u4F01\u696D\u304C\u5168\u54E1\u3001\u7C97\u60AA\u306A\u30BD\u30D5\u30C8\u30A6\u30A7\u30A2\u3092\u4F7F\u7528\u3057\u3066
    10 \u6642\u9593\u306E\u96FB\u8A71\u4F1A\u8B70\u3092\u884C\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u5834\u6240\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u3053\u3053\u306F\u30AF\u30EA\u30D5\u304C\u5EA7\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u5834\u6240\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u5F7C\u306E\u500B\u4EBA\u30AA\u30D5\u30A3\u30B9\u306F\u89D2\u306E\u30AA\u30D5\u30A3\u30B9\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3053\u3053\u3067
    10 \u5E74\u50CD\u3044\u305F\u3089\u61A7\u308C\u308B\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u5F7C\u306E\u5927\u5BB6\u65CF\u306E\u3055\u307E\u3056\u307E\u306A\u5199\u771F\u304C\u30AA\u30D5\u30A3\u30B9\u5168\u4F53\u3001\u58C1\u3001\u673A\u3001\u30C8\u30ED\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u306E\u68DA\u306B\u6563\u3089\u3070\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u5F7C\u306E\u673A\u306E\u4E0A\u306B\u306F\u3001\u6975\u79D8\u5B9F\u9A13\u7528\u306B\u627F\u8A8D\u3055\u308C\u305F\u30E9\u30C3\u30D7\u30C8\u30C3\u30D7\u304C\u7F6E\u304B\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u30D5\u30EB\u30DB\u30ED\u30B0\u30E9\u30D5\u30A3\u30C3\u30AF\u30B9\u30AF\u30EA\u30FC\u30F3\u30D7\u30ED\u30B8\u30A7\u30AF\u30BF\u30FC\u306E\u6700\u4E0A\u4F4D\u6A5F\u7A2E\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - "Donde todos los peces gordos llevan a cabo sus reuniones de teleconferencia
    de 10 horas utilizando un software de mala calidad, aqu\xED es donde se sienta
    Cliff. \n\nSu oficina personal es una oficina de esquina: lo que le encantar\xEDa
    tener si trabajara aqu\xED durante 10 a\xF1os. \n\nUna variedad de fotograf\xEDas
    de su familia extendida salpican toda la oficina: en las paredes, en su escritorio
    y en el estante de trofeos. \n\nSobre su escritorio hay un ordenador port\xE1til
    aprobado para experimentos ultrasecretos. Es lo mejor en proyectores de pantalla
    hologr\xE1fica completa."
