--- !u!114 &7778320308767455875
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 791577382435037915}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7067391036058743219}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Using the Dead Man\u2019s Switch (See Digital Horizons or VR for more information),
    players can make \u201Cprofiles\u201D of their own brain to save into the CPU
    Module or upload into the internet to occupy their own space, labeled \u201Cdomains.\u201D
    (See Internet Theory)\n\nAt the very beginning, most of the time these were just
    residue from users spending too much time in the 3D space. The shadows would
    fade over a short period of time and vanish. \n\nResearchers are still actively
    searching for evidence, but the current theory states that the patterns degrade
    over time due to lack of cohesion. "
  - "Mithilfe des Dead Man\u2019s Switch (weitere Informationen finden Sie unter
    \u201EDigital Horizons\u201C oder \u201EVR\u201C) k\xF6nnen Spieler \u201EProfile\u201C
    ihres eigenen Gehirns erstellen, um sie im CPU-Modul zu speichern oder ins Internet
    hochzuladen, um dort ihren eigenen Bereich zu belegen, der als \u201EDom\xE4nen\u201C
    bezeichnet wird. (Siehe Internet-Theorie)\n\nZu Beginn waren dies meist nur \xDCberbleibsel
    davon, dass Benutzer zu viel Zeit im 3D-Raum verbrachten. Die Schatten w\xFCrden
    innerhalb kurzer Zeit verblassen und verschwinden. \n\nForscher suchen immer
    noch aktiv nach Beweisen, aber die aktuelle Theorie besagt, dass sich die Muster
    aufgrund mangelnder Koh\xE4sion mit der Zeit verschlechtern."
  - "Dead Man\u2019s Switch (\u8A73\u7D30\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u306F Digital Horizo\u200B\u200Bns
    \u307E\u305F\u306F VR \u3092\u53C2\u7167) \u3092\u4F7F\u7528\u3057\u3066\u3001\u30D7\u30EC\u30A4\u30E4\u30FC\u306F\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u8133\u306E\u300C\u30D7\u30ED\u30D5\u30A1\u30A4\u30EB\u300D\u3092\u4F5C\u6210\u3057\u3066
    CPU \u30E2\u30B8\u30E5\u30FC\u30EB\u306B\u4FDD\u5B58\u3057\u305F\u308A\u3001\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306B\u30A2\u30C3\u30D7\u30ED\u30FC\u30C9\u3057\u3066\u300C\u30C9\u30E1\u30A4\u30F3\u300D\u3068\u30E9\u30D9\u30EB\u4ED8\u3051\u3055\u308C\u305F\u72EC\u81EA\u306E\u30B9\u30DA\u30FC\u30B9\u3092\u5360\u6709\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002
    (\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u7406\u8AD6\u3092\u53C2\u7167)\n\n\u5F53\u521D\u3001\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306F\u307B\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306E\u5834\u5408\u3001\u30E6\u30FC\u30B6\u30FC\u304C
    3D \u7A7A\u9593\u3067\u6642\u9593\u3092\u8CBB\u3084\u3057\u3059\u304E\u305F\u7D50\u679C\u306E\u5358\u306A\u308B\u6B8B\u7559\u7269\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002\u5F71\u306F\u77ED\u671F\u9593\u3067\u8584\u304F\u306A\u308A\u3001\u6D88\u3048\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u7814\u7A76\u8005\u305F\u3061\u306F\u4F9D\u7136\u3068\u3057\u3066\u8A3C\u62E0\u3092\u7A4D\u6975\u7684\u306B\u63A2\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u304C\u3001\u73FE\u5728\u306E\u7406\u8AD6\u3067\u306F\u3001\u30D1\u30BF\u30FC\u30F3\u306F\u51DD\u96C6\u6027\u306E\u6B20\u5982\u306B\u3088\u308A\u6642\u9593\u306E\u7D4C\u904E\u3068\u3068\u3082\u306B\u52A3\u5316\u3059\u308B\u3068\u8FF0\u3079\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Usando Dead Man's Switch (consulte Digital Horizons o VR para obtener m\xE1s
    informaci\xF3n), los jugadores pueden crear \"perfiles\" de su propio cerebro
    para guardarlos en el m\xF3dulo de la CPU o cargarlos en Internet para ocupar
    su propio espacio, denominado \"dominios\". (Ver Teor\xEDa de Internet)\n\nAl
    principio, la mayor\xEDa de las veces eran simplemente residuos de usuarios que
    pasaban demasiado tiempo en el espacio 3D. Las sombras se desvanecer\xEDan en
    un corto per\xEDodo de tiempo y desaparecer\xEDan. \n\nLos investigadores todav\xEDa
    est\xE1n buscando activamente evidencia, pero la teor\xEDa actual afirma que
    los patrones se degradan con el tiempo debido a la falta de cohesi\xF3n."
