--- !u!114 &3572694070906582556
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1037542123970798577}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 967066952790987689}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "We defeated faster than light communication through quantum entanglement techniques,
    so no lag live streaming from the Moon, maybe even further!\n\n\u201CThe proper
    way to utilize technology, if we do say ourselves.\u201D , exclaims Humanity.
    \n\LThe tech is still only safe for communications, but many Star Trek fans are
    trying buy the trademark, \u201CThe United Federation of Planets.\u201D\n\n At
    least we have something to fight about right? \n"
  - "Wir haben die \xFCberlichtschnelle Kommunikation durch Quantenverschr\xE4nkungstechniken
    besiegt, sodass es beim Live-Streaming vom Mond keine Verz\xF6gerung gibt, vielleicht
    sogar noch weiter!\n\n\u201EDer richtige Weg, Technologie zu nutzen, wenn wir
    es selbst sagen.\u201C , ruft die Menschheit aus. \n\LDie Technologie ist immer
    noch nur f\xFCr die Kommunikation sicher, aber viele Star Trek-Fans versuchen,
    die Marke \u201EThe United Federation of Planets\u201C zu kaufen.\n\n Zumindest
    haben wir etwas, wor\xFCber wir streiten k\xF6nnen, oder?"
  - "\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306F\u91CF\u5B50\u3082\u3064\u308C\u6280\u8853\u306B\u3088\u3063\u3066\u5149\u3088\u308A\u3082\u901F\u3044\u901A\u4FE1\u3092\u7834\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3067\u3001\u6708\u304B\u3089\u306E\u30E9\u30A4\u30D6
    \u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DF\u30F3\u30B0\u306B\u9045\u5EF6\u306F\u306A\u304F\u3001\u304A\u305D\u3089\u304F\u305D\u308C\u4EE5\u4E0A\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\n\n\u300C\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u81EA\u8EAB\u304C\u8A00\u3046\u306E\u3067\u3042\u308C\u3070\u3001\u30C6\u30AF\u30CE\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u3092\u6D3B\u7528\u3059\u308B\u6B63\u3057\u3044\u65B9\u6CD5\u3067\u3059\u3002\u300D\u3068\u4EBA\u985E\u306F\u53EB\u3076\u3002
    \n\L\u3053\u306E\u6280\u8853\u306F\u307E\u3060\u901A\u4FE1\u306B\u306E\u307F\u5B89\u5168\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u591A\u304F\u306E\u30B9\u30BF\u30FC\u30C8\u30EC\u30C3\u30AF\u30D5\u30A1\u30F3\u306F\u300C\u60D1\u661F\u9023\u5408\u300D\u3068\u3044\u3046\u5546\u6A19\u3092\u8CB7\u304A\u3046\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\n
    \u5C11\u306A\u304F\u3068\u3082\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306B\u306F\u4E89\u3046\u3079\u304D\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3088\u306D\uFF1F"
  - "Hemos derrotado la comunicaci\xF3n m\xE1s r\xE1pida que la luz a trav\xE9s de
    t\xE9cnicas de entrelazamiento cu\xE1ntico, por lo que no hay demoras en la transmisi\xF3n
    en vivo desde la Luna, \xA1tal vez incluso m\xE1s!\n\n\"La forma correcta de
    utilizar la tecnolog\xEDa, si lo decimos nosotros mismos\". , exclama la Humanidad.
    \n\LLa tecnolog\xEDa todav\xEDa s\xF3lo es segura para las comunicaciones, pero
    muchos fan\xE1ticos de Star Trek est\xE1n intentando comprar la marca registrada
    \"La Federaci\xF3n Unida de Planetas\".\n\n Al menos tenemos algo por qu\xE9
    pelear, \xBFverdad?"
