--- !u!114 &4737920454807335427
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1148961653135745264}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7538762422248880510}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Conversion to a digital signal caused a bit of interference and lowered the
    quality of the signals. Although these digital signals were miles ahead of any
    screen or headphones, the human brain can tell. \n\nThese \u2018flaws\u2019 end
    up being a feature. \n\nThe brain can tell it\u2019s not real. If someone decided
    to do something questionable to you in the in the internet, it would\u2019t affect
    you as strongly. \n\nDigital Horizon considered the worst: torture using their
    products. \n\nThe Dive became the focus of both fascination, and apprehension. "
  - "Die Umwandlung in ein digitales Signal verursachte einige St\xF6rungen und verschlechterte
    die Qualit\xE4t der Signale. Obwohl diese digitalen Signale jedem Bildschirm
    oder Kopfh\xF6rer meilenweit voraus waren, erkennt das menschliche Gehirn dies.
    \n\nDiese \u201EM\xE4ngel\u201C werden letztendlich zu einem Merkmal. \n\nDas
    Gehirn kann erkennen, dass es nicht real ist. Wenn jemand beschlie\xDFt, Ihnen
    im Internet etwas Fragw\xFCrdiges anzutun, w\xFCrde es Sie nicht so stark treffen.
    \n\nDigital Horizon betrachtete das Schlimmste: Folter mit ihren Produkten. \n\nDer
    Tauchgang wurde zum Mittelpunkt sowohl der Faszination als auch der Besorgnis."
  - "\u30C7\u30B8\u30BF\u30EB\u4FE1\u53F7\u306B\u5909\u63DB\u3059\u308B\u3068\u3001\u591A\u5C11\u306E\u5E72\u6E09\u304C\u767A\u751F\u3057\u3001\u4FE1\u53F7\u306E\u54C1\u8CEA\u304C\u4F4E\u4E0B\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306E\u30C7\u30B8\u30BF\u30EB\u4FE1\u53F7\u306F\u3069\u306E\u30B9\u30AF\u30EA\u30FC\u30F3\u3084\u30D8\u30C3\u30C9\u30D5\u30A9\u30F3\u3088\u308A\u3082\u306F\u308B\u304B\u306B\u5148\u3092\u884C\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u3001\u4EBA\u9593\u306E\u8133\u306F\u305D\u308C\u3092\u8A8D\u8B58\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306E\u300C\u6B20\u9665\u300D\u306F\u6700\u7D42\u7684\u306B\u306F\u6A5F\u80FD\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u8133\u306F\u305D\u308C\u304C\u672C\u7269\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3068\u5224\u65AD\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002\u8AB0\u304B\u304C\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u4E0A\u3067\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u5BFE\u3057\u3066\u7591\u308F\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3057\u305F\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3001\u305D\u308C\u306F\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u305D\u308C\u307B\u3069\u5F37\u3044\u5F71\u97FF\u3092\u4E0E\u3048\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002
    \n\nDigital Horizo\u200B\u200Bn \u306F\u3001\u81EA\u793E\u88FD\u54C1\u3092\u4F7F\u7528\u3057\u305F\u62F7\u554F\u304C\u6700\u60AA\u3067\u3042\u308B\u3068\u8003\u3048\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u30C0\u30A4\u30D3\u30F3\u30B0\u306F\u3001\u9B45\u529B\u3068\u4E0D\u5B89\u306E\u4E21\u65B9\u306E\u7126\u70B9\u3068\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "La conversi\xF3n a una se\xF1al digital provoc\xF3 un poco de interferencia
    y redujo la calidad de las se\xF1ales. Aunque estas se\xF1ales digitales estaban
    muy por delante de cualquier pantalla o auricular, el cerebro humano puede notarlo.
    \n\nEstos 'defectos' acaban siendo una caracter\xEDstica. \n\nEl cerebro puede
    decir que no es real. Si alguien decidiera hacerte algo cuestionable en Internet,
    no te afectar\xEDa tanto. \n\nDigital Horizon consider\xF3 lo peor: la tortura
    utilizando sus productos. \n\nLa inmersi\xF3n se convirti\xF3 en el foco de fascinaci\xF3n
    y aprensi\xF3n."
