--- !u!114 &2009786766870433865
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1149541515080464024}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7939218054710834477}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Virtual Worlds finally had the proper hardware to take over the standard internet.
    \n\nThe adoption rate was insane: ticket sales for online concerts, backpacking
    trips to Mt Everest over the weekend, online college courses in the middle of
    a volcano\u2026\n\nCPU modules with different specs for different purposes were
    fabricated. Even the governments of the world made higher security versions to
    carry highly classified information. \n\nThe use of the human body as a battery
    had many novel uses outside of the virtual reality space. \n"
  - "Virtual Worlds verf\xFCgte endlich \xFCber die richtige Hardware, um das Standard-Internet
    zu ersetzen. \n\nDie Akzeptanzrate war wahnsinnig: Ticketverk\xE4ufe f\xFCr Online-Konzerte,
    Rucksackreisen zum Mt. Everest am Wochenende, Online-College-Kurse mitten in
    einem Vulkan \u2026\n\nEs wurden CPU-Module mit unterschiedlichen Spezifikationen
    f\xFCr unterschiedliche Zwecke hergestellt. Sogar die Regierungen der Welt haben
    Versionen mit h\xF6herer Sicherheit entwickelt, um streng geheime Informationen
    zu transportieren. \n\nDie Nutzung des menschlichen K\xF6rpers als Batterie hatte
    viele neuartige Einsatzm\xF6glichkeiten au\xDFerhalb des Virtual-Reality-Bereichs."
  - "\u4EEE\u60F3\u4E16\u754C\u306F\u3001\u6A19\u6E96\u306E\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u3092\u5F15\u304D\u7D99\u3050\u305F\u3081\u306E\u9069\u5207\u306A\u30CF\u30FC\u30C9\u30A6\u30A7\u30A2\u3092\u3064\u3044\u306B\u624B\u306B\u5165\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u305D\u306E\u5C0E\u5165\u7387\u306F\u9A5A\u7570\u7684\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002\u30AA\u30F3\u30E9\u30A4\u30F3
    \u30B3\u30F3\u30B5\u30FC\u30C8\u306E\u30C1\u30B1\u30C3\u30C8\u8CA9\u58F2\u3001\u9031\u672B\u306E\u30A8\u30D9\u30EC\u30B9\u30C8\u3078\u306E\u30D0\u30C3\u30AF\u30D1\u30C3\u30AD\u30F3\u30B0\u65C5\u884C\u3001\u706B\u5C71\u306E\u771F\u3093\u4E2D\u3067\u306E\u30AA\u30F3\u30E9\u30A4\u30F3\u5927\u5B66\u30B3\u30FC\u30B9\u2026\u3002\n\n\u7528\u9014\u306B\u5FDC\u3058\u3066\u4ED5\u69D8\u306E\u7570\u306A\u308BCPU\u30E2\u30B8\u30E5\u30FC\u30EB\u3092\u88FD\u4F5C\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u4E16\u754C\u306E\u653F\u5E9C\u3067\u3055\u3048\u3001\u9AD8\u5EA6\u306A\u6A5F\u5BC6\u60C5\u5831\u3092\u904B\u3076\u305F\u3081\u306B\u3001\u3088\u308A\u30BB\u30AD\u30E5\u30EA\u30C6\u30A3\u306E\u9AD8\u3044\u30D0\u30FC\u30B8\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u4F5C\u6210\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u4EBA\u4F53\u3092\u30D0\u30C3\u30C6\u30EA\u30FC\u3068\u3057\u3066\u4F7F\u7528\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3001\u4EEE\u60F3\u73FE\u5B9F\u7A7A\u9593\u4EE5\u5916\u306B\u3082\u591A\u304F\u306E\u65AC\u65B0\u306A\u7528\u9014\u3092\u3082\u305F\u3089\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Virtual Worlds finalmente ten\xEDa el hardware adecuado para hacerse cargo de
    Internet est\xE1ndar. \n\nLa tasa de adopci\xF3n fue incre\xEDble: venta de entradas
    para conciertos en l\xEDnea, viajes con mochila al Monte Everest durante el fin
    de semana, cursos universitarios en l\xEDnea en medio de un volc\xE1n...\n\nSe
    fabricaron m\xF3dulos de CPU con diferentes especificaciones para diferentes
    prop\xF3sitos. Incluso los gobiernos del mundo hicieron versiones de mayor seguridad
    para transportar informaci\xF3n altamente clasificada. \n\nEl uso del cuerpo
    humano como bater\xEDa tuvo muchos usos novedosos fuera del espacio de la realidad
    virtual."
