--- !u!114 &230460035736056194
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1153519403640561532}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7419953061349093203}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "With fiber optic cables threaded through your brain matter to the sensory parts
    of your brain, you can now see, touch, feel, smell, and taste in Virtual reality
    using your own senses. \n\nNo batteries were required: the chips were ran by
    the body\u2019s metabolism. \n\nDigital Horizons refers to this chip as the Dead
    Man\u2019s Chip.\n\nNo Screens. \n\nTo be fair though, the signals were not as
    potent as if you would feel in the real world. And for good reason!\n\nThe signal
    inputs were biochemical. "
  - "Mit Glasfaserkabeln, die durch Ihre Gehirnmasse zu den sensorischen Teilen Ihres
    Gehirns f\xFChren, k\xF6nnen Sie jetzt mit Ihren eigenen Sinnen in der virtuellen
    Realit\xE4t sehen, ber\xFChren, f\xFChlen, riechen und schmecken. \n\nEs waren
    keine Batterien erforderlich: Die Chips wurden vom Stoffwechsel des K\xF6rpers
    betrieben. \n\nDigital Horizons bezeichnet diesen Chip als \u201EDead Man\u2019s
    Chip\u201C.\n\nKeine Bildschirme. \n\nFairerweise muss man allerdings sagen,
    dass die Signale nicht so stark waren, wie wenn man sie in der realen Welt sp\xFCren
    w\xFCrde. Und das aus gutem Grund!\n\nDie Signaleing\xE4nge waren biochemischer
    Natur."
  - "\u8133\u7269\u8CEA\u3092\u901A\u3063\u3066\u8133\u306E\u611F\u899A\u90E8\u5206\u306B\u5149\u30D5\u30A1\u30A4\u30D0\u30FC
    \u30B1\u30FC\u30D6\u30EB\u3092\u901A\u3059\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3001\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u611F\u899A\u3092\u4F7F\u3063\u3066\u4EEE\u60F3\u73FE\u5B9F\u306E\u4E2D\u3067\u898B\u305F\u308A\u3001\u89E6\u3063\u305F\u308A\u3001\u611F\u3058\u305F\u308A\u3001\u55C5\u3044\u3060\u308A\u3001\u5473\u308F\u3063\u305F\u308A\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u96FB\u6C60\u306F\u5FC5\u8981\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u306F\u4F53\u306E\u4EE3\u8B1D\u306B\u3088\u3063\u3066\u4F5C\u52D5\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\nDigital Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u3067\u306F\u3001\u3053\u306E\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u3092
    Dead Man\u2019s Chip \u3068\u547C\u3093\u3067\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\n\u30B9\u30AF\u30EA\u30FC\u30F3\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002
    \n\n\u305F\u3060\u3057\u3001\u516C\u5E73\u3092\u671F\u3059\u305F\u3081\u306B\u8A00\u3046\u3068\u3001\u305D\u306E\u4FE1\u53F7\u306F\u73FE\u5B9F\u4E16\u754C\u3067\u611F\u3058\u308B\u307B\u3069\u5F37\u529B\u3067\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002\u305D\u308C\u306B\u306F\u6B63\u5F53\u306A\u7406\u7531\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\n\u4FE1\u53F7\u5165\u529B\u306F\u751F\u5316\u5B66\u7684\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Con cables de fibra \xF3ptica conectados a trav\xE9s de la materia cerebral
    hasta las partes sensoriales de su cerebro, ahora puede ver, tocar, sentir, oler
    y saborear en realidad virtual utilizando sus propios sentidos. \n\nNo se necesitaban
    pilas: los chips funcionaban gracias al metabolismo del cuerpo. \n\nDigital Horizons
    se refiere a este chip como el chip del hombre muerto.\n\nSin pantallas. \n\nSin
    embargo, para ser justos, las se\xF1ales no eran tan potentes como las que sentir\xEDas
    en el mundo real. \xA1Y con raz\xF3n!\n\nLas entradas de se\xF1ales eran bioqu\xEDmicas."
