--- !u!114 &6139131427916944784
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1334591196327334812}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7943201549474193208}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Most denizens just meme the stories with creepy pastas, but there is always
    a kernel of truth embedded inside. Although people probably spend way too much
    time online and plugged in, it\u2019s normally not their entire life. \n\nIn
    some cases it isn\u2019t. \n"
  - "Die meisten Bewohner erinnern sich nur an die Geschichten mit gruseligen Nudeln,
    aber darin steckt immer ein K\xF6rnchen Wahrheit. Obwohl Menschen wahrscheinlich
    viel zu viel Zeit online und ans Stromnetz verbringen, ist das normalerweise
    nicht ihr ganzes Leben. \n\nIn einigen F\xE4llen ist dies nicht der Fall."
  - "\u307B\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306E\u4F4F\u4EBA\u306F\u305D\u306E\u8A71\u3092\u4E0D\u6C17\u5473\u306A\u30D1\u30B9\u30BF\u3067\u30DF\u30FC\u30E0\u5316\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u305D\u306E\u4E2D\u306B\u306F\u5E38\u306B\u771F\u5B9F\u306E\u6838\u304C\u57CB\u3081\u8FBC\u307E\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u4EBA\u3005\u306F\u304A\u305D\u3089\u304F\u30AA\u30F3\u30E9\u30A4\u30F3\u3084\u30D7\u30E9\u30B0\u30A4\u30F3\u306B\u3042\u307E\u308A\u306B\u3082\u591A\u304F\u306E\u6642\u9593\u3092\u8CBB\u3084\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u304C\u3001\u901A\u5E38\u3001\u305D\u308C\u304C\u4EBA\u751F\u306E\u3059\u3079\u3066\u3067\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002
    \n\n\u5834\u5408\u306B\u3088\u3063\u3066\u306F\u305D\u3046\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "La mayor\xEDa de los habitantes simplemente hacen memes de las historias con
    pastas espeluznantes, pero siempre hay una pizca de verdad incrustada en su interior.
    Aunque la gente probablemente pasa demasiado tiempo en l\xEDnea y conectada,
    normalmente no es toda su vida. \n\nEn algunos casos no lo es."
--- !u!1 &1335785328551750544
