  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 3123652561513403312}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Height: 69 CM\nWeight: 2 WaterMelons\nBloodtype:\n\nLikes:\n \n* Chocolate Milk
    * Watermelon * Dinosaurs * GODZILLA *\n\n\nDislikes: \n\n* Cabbage * Raisins
    * Double Sided Tape *\n"
  - "H\xF6he: 69 cm\nGewicht: 2 Wassermelonen\nBlutgruppe:\n\nGef\xE4llt mir:\n \n*
    Schokoladenmilch * Wassermelone * Dinosaurier * GODZILLA *\n\n\nAbneigungen:
    \n\n* Kohl * Rosinen * Doppelseitiges Klebeband *"
  - "\u8EAB\u9577: 69 \u30BB\u30F3\u30C1\u30E1\u30FC\u30C8\u30EB\n\u91CD\u91CF: \u30B9\u30A4\u30AB
    2 \u500B\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B:\n\n\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E: \n\n* \u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u30EC\u30FC\u30C8\u30DF\u30EB\u30AF
    * \u30B9\u30A4\u30AB * \u6050\u7ADC * \u30B4\u30B8\u30E9 *\n\n\n\u5ACC\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E\uFF1A
    \n\n* \u30AD\u30E3\u30D9\u30C4 * \u30EC\u30FC\u30BA\u30F3 * \u4E21\u9762\u30C6\u30FC\u30D7
    *"
  - "Altura: 69CM\nPeso: 2 Sand\xEDas\nTipo de sangre:\n\nGustos:\n \n* Leche con
    Chocolate * Sand\xEDa * Dinosaurios * GODZILLA *\n\n\nNo le gusta: \n\n* Repollo
    * Pasas * Cinta de doble cara *"
