--- !u!114 &1908356135569782227
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544721036474227207}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 4497120294643375571}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Where you lost your digitation virginity. \n\nIt comprises of many top secret
    labs that conduct science for the betterment of Digital Horizons. It\u2019s where
    you start your internship. \n"
  - "Wo du deine digitale Jungfr\xE4ulichkeit verloren hast. \n\nEs besteht aus vielen
    streng geheimen Labors, die Wissenschaft zur Verbesserung des digitalen Horizonts
    betreiben. Hier beginnen Sie Ihr Praktikum."
  - "\u30C7\u30B8\u30BF\u30EB\u51E6\u5973\u3092\u5931\u3063\u305F\u5834\u6240\u3002
    \n\n\u3053\u308C\u306F\u3001\u30C7\u30B8\u30BF\u30EB \u30DB\u30E9\u30A4\u30BE\u30F3\u306E\u6539\u5584\u3092\u76EE\u7684\u3068\u3057\u305F\u79D1\u5B66\u3092\u5B9F\u65BD\u3059\u308B\u591A\u304F\u306E\u6975\u79D8\u7814\u7A76\u6240\u3067\u69CB\u6210\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u305D\u3053\u304B\u3089\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30F3\u30B7\u30C3\u30D7\u304C\u59CB\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Donde perdiste tu virginidad digital. \n\nSe compone de muchos laboratorios
    ultrasecretos que realizan ciencia para mejorar los horizontes digitales. Es
    donde comienzas tu pasant\xEDa."
