  languageValues:
  - "Height:  5\u2019 7\u201D (170 CM)\nWeight:  180 Pounds ( 82KG)\nBloodtype: AB+\n\nLikes:
    \n\n* Gaming * Hanging out with Friends * Collectables\n\nDislikes: \n\n* Vegetables
    * Disloyalty * Spiders *\n"
  - "H\xF6he: 5 Fu\xDF 7 Zoll (170 cm)\nGewicht: 180 Pfund (82 kg)\nBlutgruppe: AB+\n\nGef\xE4llt
    mir: \n\n* Gaming * Abh\xE4ngen mit Freunden * Sammlerst\xFCcke\n\nAbneigungen:
    \n\n* Gem\xFCse * Illoyalit\xE4t * Spinnen *"
  - "\u8EAB\u9577: 5' 7\" (170 CM)\n\u91CD\u91CF: 180 \u30DD\u30F3\u30C9 (82KG)\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B:
    AB+\n\n\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E: \n\n* \u30B2\u30FC\u30E0 * \u53CB\u9054\u3068\u51FA\u304B\u3051\u308B
    * \u53CE\u96C6\u54C1\n\n\u5ACC\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E\uFF1A \n\n* \u91CE\u83DC
    * \u4E0D\u8AA0\u5B9F * \u8718\u86DB *"
  - "Altura: 5' 7\" (170 CM)\nPeso: 180 libras (82 kg)\nTipo de sangre: AB+\n\nGustos:
    \n\n* Juegos * Salir con amigos * Coleccionables\n\nNo le gusta: \n\n*Verduras
    *Deslealtad *Ara\xF1as*"
