  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 8605126092389984192}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "A health food store that carries all kinds of ingredients from all over the
    globe. \n\nI guess if I want to cook, here is where I would get the ingredients.
    \n"
  - "Ein Naturkostladen, der alle m\xF6glichen Zutaten aus der ganzen Welt f\xFChrt.
    \n\nIch sch\xE4tze, wenn ich kochen m\xF6chte, besorge ich hier die Zutaten."
  - "\u4E16\u754C\u4E2D\u306E\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308B\u98DF\u6750\u3092\u53D6\u308A\u6271\u3046\u5065\u5EB7\u98DF\u54C1\u5E97\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u6599\u7406\u3092\u3059\u308B\u306A\u3089\u3053\u3053\u3067\u6750\u6599\u3092\u8ABF\u9054\u3059\u308B\u3068\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Una tienda naturista que vende todo tipo de ingredientes de todo el mundo. \n\nSupongo
    que si quiero cocinar, aqu\xED es donde conseguir\xEDa los ingredientes."
