  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7226038290062692768}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Height:  6\u2019 2\u201D (188 CM)\nWeight:  170 Pounds (77 KG)\nBloodtype: 
    I\u2019m a demon\u2026\n\nLikes: \n\n* Metal Music * Women * Anime *Video Games
    * Art *\n\nDislikes: \n\n* Drama * Bullies * People that do not use Common Sense
    *\n"
  - "H\xF6he: 6 Fu\xDF 2 Zoll (188 cm)\nGewicht: 170 Pfund (77 kg)\nBlutgruppe: Ich
    bin ein D\xE4mon ...\n\nGef\xE4llt mir: \n\n* Metal Musik * Frauen * Anime *Videospiele
    * Kunst *\n\nAbneigungen: \n\n* Drama * Tyrannen * Menschen, die keinen gesunden
    Menschenverstand nutzen *"
  - "\u8EAB\u9577: 6' 2\" (188 CM)\n\u91CD\u91CF: 170 \u30DD\u30F3\u30C9 (77 KG)\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B\uFF1A\u79C1\u306F\u60AA\u9B54\u3067\u3059\u2026\n\n\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E:
    \n\n* \u30E1\u30BF\u30EB\u30DF\u30E5\u30FC\u30B8\u30C3\u30AF * \u5973\u6027 *
    \u30A2\u30CB\u30E1 * \u30D3\u30C7\u30AA\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0 * \u30A2\u30FC\u30C8
    *\n\n\u5ACC\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E\uFF1A \n\n* \u30C9\u30E9\u30DE * \u3044\u3058\u3081
    * \u5E38\u8B58\u306E\u306A\u3044\u4EBA *"
  - "Altura: 6' 2\" (188 CM)\nPeso: 170 libras (77 kg)\nTipo de sangre: Soy un demonio...\n\nGustos:
    \n\n* M\xFAsica Metal * Mujeres * Anime * Videojuegos * Arte *\n\nNo le gusta:
    \n\n* Drama * Bullies * Personas que no usan el sentido com\xFAn *"
