  text: {fileID: 5654173733778397599}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Close to the Twatch Train Station, sits an incredible Sento named the Shibata
    Fumihi Bath House. \n\nLots of room, mixed sex bathing, and a Tea Room!"
  - "In der N\xE4he des Bahnhofs Twatch befindet sich ein unglaubliches Sento namens
    Shibata Fumihi Bath House. \n\nViel Platz, gemischtes Geschlechtsbad und eine
    Teestube!"
  - "\u30C8\u30A6\u30A9\u30C3\u30C1\u99C5\u306E\u8FD1\u304F\u306B\u3001\u67F4\u7530\u6587\u53F2\u6D74\u5834\u3068\u3044\u3046\u7D20\u6674\u3089\u3057\u3044\u92AD\u6E6F\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u90E8\u5C4B\u3082\u5E83\u304F\u3001\u6DF7\u6D74\u3001\u8336\u5BA4\u3082\u3042\u308A\uFF01"
  - "Cerca de la estaci\xF3n de tren de Twatch, se encuentra un incre\xEDble Sento
    llamado Shibata Fumihi Bath House. \n\n\xA1Mucho espacio, ba\xF1os mixtos y un
    sal\xF3n de t\xE9!"
