--- !u!114 &8580547428909409397
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2095904372375914033}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 8110616747771102282}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "In the summer of 2040 in New York City, Digital Horizons unveils it\u2019s newest
    technology: Full Dive. \n\nFull Dive is transferring a person\u2019s mind directly
    into the internet. During many tests, exams, and long-term research, the company
    has been working on mapping the brain in it\u2019s entirety to answer some questions\u2026\n\nWhat
    makes a memory? \n\nHow do emotions react in the brain?\n \nHow much of your
    thought is conscious?  \n\nDo the memories make the person? "
  - "Im Sommer 2040 stellt Digital Horizons in New York City seine neueste Technologie
    vor: Full Dive. \n\nFull Dive \xFCbertr\xE4gt die Gedanken einer Person direkt
    ins Internet. Im Rahmen zahlreicher Tests, Pr\xFCfungen und langfristiger Forschung
    hat das Unternehmen daran gearbeitet, das Gehirn in seiner Gesamtheit zu kartieren,
    um einige Fragen zu beantworten \u2026\n\nWas macht eine Erinnerung aus? \n\nWie
    reagieren Emotionen im Gehirn?\n \nWie viel von Ihrem Denken ist bewusst?  \n\nMachen
    Erinnerungen einen Menschen?"
  - "2040 \u5E74\u306E\u590F\u3001\u30CB\u30E5\u30FC\u30E8\u30FC\u30AF\u5E02\u3067\u3001Digital
    Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u306F\u6700\u65B0\u30C6\u30AF\u30CE\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u3067\u3042\u308B\u30D5\u30EB
    \u30C0\u30A4\u30D6\u3092\u767A\u8868\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002 \n\n\u30D5\u30EB\u30C0\u30A4\u30D6\u3068\u306F\u3001\u4EBA\u306E\u5FC3\u3092\u76F4\u63A5\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306B\u8EE2\u9001\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u3002\u591A\u304F\u306E\u30C6\u30B9\u30C8\u3001\u8A66\u9A13\u3001\u9577\u671F\u7814\u7A76\u3092\u901A\u3058\u3066\u3001\u540C\u793E\u306F\u3044\u304F\u3064\u304B\u306E\u8CEA\u554F\u306B\u7B54\u3048\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u8133\u5168\u4F53\u306E\u30DE\u30C3\u30D4\u30F3\u30B0\u306B\u53D6\u308A\u7D44\u3093\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3057\u305F\u2026\n\n\u4F55\u304C\u601D\u3044\u51FA\u3092\u4F5C\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F
    \n\n\u611F\u60C5\u306F\u8133\u5185\u3067\u3069\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306B\u53CD\u5FDC\u3059\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B?\n
    \n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u601D\u8003\u306E\u3069\u308C\u304F\u3089\u3044\u304C\u610F\u8B58\u7684\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F 
    \n\n\u601D\u3044\u51FA\u304C\u4EBA\u3092\u4F5C\u308B\u306E\u304B\uFF1F"
  - "En el verano de 2040 en la ciudad de Nueva York, Digital Horizons presenta su
    tecnolog\xEDa m\xE1s nueva: Full Dive. \n\nFull Dive consiste en transferir la
    mente de una persona directamente a Internet. Durante muchas pruebas, ex\xE1menes
    e investigaciones a largo plazo, la compa\xF1\xEDa ha estado trabajando en mapear
    el cerebro en su totalidad para responder algunas preguntas...\n\n\xBFQu\xE9
    constituye un recuerdo? \n\n\xBFC\xF3mo reaccionan las emociones en el cerebro?\n
    \n\xBFCu\xE1nto de tu pensamiento es consciente?  \n\n\xBFLos recuerdos hacen
    a la persona?"
