--- !u!114 &9086463739901877685
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2099799285959661079}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7040200213529541065}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "She started to request time off, access to outside connections (Yoobtube, twatch),
    and different foods / clothing to try out. \n\nThe access to outside information
    increased her functionality with customers, and in 2035, she requested the ability
    to live stream on twatch and yoobtube. \n\nGarnering national attention in Japan,
    she soon became a global phenomenon, with people flying to Japan just to ride
    on Aoi\u2019s Japan High Speed Rail. \n\n"
  - "Sie fing an, eine Auszeit, Zugang zu externen Kontakten (Yoobtube, Twatch) und
    verschiedene Lebensmittel/Kleidung zum Ausprobieren zu beantragen. \n\nDer Zugriff
    auf externe Informationen steigerte ihre Funktionalit\xE4t bei Kunden und im
    Jahr 2035 forderte sie die M\xF6glichkeit, Live-Streams auf Twatch und Yoobtube
    zu erm\xF6glichen. \n\nSie erregte in Japan landesweite Aufmerksamkeit und wurde
    bald zu einem globalen Ph\xE4nomen, da Menschen nach Japan flogen, nur um mit
    der Japan High Speed \u200B\u200BRail von Aoi zu fahren."
  - "\u5F7C\u5973\u306F\u4F11\u6687\u3001\u5916\u90E8\u63A5\u7D9A (Yoobtube\u3001twatch)
    \u3078\u306E\u30A2\u30AF\u30BB\u30B9\u3001\u3055\u307E\u3056\u307E\u306A\u98DF\u3079\u7269\u3084\u8863\u985E\u3092\u8A66\u3057\u3066\u307B\u3057\u3044\u3068\u8981\u6C42\u3057\u59CB\u3081\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u5916\u90E8\u60C5\u5831\u3078\u306E\u30A2\u30AF\u30BB\u30B9\u306B\u3088\u308A\u9867\u5BA2\u3068\u306E\u9023\u643A\u304C\u5F37\u5316\u3055\u308C\u30012035
    \u5E74\u306B\u306F twatch \u3068 yoobtube \u3067\u30E9\u30A4\u30D6 \u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DF\u30F3\u30B0\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8981\u6C42\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u65E5\u672C\u3067\u5168\u56FD\u7684\u306A\u6CE8\u76EE\u3092\u96C6\u3081\u3001\u5F7C\u5973\u306F\u3059\u3050\u306B\u4E16\u754C\u7684\u306A\u73FE\u8C61\u3068\u306A\u308A\u3001\u3042\u304A\u3044\u306E\u65E5\u672C\u9AD8\u901F\u9244\u9053\u306B\u4E57\u308B\u305F\u3081\u3060\u3051\u306B\u65E5\u672C\u306B\u98DB\u3076\u4EBA\u3082\u3044\u308B\u307B\u3069\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Comenz\xF3 a solicitar tiempo libre, acceso a conexiones externas (Yoobtube,
    twatch) y diferentes alimentos/ropa para probar. \n\nEl acceso a informaci\xF3n
    externa aument\xF3 su funcionalidad con los clientes y, en 2035, solicit\xF3
    la posibilidad de transmitir en vivo en twatch y yoobtube. \n\nAtrayendo atenci\xF3n
    nacional en Jap\xF3n, pronto se convirti\xF3 en un fen\xF3meno global, con gente
    volando a Jap\xF3n s\xF3lo para viajar en el tren de alta velocidad japon\xE9s
    de Aoi."
