--- !u!114 &8263087584493944107
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2195852896322992664}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 8418452399236912467}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "The culmination of decades of research. The first public test is you! Are you
    not thrilled?!\n\nThe Full Dive: not a headset. Not a new system of chips. Nothing
    like that. \n\nTransferring a human\u2019s mind directly into the internet. \n\nWhile
    we were enjoying all of the content with our new Dive Chips, we didn\u2019t expect
    it would help foster a new era of humanity. "
  - "Der H\xF6hepunkt jahrzehntelanger Forschung. Der erste \xF6ffentliche Test bist
    du! Bist du nicht begeistert?!\n\nThe Full Dive: kein Headset. Kein neues Chipsystem.
    Nichts dergleichen. \n\nDen Geist eines Menschen direkt ins Internet \xFCbertragen.
    \n\nObwohl wir alle Inhalte mit unseren neuen Dive Chips genossen haben, hatten
    wir nicht erwartet, dass sie dazu beitragen w\xFCrden, eine neue \xC4ra der Menschheit
    einzul\xE4uten."
  - "\u6570\u5341\u5E74\u306B\u308F\u305F\u308B\u7814\u7A76\u306E\u96C6\u5927\u6210\u3002\u6700\u521D\u306E\u516C\u958B\u30C6\u30B9\u30C8\u306F\u3042\u306A\u305F\u3067\u3059\uFF01\u30EF\u30AF\u30EF\u30AF\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304B\uFF1F\n\n\u30D5\u30EB\u30C0\u30A4\u30D6:
    \u30D8\u30C3\u30C9\u30BB\u30C3\u30C8\u3067\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u30B7\u30B9\u30C6\u30E0\u3067\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002
    \n\n\u4EBA\u9593\u306E\u7CBE\u795E\u3092\u76F4\u63A5\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306B\u8EE2\u9001\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306F\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u30C0\u30A4\u30D6\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u3067\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u30B3\u30F3\u30C6\u30F3\u30C4\u3092\u697D\u3057\u3093\u3067\u3044\u305F\u304C\u3001\u305D\u308C\u304C\u4EBA\u985E\u306E\u65B0\u6642\u4EE3\u306E\u80B2\u6210\u306B\u5F79\u7ACB\u3064\u3068\u306F\u4E88\u60F3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002"
  - "La culminaci\xF3n de d\xE9cadas de investigaci\xF3n. \xA1La primera prueba p\xFAblica
    eres t\xFA! \xBFNo est\xE1s emocionado?\n\nThe Full Dive: no son unos auriculares.
    No es un nuevo sistema de chips. Nada de eso. \n\nTransferir la mente de un humano
    directamente a Internet. \n\nMientras disfrut\xE1bamos de todo el contenido con
    nuestros nuevos Dive Chips, no esper\xE1bamos que ayudar\xEDa a fomentar una
    nueva era de la humanidad."
