  text: {fileID: 4946807947688869517}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Overlooking a massive sea, the beach is well known for its luxurious resorts,
    the crystal like sand, and active nightlife. \n\nGreat place for a BBQ!"
  - "Der Strand mit Blick auf ein riesiges Meer ist bekannt f\xFCr seine luxuri\xF6sen
    Resorts, den kristallklaren Sand und sein aktives Nachtleben. \n\nToller Ort
    zum Grillen!"
  - "\u5E83\u5927\u306A\u6D77\u3092\u898B\u6E21\u3059\u3053\u306E\u30D3\u30FC\u30C1\u306F\u3001\u8C6A\u83EF\u306A\u30EA\u30BE\u30FC\u30C8\u3001\u6C34\u6676\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u7802\u3001\u30A2\u30AF\u30C6\u30A3\u30D6\u306A\u30CA\u30A4\u30C8\u30E9\u30A4\u30D5\u3067\u3088\u304F\u77E5\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u30D0\u30FC\u30D9\u30AD\u30E5\u30FC\u306B\u6700\u9069\u306A\u5834\u6240\u3067\u3059\uFF01"
  - "Con vistas a un mar enorme, la playa es conocida por sus lujosos complejos tur\xEDsticos,
    su arena cristalina y su activa vida nocturna. \n\n\xA1Gran lugar para una barbacoa!"
