--- !u!114 &1529024524535746913
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2557082089365994499}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 3401367569009737036}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "In the year 2030, Digital Horizons was founded. As a budding startup in the
    Virtual Reality space, they emerged onto the world stage showing off a new type
    of server; one that allows input for touch, haptics, and in the future, smell,
    and taste. \n\nThe server platform was built different. Efficient, stable, and
    easy to modify, they became the standard quickly. \n"
  - "Im Jahr 2030 wurde Digital Horizons gegr\xFCndet. Als aufstrebendes Startup
    im Virtual-Reality-Bereich betraten sie die Weltb\xFChne und stellten einen neuen
    Servertyp vor; eine, die Eingaben f\xFCr Ber\xFChrung, Haptik und in Zukunft
    Geruch und Geschmack erm\xF6glicht. \n\nDie Serverplattform war anders aufgebaut.
    Effizient, stabil und einfach zu modifizieren, wurden sie schnell zum Standard."
  - "2030\u5E74\u3001Digital Horizo\u200B\u200Bns\u304C\u8A2D\u7ACB\u3055\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u4EEE\u60F3\u73FE\u5B9F\u5206\u91CE\u306E\u65B0\u9032\u6C17\u92ED\u306E\u30B9\u30BF\u30FC\u30C8\u30A2\u30C3\u30D7\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3001\u5F7C\u3089\u306F\u4E16\u754C\u306E\u821E\u53F0\u306B\u767B\u5834\u3057\u3001\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u30BF\u30A4\u30D7\u306E\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u3092\u62AB\u9732\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u89E6\u899A\u3001\u89E6\u899A\u3001\u305D\u3057\u3066\u5C06\u6765\u7684\u306B\u306F\u55C5\u899A\u3084\u5473\u899A\u306E\u5165\u529B\u304C\u53EF\u80FD\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC \u30D7\u30E9\u30C3\u30C8\u30D5\u30A9\u30FC\u30E0\u306F\u5225\u306E\u65B9\u6CD5\u3067\u69CB\u7BC9\u3055\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u52B9\u7387\u7684\u3067\u5B89\u5B9A\u3057\u3066\u304A\u308A\u3001\u5909\u66F4\u304C\u7C21\u5358\u306A\u305F\u3081\u3001\u3059\u3050\u306B\u6A19\u6E96\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "En el a\xF1o 2030 se fund\xF3 Digital Horizons. Como una startup en ciernes
    en el espacio de la Realidad Virtual, emergieron al escenario mundial mostrando
    un nuevo tipo de servidor; uno que permita entradas para el tacto, la sensaci\xF3n
    t\xE1ctil y, en el futuro, el olfato y el gusto. \n\nLa plataforma del servidor
    se construy\xF3 de manera diferente. Eficientes, estables y f\xE1ciles de modificar,
    se convirtieron r\xE1pidamente en el est\xE1ndar."
