--- !u!114 &517566255474114828
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2701412491930941035}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 5287721239859440883}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Maybe something we can\u2019t measure in the brain allows the patterns to solidify?\n\nOf
    course it was monetized. \n\nA few people made the decision to try and compartmentalize
    the brain patterns to slow down degradation. \n\nThis was only partially successful,
    even with CPU Module Upgrades to chips specifically designed to copy the brain\u2019s
    wave patterns. \n\nThus, synthgens became internet clones of popular personalities
    on the web.\n"
  - "Vielleicht sorgt etwas, das wir im Gehirn nicht messen k\xF6nnen, daf\xFCr,
    dass sich die Muster verfestigen?\n\nNat\xFCrlich wurde es monetarisiert. \n\nEinige
    Menschen beschlossen, die Gehirnmuster zu unterteilen, um den Abbau zu verlangsamen.
    \n\nDies war nur teilweise erfolgreich, selbst mit CPU-Modul-Upgrades auf Chips,
    die speziell daf\xFCr entwickelt wurden, die Wellenmuster des Gehirns zu kopieren.
    \n\nSo wurden Synthgene zu Internet-Klonen beliebter Pers\xF6nlichkeiten im Internet."
  - "\u304A\u305D\u3089\u304F\u8133\u5185\u3067\u6E2C\u5B9A\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044\u4F55\u304B\u304C\u30D1\u30BF\u30FC\u30F3\u3092\u56FA\u5B9A\u5316\u3055\u305B\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F\n\n\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u53CE\u76CA\u5316\u3082\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u6570\u4EBA\u306E\u4EBA\u3005\u306F\u3001\u5206\u89E3\u3092\u9045\u3089\u305B\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u8133\u306E\u30D1\u30BF\u30FC\u30F3\u3092\u533A\u5206\u5316\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u6C7A\u610F\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u3053\u308C\u306F\u3001\u8133\u6CE2\u30D1\u30BF\u30FC\u30F3\u3092\u30B3\u30D4\u30FC\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u7279\u5225\u306B\u8A2D\u8A08\u3055\u308C\u305F\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u3078\u306E
    CPU \u30E2\u30B8\u30E5\u30FC\u30EB\u306E\u30A2\u30C3\u30D7\u30B0\u30EC\u30FC\u30C9\u3092\u884C\u3063\u305F\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3001\u90E8\u5206\u7684\u306B\u3057\u304B\u6210\u529F\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u3053\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3001\u30B7\u30F3\u30BB\u30B8\u30A7\u30CD\u306F\u3001\u30A6\u30A7\u30D6\u4E0A\u3067\u4EBA\u6C17\u306E\u3042\u308B\u4EBA\u7269\u306E\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8
    \u30AF\u30ED\u30FC\u30F3\u3068\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "\xBFQuiz\xE1s algo que no podemos medir en el cerebro permite que los patrones
    se solidifiquen?\n\nPor supuesto que fue monetizado. \n\nAlgunas personas tomaron
    la decisi\xF3n de intentar compartimentar los patrones cerebrales para frenar
    la degradaci\xF3n. \n\nEsto solo tuvo un \xE9xito parcial, incluso con actualizaciones
    del m\xF3dulo de CPU a chips dise\xF1ados espec\xEDficamente para copiar los
    patrones de ondas del cerebro. \n\nAs\xED, los sintetizadores se convirtieron
    en clones de personalidades populares en la web."
