--- !u!114 &8212786573007310654
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2775384486130403332}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 3844613678316148412}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Their streams are normally more set up to induce an emotional response. Good
    examples are horror games, heart beat streams, laugh or lose streams, etc. \n\nThe
    pattern some moderators have noted is the consistency of their emotional state
    when they are swamped with viewers: the more viewers that react to their content,
    the more often they stream, and for longer times. \n\nSome theories have floated
    from the bottom of the internet that these are in fact real demons siphoning
    off of the emotions the humans produce. \n"
  - "Ihre Streams sind normalerweise eher darauf ausgerichtet, eine emotionale Reaktion
    hervorzurufen. Gute Beispiele sind Horrorspiele, Heartbeat-Streams, Lach-oder-Lose-Streams
    usw. \n\nDas Muster, das einige Moderatoren festgestellt haben, ist die Best\xE4ndigkeit
    ihres emotionalen Zustands, wenn sie von Zuschauern \xFCberschwemmt werden: Je
    mehr Zuschauer auf ihre Inhalte reagieren, desto h\xE4ufiger und l\xE4nger streamen
    sie. \n\nIm Internet kursieren einige Theorien, dass es sich tats\xE4chlich um
    echte D\xE4monen handelt, die die Emotionen der Menschen absch\xF6pfen."
  - "\u5F7C\u3089\u306E\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30E0\u306F\u901A\u5E38\u3001\u611F\u60C5\u7684\u306A\u53CD\u5FDC\u3092\u8A98\u767A\u3059\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u8A2D\u5B9A\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u826F\u3044\u4F8B\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306F\u3001\u30DB\u30E9\u30FC
    \u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u3001\u30CF\u30FC\u30C8\u30D3\u30FC\u30C8 \u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30E0\u3001\u7B11\u3046\u304B\u8CA0\u3051\u308B\u304B\u306E\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30E0\u306A\u3069\u304C\u6319\u3052\u3089\u308C\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u4E00\u90E8\u306E\u30E2\u30C7\u30EC\u30FC\u30BF\u304C\u6307\u6458\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u30D1\u30BF\u30FC\u30F3\u306F\u3001\u8996\u8074\u8005\u304C\u6BBA\u5230\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3068\u304D\u306E\u611F\u60C5\u72B6\u614B\u306E\u4E00\u8CAB\u6027\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3064\u307E\u308A\u3001\u30B3\u30F3\u30C6\u30F3\u30C4\u306B\u53CD\u5FDC\u3059\u308B\u8996\u8074\u8005\u304C\u5897\u3048\u308B\u307B\u3069\u3001\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DF\u30F3\u30B0\u306E\u983B\u5EA6\u3068\u6642\u9593\u304C\u9577\u304F\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306E\u5E95\u304B\u3089\u306F\u3001\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306F\u5B9F\u969B\u306B\u306F\u4EBA\u9593\u304C\u751F\u307F\u51FA\u3059\u611F\u60C5\u3092\u5438\u3044\u53D6\u308B\u672C\u7269\u306E\u60AA\u9B54\u3067\u3042\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3044\u304F\u3064\u304B\u306E\u7406\u8AD6\u304C\u6D6E\u4E0A\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Normalmente, sus transmisiones est\xE1n m\xE1s configuradas para inducir una
    respuesta emocional. Buenos ejemplos son los juegos de terror, las transmisiones
    de latidos del coraz\xF3n, las transmisiones de re\xEDr o perder, etc. \n\nEl
    patr\xF3n que algunos moderadores han notado es la consistencia de su estado
    emocional cuando est\xE1n inundados de espectadores: cuantos m\xE1s espectadores
    reaccionan a su contenido, m\xE1s a menudo transmiten y durante m\xE1s tiempo.
    \n\nAlgunas teor\xEDas han surgido desde el fondo de Internet de que, de hecho,
    se trata de demonios reales que extraen las emociones que producen los humanos."
