--- !u!114 &6614580574130511508
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2775700538860121627}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 2562747126563065593}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Height:  5\u2019 2\u201D (160 CM)\nWeight:  120 Pounds ( 54 KG)\nBloodtype:
    Boba Tea\n\nLikes: \n\n* Vending Machine * 2D Husbandos * Boba Tea * Mysteries
    * Trains * \n\nDislikes: \n\n * People that don\u2019t answer her questions.
    * Coffee * Badly Written Books *\n"
  - "H\xF6he: 5 Fu\xDF 2 Zoll (160 cm)\nGewicht: 120 Pfund (54 kg)\nBlutgruppe: Boba-Tee\n\nGef\xE4llt
    mir: \n\n* Verkaufsautomat * 2D-Ehem\xE4nner * Boba-Tee * Geheimnisse * Z\xFCge
    * \n\nAbneigungen: \n\n * Leute, die ihre Fragen nicht beantworten. * Kaffee
    * Schlecht geschriebene B\xFCcher *"
  - "\u8EAB\u9577: 5' 2\" (160 CM)\n\u91CD\u91CF: 120 \u30DD\u30F3\u30C9 (54 KG)\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B:
    \u30DC\u30D0\u30C6\u30A3\u30FC\n\n\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E: \n\n* \u81EA\u52D5\u8CA9\u58F2\u6A5F
    * 2D\u592B * \u30DC\u30D0\u30C6\u30A3\u30FC * \u30DF\u30B9\u30C6\u30EA\u30FC
    * \u96FB\u8ECA * \n\n\u5ACC\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E\uFF1A \n\n * \u5F7C\u5973\u306E\u8CEA\u554F\u306B\u7B54\u3048\u306A\u3044\u4EBA\u3005\u3002
    * \u30B3\u30FC\u30D2\u30FC * \u60AA\u304F\u66F8\u304B\u308C\u305F\u672C *"
  - "Altura: 5' 2\" (160 CM)\nPeso: 120 libras (54 kg)\nTipo de sangre: T\xE9 Boba\n\nGustos:
    \n\n* M\xE1quina expendedora * Maridos 2D * T\xE9 Boba * Misterios * Trenes *
    \n\nNo le gusta: \n\n * Personas que no responden a sus preguntas. * Caf\xE9
    * Libros mal escritos *"
