--- !u!114 &8038818626284401174
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2960355262920428865}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 534221796558155697}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "A large Japanese style manor complex in the foothills, the home is serene and
    surrounded by wildlife, and forest. \n\nThe layout seems to really tug at my
    heart strings. It\u2019s a real place for sure..."
  - "Das Haus ist ein gro\xDFer Herrenhauskomplex im japanischen Stil am Fu\xDFe
    der Berge. Es ist ruhig und umgeben von Wildtieren und W\xE4ldern. \n\nDas Layout
    scheint mir wirklich zu Herzen zu gehen. Es ist auf jeden Fall ein echter Ort
    ..."
  - "\u4E18\u9675\u5730\u5E2F\u306B\u3042\u308B\u5927\u898F\u6A21\u306A\u65E5\u672C\u5F0F\u90B8\u5B85\u8907\u5408\u65BD\u8A2D\u3067\u3001\u3053\u306E\u5BB6\u306F\u9759\u304B\u3067\u3001\u91CE\u751F\u52D5\u7269\u3084\u68EE\u306B\u56F2\u307E\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u3053\u306E\u30EC\u30A4\u30A2\u30A6\u30C8\u306F\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u79C1\u306E\u5FC3\u306E\u7434\u7DDA\u306B\u89E6\u308C\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u601D\u3048\u307E\u3059\u3002\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u5B9F\u5728\u3059\u308B\u5834\u6240\u3067\u3059\u306D\u2026"
  - "Un gran complejo se\xF1orial de estilo japon\xE9s en las estribaciones, la casa
    es serena y est\xE1 rodeada de vida silvestre y bosques. \n\nEl dise\xF1o parece
    realmente tocar las fibras de mi coraz\xF3n. Es un lugar real sin duda..."
