--- !u!114 &3515400205287563970
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3098594436851989543}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 1692244754666622286}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Humans are running out of things to complain about. There is, of course, maximum
    resistance to this. \n\n\u201CWhat can we complain about now?\u201D, they lament,
    in despair.\n\nThere is always the internet!\n"
  - "Den Menschen gehen die Dinge aus, wor\xFCber sie sich beschweren k\xF6nnten.
    Dagegen gibt es nat\xFCrlich den gr\xF6\xDFten Widerstand. \n\n\u201EWor\xFCber
    k\xF6nnen wir uns jetzt beschweren?\u201C, jammern sie verzweifelt.\n\nEs gibt
    immer das Internet!"
  - "\u4EBA\u9593\u306F\u6587\u53E5\u3092\u8A00\u3046\u3053\u3068\u304C\u306A\u304F\u306A\u308A\u3064\u3064\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3001\u3053\u308C\u306B\u306F\u6700\u5927\u9650\u306E\u62B5\u6297\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u300C\u4ECA\u3055\u3089\u4F55\u3092\u6587\u53E5\u3092\u8A00\u3046\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\u300D\u3068\u5F7C\u3089\u306F\u7D76\u671B\u3057\u3066\u5606\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\n\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306F\u3044\u3064\u3067\u3082\u3042\u308B\u3088\uFF01"
  - "Los humanos se est\xE1n quedando sin cosas de qu\xE9 quejarse. Por supuesto,
    existe la m\xE1xima resistencia a esto. \n\n\u201C\xBFDe qu\xE9 nos podemos quejar
    ahora?\u201D, se lamentan, desesperados.\n\n\xA1Siempre existe Internet!"
