--- !u!114 &1582104068698038793
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3231289060625000413}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 4062659718193783665}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Height:  4\u201D (10 CM)\nWeight:  .8 Pounds ( 40G)\nBloodtype: \u201CBe for
    real\u2026 I\u2019m a nugget bro.\u201D\n\nLikes: \n\n* Anime Waifus * BBQ Sauce
    * Video Games *\n\nDislikes: \n\n* T-Rexes * Being Bit by said T-Rex * Dishonesty
    *\n"
  - "H\xF6he: 4 Zoll (10 cm)\nGewicht: 0,8 Pfund (40 g)\nBlutgruppe: \u201ESei im
    Ernst ... ich bin ein echter Hingucker, Bruder.\u201C\n\nGef\xE4llt mir: \n\n*
    Anime Waifus * BBQ-Sauce * Videospiele *\n\nAbneigungen: \n\n* T-Rexes * Von
    besagtem T-Rex gebissen werden * Unehrlichkeit *\n\nGef\xE4llt mir: \n\n* Hei\xDFe
    B\xE4der * Thunfischpizza * Fanfics lesen * Fesselnde Geschichten * Rum * \n\nAbneigungen:
    \n\n* Heuchler * Kalte Duschen * Sommer * M\xFCcken * Langeweile * Bethesda *"
  - "\u9AD8\u3055: 4\u30A4\u30F3\u30C1 (10cm)\n\u91CD\u91CF: 0.8 \u30DD\u30F3\u30C9
    (40G)\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B: \u300C\u672C\u5F53\u3067\u3059\u2026\u79C1\u306F\u30CA\u30B2\u30C3\u30C8\u5144\u5F1F\u3067\u3059\u3002\u300D\n\n\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E:
    \n\n* \u30A2\u30CB\u30E1\u30EF\u30A4\u30D5 * BBQ \u30BD\u30FC\u30B9 * \u30D3\u30C7\u30AA\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0
    *\n\n\u5ACC\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E\uFF1A \n\n* \u30C6\u30A3\u30E9\u30CE\u30B5\u30A6\u30EB\u30B9
    * \u30C6\u30A3\u30E9\u30CE\u30B5\u30A6\u30EB\u30B9\u306B\u565B\u307E\u308C\u308B
    * \u4E0D\u6B63\u884C\u70BA *"
  - "Altura: 4\u201D (10CM)\nPeso: 0,8 libras (40 g)\nTipo de sangre: \"Sea real...
    Soy un hermano pepita\".\n\nGustos: \n\n* Anime Waifus * Salsa BBQ * Videojuegos
    *\n\nNo le gusta: \n\n*T-Rex *Ser Mordido por dicho T-Rex *Deshonestidad*"
