      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Many fields soon found ways to adapt this new science to their products.
    \n\nYes, there became a ton of new diets surrounding the Dive. There followed
    a ton of geopolitical strife because of the new tech. \n\nBy 2040: more than
    35 percent of the worlds population owned a Dead\u2019s Man Chip, and was only
    set to increase to 50 percent by the end of 2042. \n\nIf the Dive is meant to
    replace the phone and the computer, the Full Dive was something altogether different\u2026\n\nThat,
    my friend, is where you come in. \n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
