  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3316415689603120185}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 5321804102937748314}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Many fields soon found ways to adapt this new science to their products. \n\nYes,
    there became a ton of new diets surrounding the Dive. There followed a ton of
    geopolitical strife because of the new tech. \n\nBy 2040: more than 35 percent
    of the worlds population owned a Dead\u2019s Man Chip, and was only set to increase
    to 50 percent by the end of 2042. \n\nIf the Dive is meant to replace the phone
    and the computer, the Full Dive was something altogether different\u2026\n\nThat,
    my friend, is where you come in. \n"
  - "Viele Branchen fanden bald Wege, diese neue Wissenschaft auf ihre Produkte zu
    \xFCbertragen. \n\nJa, rund um den Dive gibt es eine Menge neuer Di\xE4ten. Aufgrund
    der neuen Technologie kam es zu einer Menge geopolitischer Konflikte. \n\nBis
    2040: Mehr als 35 Prozent der Weltbev\xF6lkerung besa\xDFen einen Dead\u2019s
    Man Chip und bis Ende 2042 soll dieser Anteil nur auf 50 Prozent ansteigen. \n\nWenn
    der Dive das Telefon und den Computer ersetzen soll, war der Full Dive etwas
    ganz anderes \u2026\n\nDa kommst du ins Spiel, mein Freund."
  - "\u591A\u304F\u306E\u5206\u91CE\u306F\u3059\u3050\u306B\u3001\u3053\u306E\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u79D1\u5B66\u3092\u88FD\u54C1\u306B\u9069\u5FDC\u3055\u305B\u308B\u65B9\u6CD5\u3092\u898B\u3064\u3051\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u306F\u3044\u3001\u30C0\u30A4\u30D6\u306E\u5468\u308A\u306B\u306F\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u306E\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u30C0\u30A4\u30A8\u30C3\u30C8\u6CD5\u304C\u767B\u5834\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u30C6\u30AF\u30CE\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u306E\u305B\u3044\u3067\u3001\u5730\u653F\u5B66\u7684\u7D1B\u4E89\u304C\u5927\u91CF\u306B\u8D77\u3053\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n2040 \u5E74\u307E\u3067\u306B\u3001\u4E16\u754C\u4EBA\u53E3\u306E 35 \u30D1\u30FC\u30BB\u30F3\u30C8\u4EE5\u4E0A\u304C\u30C7\u30C3\u30C9\u30DE\u30F3
    \u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u3092\u6240\u6709\u3057\u30012042 \u5E74\u672B\u307E\u3067\u306B
    50 \u30D1\u30FC\u30BB\u30F3\u30C8\u307E\u3067\u5897\u52A0\u3059\u308B\u4E88\u5B9A\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\nDive \u304C\u96FB\u8A71\u3084\u30B3\u30F3\u30D4\u30E5\u30FC\u30BF\u30FC\u306E\u4EE3\u308F\u308A\u3068\u306A\u308B\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3042\u308B\u5834\u5408\u3001Full
    Dive \u306F\u307E\u3063\u305F\u304F\u5225\u306E\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3057\u305F\u2026\n\n\u53CB\u3088\u3001\u305D\u3053\u304C\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u51FA\u756A\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - "Muchos campos pronto encontraron formas de adaptar esta nueva ciencia a sus
    productos. \n\nS\xED, hubo un mont\xF3n de dietas nuevas en torno al Dive. Siguieron
    muchos conflictos geopol\xEDticos debido a la nueva tecnolog\xEDa. \n\nPara 2040:
    m\xE1s del 35 por ciento de la poblaci\xF3n mundial pose\xEDa un chip Dead's
    Man, y solo se esperaba que aumentara al 50 por ciento para fines de 2042. \n\nSi
    el Dive est\xE1 destinado a reemplazar el tel\xE9fono y la computadora, el Full
    Dive fue algo completamente diferente...\n\nAh\xED, amigo m\xEDo, es donde entras
    t\xFA."
--- !u!1 &3319015038486075440
