--- !u!114 &6926878141440353625
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3469513393153783621}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 6827213525473447520}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Just a college dorm: paid for, filled to the brim with manga, hentai, and gourmet
    cup of noodles. \n\nFree wifi, bottled waters, and a solid computer. Don\u2019t
    need anything else. "
  - "Nur ein Studentenwohnheim: bezahlt, randvoll mit Manga, Hentai und einer Gourmet-Tasse
    Nudeln. \n\nKostenloses WLAN, Mineralwasser und ein solider Computer. Brauche
    nichts anderes."
  - "\u305F\u3060\u306E\u5927\u5B66\u306E\u5BEE\u3067\u3059\u3002\u304A\u91D1\u3092\u6255\u3063\u3066\u3001\u6F2B\u753B\u3001\u30A8\u30ED\u30A2\u30CB\u30E1\u3001\u30B0\u30EB\u30E1\u306A\u30AB\u30C3\u30D7\u9EBA\u3067\u3044\u3063\u3071\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u7121\u6599\u306E Wi-Fi\u3001\u30DC\u30C8\u30EB\u5165\u308A\u98F2\u6599\u6C34\u3001\u5B89\u5B9A\u3057\u305F\u30B3\u30F3\u30D4\u30E5\u30FC\u30BF\u30FC\u3002\u4ED6\u306B\u306F\u4F55\u3082\u5FC5\u8981\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002"
  - "S\xF3lo una residencia universitaria: pagada, repleta de manga, hentai y una
    taza de fideos gourmet. \n\nWifi gratuito, agua embotellada y una computadora
    s\xF3lida. No necesito nada m\xE1s."
