--- !u!114 &5638831532845531207
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3523184591827095555}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 2364890053132787691}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "The governments didn\u2019t step in to save them this time. \n\nThe tumultuous
    ripple through the world\u2019s economies was harsh, and an unforgiving mistress.
    \n\nThankfully though, a social net was in place for the general public: just
    enough to keep people afloat. Basic healthcare (life or death healthcare) and
    a base income was allowed to all that contributed to society. \n\nTo stay in
    business, many corporations had to change the way they conducted themselves.
    The power dynamic shifted to please the customer, instead of the shareholder.
    \n"
  - "Diesmal schritten die Regierungen nicht ein, um sie zu retten. \n\nDie turbulenten
    Wellen in den Volkswirtschaften der Welt waren hart und eine gnadenlose Herrin.
    \n\nZum Gl\xFCck gab es jedoch ein soziales Netz f\xFCr die breite \xD6ffentlichkeit:
    gerade genug, um die Menschen \xFCber Wasser zu halten. Allen, die zur Gesellschaft
    beitrugen, wurde eine grundlegende Gesundheitsversorgung (Gesundheitsversorgung
    auf Leben und Tod) und ein Grundeinkommen gew\xE4hrt. \n\nUm im Gesch\xE4ft zu
    bleiben, mussten viele Unternehmen ihr Verhalten \xE4ndern. Die Machtdynamik
    verlagerte sich zugunsten des Kunden und nicht mehr des Aktion\xE4rs."
  - "\u4ECA\u56DE\u653F\u5E9C\u306F\u5F7C\u3089\u3092\u6551\u3046\u305F\u3081\u306B\u4ECB\u5165\u3057\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u4E16\u754C\u7D4C\u6E08\u306B\u5E83\u304C\u308B\u6DF7\u4E71\u306E\u6CE2\u7D0B\u306F\u53B3\u3057\u304F\u3001\u5BB9\u8D66\u306E\u306A\u3044\u611B\u4EBA\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3001\u3042\u308A\u304C\u305F\u3044\u3053\u3068\u306B\u3001\u30BD\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u30EB
    \u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306F\u4E00\u822C\u5927\u8846\u5411\u3051\u306B\u6574\u5099\u3055\u308C\u3066\u304A\u308A\u3001\u4EBA\u3005\u3092\u6D6E\u904A\u3055\u305B\u308B\u306E\u306B\u5341\u5206\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002\u57FA\u672C\u7684\u306A\u533B\u7642\uFF08\u751F\u6B7B\u306B\u95A2\u308F\u308B\u533B\u7642\uFF09\u3068\u57FA\u672C\u53CE\u5165\u306F\u3001\u793E\u4F1A\u306B\u8CA2\u732E\u3059\u308B\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u4EBA\u306B\u8A8D\u3081\u3089\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u30D3\u30B8\u30CD\u30B9\u3092\u7D99\u7D9A\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u3001\u591A\u304F\u306E\u4F01\u696D\u306F\u81EA\u3089\u306E\u3084\u308A\u65B9\u3092\u5909\u3048\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u6A29\u529B\u306E\u529B\u95A2\u4FC2\u306F\u3001\u682A\u4E3B\u3067\u306F\u306A\u304F\u9867\u5BA2\u3092\u559C\u3070\u305B\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306B\u30B7\u30D5\u30C8\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Esta vez los gobiernos no intervinieron para salvarlos. \n\nLa tumultuosa onda
    expansiva que recorri\xF3 las econom\xEDas del mundo fue dura e implacable. \n\nAfortunadamente,
    exist\xEDa una red social para el p\xFAblico en general: lo suficiente para mantener
    a la gente a flote. Se permiti\xF3 atenci\xF3n m\xE9dica b\xE1sica (atenci\xF3n
    m\xE9dica de vida o muerte) y un ingreso base a todos los que contribuyeran a
    la sociedad. \n\nPara seguir en el negocio, muchas corporaciones tuvieron que
    cambiar la forma en que se comportaban. La din\xE1mica de poder cambi\xF3 para
    complacer al cliente, en lugar del accionista."
