  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3557271227267143136}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 4603130701060238040}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "A growing population of voices are concerned about the total control of a corporation
    over the internet\u2019s infrastructure.\n"
  - "Immer mehr Stimmen bef\xFCrchten die vollst\xE4ndige Kontrolle eines Unternehmens
    \xFCber die Infrastruktur des Internets."
  - "\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306E\u30A4\u30F3\u30D5\u30E9\u306B\u5BFE\u3059\u308B\u4F01\u696D\u306E\u5B8C\u5168\u306A\u652F\u914D\u3092\u61F8\u5FF5\u3059\u308B\u58F0\u304C\u9AD8\u307E\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Una creciente poblaci\xF3n de voces est\xE1 preocupada por el control total
    de una corporaci\xF3n sobre la infraestructura de Internet."
