--- !u!114 &4541908409853681017
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3617444378924575854}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7789875795171129992}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "The key? Non invasive interfaces.\n\nNo displays, no trackers, no speakers.
    \n\nThe best part? They didn\u2019t run off of batteries. \n\nWell, about that.
    They didn\u2019t run using normal batteries. Even though the tech has dramatically
    improved because of solid state and nanotube technology to make them smaller,
    safer, and longer lasting, there was still an upper limit. \n\nThey called it
    the Dead Man\u2019s Chip. Of course, Public Relations in the company winced at
    the name but it was simple. \n"
  - "Der Schl\xFCssel? Nicht-invasive Schnittstellen.\n\nKeine Displays, keine Tracker,
    keine Lautsprecher. \n\nDas Beste daran? Die Batterien gingen ihnen nicht aus.
    \n\nNun ja, dar\xFCber. Sie liefen nicht mit normalen Batterien. Auch wenn sich
    die Technologie durch die Festk\xF6rper- und Nanor\xF6hren-Technologie dramatisch
    verbessert hat, um sie kleiner, sicherer und langlebiger zu machen, gab es immer
    noch eine Obergrenze. \n\nSie nannten es den Chip des toten Mannes. Nat\xFCrlich
    zuckte die PR-Abteilung des Unternehmens bei dem Namen zusammen, aber es war
    einfach."
  - "\u9375\u306F\uFF1F\u975E\u4FB5\u8972\u7684\u306A\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30D5\u30A7\u30FC\u30B9\u3002\n\n\u30C7\u30A3\u30B9\u30D7\u30EC\u30A4\u3082\u30C8\u30E9\u30C3\u30AB\u30FC\u3082\u30B9\u30D4\u30FC\u30AB\u30FC\u3082\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002
    \n\n\u4E00\u756A\u3044\u3044\u3068\u3053\u308D\u306F\uFF1F\u96FB\u6C60\u304C\u5207\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u307E\u3042\u3001\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3002\u901A\u5E38\u306E\u96FB\u6C60\u3067\u306F\u52D5\u4F5C\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002\u56FA\u4F53\u304A\u3088\u3073\u30CA\u30CE\u30C1\u30E5\u30FC\u30D6\u6280\u8853\u306B\u3088\u308A\u3001\u5C0F\u578B\u5316\u3001\u5B89\u5168\u6027\u3001\u8010\u4E45\u6027\u304C\u5411\u4E0A\u3057\u305F\u305F\u3081\u3001\u6280\u8853\u306F\u5287\u7684\u306B\u9032\u6B69\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u3001\u4F9D\u7136\u3068\u3057\u3066\u4E0A\u9650\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u5F7C\u3089\u306F\u305D\u308C\u3092\u30C7\u30C3\u30C9\u30DE\u30F3\u30BA\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u3068\u547C\u3073\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3001\u793E\u5185\u306E\u5E83\u5831\u62C5\u5F53\u8005\u306F\u305D\u306E\u540D\u524D\u3092\u805E\u3044\u3066\u3072\u308B\u307F\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u3001\u305D\u308C\u306F\u5358\u7D14\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "\xBFLa clave? Interfaces no invasivas.\n\nSin pantallas, sin rastreadores, sin
    parlantes. \n\n\xBFLa mejor parte? No se quedaron sin pilas. \n\nBueno, sobre
    eso. No funcionaron con bater\xEDas normales. Aunque la tecnolog\xEDa ha mejorado
    dram\xE1ticamente gracias a la tecnolog\xEDa de estado s\xF3lido y nanotubos
    para hacerlos m\xE1s peque\xF1os, m\xE1s seguros y m\xE1s duraderos, todav\xEDa
    hab\xEDa un l\xEDmite superior. \n\nLo llamaron el chip del hombre muerto. Por
    supuesto, Relaciones P\xFAblicas de la empresa hizo una mueca ante el nombre,
    pero era simple."
