      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "One would expect that inflation, lack of jobs, discrimination, or violence
    would have been the trigger for such a dramatic shift of public perception. \n\nIt
    was not. \n\nIt was a video game. \n\nDue to copyright, I cannot name that game,
    but we all know it. \n\nRather, it was more the discussion around the subject
    of the mentioned video game (REDACTED) that sparked interest in circles outside
    of the online community. The discussion became debates, then the subject became
    the topic of serious movements inside the US, Japan, and the EU. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9137770337806101678, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0,
    type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
  m_fontMaterials: []
