--- !u!114 &672147954262039139
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3688294871197838582}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 6278976559833588062}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "One would expect that inflation, lack of jobs, discrimination, or violence would
    have been the trigger for such a dramatic shift of public perception. \n\nIt
    was not. \n\nIt was a video game. \n\nDue to copyright, I cannot name that game,
    but we all know it. \n\nRather, it was more the discussion around the subject
    of the mentioned video game (REDACTED) that sparked interest in circles outside
    of the online community. The discussion became debates, then the subject became
    the topic of serious movements inside the US, Japan, and the EU. "
  - "Man w\xFCrde erwarten, dass Inflation, Mangel an Arbeitspl\xE4tzen, Diskriminierung
    oder Gewalt der Ausl\xF6ser f\xFCr einen derart dramatischen Wandel der \xF6ffentlichen
    Wahrnehmung gewesen w\xE4ren. \n\nDas war es nicht. \n\nEs war ein Videospiel.
    \n\nAus Urheberrechtsgr\xFCnden kann ich dieses Spiel nicht benennen, aber wir
    alle kennen es. \n\nVielmehr war es die Diskussion rund um das erw\xE4hnte Videospiel
    (ZENSIERT), die auch in Kreisen au\xDFerhalb der Online-Community f\xFCr Interesse
    gesorgt hat. Aus der Diskussion wurden Debatten, dann wurde das Thema zum Thema
    ernsthafter Bewegungen innerhalb der USA, Japans und der EU."
  - "\u30A4\u30F3\u30D5\u30EC\u3001\u4ED5\u4E8B\u4E0D\u8DB3\u3001\u5DEE\u5225\u3001\u66B4\u529B\u306A\u3069\u304C\u3001\u3053\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u56FD\u6C11\u306E\u8A8D\u8B58\u306E\u5287\u7684\u306A\u5909\u5316\u306E\u5F15\u304D\u91D1\u3068\u306A\u3063\u305F\u3067\u3042\u308D\u3046\u3068\u4E88\u60F3\u3059\u308B\u4EBA\u3082\u3044\u308B\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002
    \n\n\u305D\u3046\u3067\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u305D\u308C\u306F\u30D3\u30C7\u30AA\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u8457\u4F5C\u6A29\u306E\u95A2\u4FC2\u4E0A\u3001\u305D\u306E\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u306E\u540D\u524D\u306F\u8A00\u3048\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304C\u3001\u8AB0\u3082\u304C\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u3080\u3057\u308D\u3001\u30AA\u30F3\u30E9\u30A4\u30F3 \u30B3\u30DF\u30E5\u30CB\u30C6\u30A3\u4EE5\u5916\u306E\u30B5\u30FC\u30AF\u30EB\u306E\u95A2\u5FC3\u3092\u5F15\u304D\u8D77\u3053\u3057\u305F\u306E\u306F\u3001\u8A00\u53CA\u3055\u308C\u305F\u30D3\u30C7\u30AA
    \u30B2\u30FC\u30E0 (\u7DE8\u96C6\u6E08\u307F) \u306E\u4E3B\u984C\u3092\u3081\u3050\u308B\u8B70\u8AD6\u306E\u307B\u3046\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002\u8B70\u8AD6\u306F\u8B70\u8AD6\u306B\u306A\u308A\u3001\u305D\u306E\u5F8C\u3001\u3053\u306E\u30C6\u30FC\u30DE\u306F\u7C73\u56FD\u3001\u65E5\u672C\u3001EU
    \u5185\u306E\u6DF1\u523B\u306A\u52D5\u304D\u306E\u8A71\u984C\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Uno esperar\xEDa que la inflaci\xF3n, la falta de empleo, la discriminaci\xF3n
    o la violencia hubieran sido el detonante de un cambio tan dram\xE1tico en la
    percepci\xF3n p\xFAblica. \n\nNo lo fue. \n\nEra un videojuego. \n\nDebido a
    los derechos de autor, no puedo nombrar ese juego, pero todos lo sabemos. \n\nM\xE1s
    bien, fue m\xE1s bien la discusi\xF3n sobre el tema del videojuego mencionado
    (ELIMINADO) lo que despert\xF3 el inter\xE9s en c\xEDrculos fuera de la comunidad
    en l\xEDnea. La discusi\xF3n se convirti\xF3 en debates y luego el tema se convirti\xF3
    en tema de movimientos serios dentro de Estados Unidos, Jap\xF3n y la UE."
