--- !u!114 &1529874419508806115
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3797710524516024402}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7625045850184779526}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "The framework that Digital Horizons designed and implemented was required for
    their next-gen computing. With their code no longer restricted by bandwidth issues,
    they could push the envelope of data far beyond what was once thought possible.
    \n\nSight, smell, touch, hearing, feeling. Websites no longer were a static page
    with fonts and colors as the only medium. A company could now make a 3D server
    world for their services at the same cost as a standard website. \n"
  - "Das von Digital Horizons entworfene und implementierte Framework war f\xFCr
    die Datenverarbeitung der n\xE4chsten Generation erforderlich. Da ihr Code nicht
    mehr durch Bandbreitenprobleme eingeschr\xE4nkt ist, k\xF6nnen sie die Grenzen
    der Daten weit \xFCber das hinausgehen, was fr\xFCher f\xFCr m\xF6glich gehalten
    wurde. \n\nSehen, riechen, ber\xFChren, h\xF6ren, f\xFChlen. Websites waren nicht
    mehr eine statische Seite mit Schriftarten und Farben als einzigem Medium. Ein
    Unternehmen k\xF6nnte nun eine 3D-Serverwelt f\xFCr seine Dienste zu den gleichen
    Kosten wie eine Standard-Website erstellen."
  - "Digital Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u304C\u8A2D\u8A08\u304A\u3088\u3073\u5B9F\u88C5\u3057\u305F\u30D5\u30EC\u30FC\u30E0\u30EF\u30FC\u30AF\u306F\u3001\u6B21\u4E16\u4EE3\u30B3\u30F3\u30D4\u30E5\u30FC\u30C6\u30A3\u30F3\u30B0\u306B\u5FC5\u8981\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002\u5E2F\u57DF\u5E45\u306E\u554F\u984C\u306B\u3088\u308B\u30B3\u30FC\u30C9\u306E\u5236\u9650\u304C\u306A\u304F\u306A\u3063\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3001\u304B\u3064\u3066\u306F\u53EF\u80FD\u3068\u8003\u3048\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3082\u306E\u3092\u306F\u308B\u304B\u306B\u8D85\u3048\u3066\u30C7\u30FC\u30BF\u306E\u9650\u754C\u3092\u8D85\u3048\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u8996\u899A\u3001\u55C5\u899A\u3001\u89E6\u899A\u3001\u8074\u899A\u3001\u611F\u899A\u3002\u30A6\u30A7\u30D6\u30B5\u30A4\u30C8\u306F\u3082\u306F\u3084\u3001\u30D5\u30A9\u30F3\u30C8\u3068\u8272\u3060\u3051\u3092\u5A92\u4F53\u3068\u3059\u308B\u9759\u7684\u306A\u30DA\u30FC\u30B8\u3067\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002\u4F01\u696D\u306F\u3001\u6A19\u6E96\u7684\u306A
    Web \u30B5\u30A4\u30C8\u3068\u540C\u3058\u30B3\u30B9\u30C8\u3067\u3001\u30B5\u30FC\u30D3\u30B9\u7528\u306E
    3D \u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC \u30EF\u30FC\u30EB\u30C9\u3092\u4F5C\u6210\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "El marco que Digital Horizons dise\xF1\xF3 e implement\xF3 era necesario para
    su inform\xE1tica de pr\xF3xima generaci\xF3n. Dado que su c\xF3digo ya no est\xE1
    restringido por problemas de ancho de banda, podr\xEDan ampliar los l\xEDmites
    de los datos mucho m\xE1s all\xE1 de lo que antes se cre\xEDa posible. \n\nVista,
    olfato, tacto, o\xEDdo, sentimiento. Los sitios web ya no eran p\xE1ginas est\xE1ticas
    con fuentes y colores como \xFAnico medio. Una empresa ahora podr\xEDa crear
    un mundo de servidores 3D para sus servicios al mismo coste que un sitio web
    est\xE1ndar."
