  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Height:  5\u2019 11.5\u201D (181 CM)\nWeight:  175 Pounds ( 79KG)\nBloodtype:
    AB+\n\nLikes: \n\nShonen Anime * Hentai * Coffee * Comfy Vibes\nProcrastination
    * Things that Vibrate\n\nDislikes: \n\nBeing Late * Peer pressure * Politics
    * Narcissism * Heights * Dark Places.\n"
  - "H\xF6he: 5 Fu\xDF 11,5 Zoll (181 cm)\nGewicht: 175 Pfund (79 kg)\nBlutgruppe:
    AB+\n\nLikes: \n\nShonen Anime * Hentai * Kaffee * Bequeme Stimmung\nAufschub
    * Dinge, die vibrieren\n\nAbneigungen: \n\nZu sp\xE4t kommen * Gruppenzwang *
    Politik * Narzissmus * H\xF6hen * Dunkle Orte."
  - "\u8EAB\u9577: 5' 11.5\" (181 CM)\n\u91CD\u91CF: 175 \u30DD\u30F3\u30C9 (79KG)\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B:
    AB+\n\n\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E: \n\n\u5C11\u5E74\u30A2\u30CB\u30E1 * \u5909\u614B
    * \u30B3\u30FC\u30D2\u30FC * \u5FEB\u9069\u306A\u96F0\u56F2\u6C17\n\u5148\u5EF6\u3070\u3057
    * \u632F\u52D5\u3059\u308B\u3082\u306E\n\n\u5ACC\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E\uFF1A
    \n\n\u9045\u523B * \u5468\u56F2\u304B\u3089\u306E\u5727\u529B * \u653F\u6CBB
    * \u30CA\u30EB\u30B7\u30B7\u30BA\u30E0 * \u9AD8\u6240 * \u6697\u3044\u5834\u6240\u3002"
  - "Altura: 5' 11,5\" (181 CM)\nPeso: 175 libras (79 kg)\nTipo de sangre: AB+\n\nGustos:
    \n\nAnime Shonen * Hentai * Caf\xE9 * Vibraciones c\xF3modas\nProcrastinaci\xF3n
    * Cosas que Vibran\n\nNo le gusta: \n\nLlegar tarde * Presi\xF3n de grupo * Pol\xEDtica
    * Narcisismo * Alturas * Lugares oscuros."
