--- !u!114 &7856188877199617058
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4034451121868241226}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 5796487245658955004}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Height:  6\u2019 1\u201D (185 CM)\nWeight:  165 Pounds ( 75KG)\nBloodtype: B-\n\nLikes:
    \n\nManga * Calculus * D\xF6ner * Light Beer * Computers * Friendships\n\nDislikes:
    \n\nIgnorance * Wine * Dubbed Anime * Things that interrupt work. *\n"
  - "H\xF6he: 6 Fu\xDF 1 Zoll (185 cm)\nGewicht: 165 Pfund (75 kg)\nBlutgruppe: B-\n\nGef\xE4llt
    mir: \n\nManga * Analysis * D\xF6ner * Helles Bier * Computer * Freundschaften\n\nAbneigungen:
    \n\nIgnoranz * Wein * Anime synchronisiert * Dinge, die die Arbeit unterbrechen.
    *"
  - "\u8EAB\u9577: 6' 1\" (185 CM)\n\u91CD\u91CF: 165 \u30DD\u30F3\u30C9 (75KG)\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B\uFF1AB-\n\n\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E:
    \n\n\u30DE\u30F3\u30AC * \u5FAE\u7A4D\u5206 * \u30C7\u30FC\u30CA\u30FC * \u30E9\u30A4\u30C8\u30D3\u30FC\u30EB
    * \u30B3\u30F3\u30D4\u30E5\u30FC\u30BF\u30FC * \u53CB\u60C5\n\n\u5ACC\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E:
    \n\n\u7121\u77E5 * \u30EF\u30A4\u30F3 * \u5439\u304D\u66FF\u3048\u30A2\u30CB\u30E1
    * \u4ED5\u4E8B\u3092\u4E2D\u65AD\u3059\u308B\u3082\u306E\u3002 *"
  - "Altura: 6' 1\" (185 CM)\nPeso: 165 libras (75 kg)\nTipo de sangre: B-\n\nGustos:
    \n\nManga * C\xE1lculo * D\xF6ner * Cerveza Light * Computadoras * Amistades\n\nNo
    le gusta: \n\nIgnorancia * Vino * Doblado Anime * Cosas que interrumpen el trabajo.
    *"
