  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "With the online world encompassing every nation on Earth, the borders
    of countries blurring more and more each passing year. \n\nAlthough cultural
    boundaries are still as strong as ever, there is a foundational truth as we all
    communicate online. \n\nWe are very much one people with many differing perspectives.
    \L\LWe all breath, eat, laugh, cry, and struggle to find our place in this world.
    At the very core of Humanity, this common ground has fostered a world community
    never seen before. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9137770337806101678, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0,
