  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4267731838096714954}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 8899169935777032005}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "With the online world encompassing every nation on Earth, the borders of countries
    blurring more and more each passing year. \n\nAlthough cultural boundaries are
    still as strong as ever, there is a foundational truth as we all communicate
    online. \n\nWe are very much one people with many differing perspectives. \L\LWe
    all breath, eat, laugh, cry, and struggle to find our place in this world. At
    the very core of Humanity, this common ground has fostered a world community
    never seen before. \n "
  - "Da die Online-Welt jedes Land der Erde umfasst, verschwimmen die Grenzen der
    L\xE4nder von Jahr zu Jahr mehr. \n\nAuch wenn kulturelle Grenzen immer noch
    so stark sind wie eh und je, gibt es eine grundlegende Wahrheit, da wir alle
    online kommunizieren. \n\nWir sind ein sehr einheitliches Volk mit vielen unterschiedlichen
    Perspektiven. \L\LWir alle atmen, essen, lachen, weinen und k\xE4mpfen darum,
    unseren Platz in dieser Welt zu finden. Im Innersten der Menschheit hat diese
    Gemeinsamkeit eine noch nie dagewesene Weltgemeinschaft hervorgebracht."
  - "\u30AA\u30F3\u30E9\u30A4\u30F3\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u304C\u5730\u7403\u4E0A\u306E\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u56FD\u3092\u5305\u542B\u3059\u308B\u306B\u3064\u308C\u3001\u56FD\u306E\u5883\u754C\u306F\u5E74\u3005\u307E\u3059\u307E\u3059\u66D6\u6627\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u304D\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u6587\u5316\u7684\u306A\u5883\u754C\u7DDA\u306F\u76F8\u5909\u308F\u3089\u305A\u5F37\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u5168\u54E1\u304C\u30AA\u30F3\u30E9\u30A4\u30F3\u3067\u30B3\u30DF\u30E5\u30CB\u30B1\u30FC\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3059\u308B\u969B\u306B\u306F\u3001\u57FA\u672C\u7684\u306A\u771F\u5B9F\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306F\u3001\u591A\u304F\u306E\u7570\u306A\u308B\u8996\u70B9\u3092\u6301\u3063\u305F\u3001\u307E\u3055\u306B\u4E00\u3064\u306E\u4EBA\u9593\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \L\L\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306F\u7686\u3001\u606F\u3092\u3057\u3001\u98DF\u3079\u3001\u7B11\u3044\u3001\u6CE3\u304D\u3001\u3053\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u3067\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u5C45\u5834\u6240\u3092\u898B\u3064\u3051\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3082\u304C\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002\u4EBA\u985E\u306E\u6839\u5E79\u306B\u3042\u308B\u3053\u306E\u5171\u901A\u306E\u57FA\u76E4\u306F\u3001\u3053\u308C\u307E\u3067\u306B\u898B\u305F\u3053\u3068\u306E\u306A\u3044\u4E16\u754C\u5171\u540C\u4F53\u3092\u80B2\u3093\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Dado que el mundo en l\xEDnea abarca todas las naciones de la Tierra, las fronteras
    de los pa\xEDses se difuminan cada a\xF1o m\xE1s. \n\nAunque las fronteras culturales
    siguen siendo m\xE1s fuertes que nunca, existe una verdad fundamental: todos
    nos comunicamos en l\xEDnea. \n\nSomos en gran medida un solo pueblo con muchas
    perspectivas diferentes. \L\LTodos respiramos, comemos, re\xEDmos, lloramos y
    luchamos por encontrar nuestro lugar en este mundo. En el centro mismo de la
    Humanidad, este terreno com\xFAn ha fomentado una comunidad mundial nunca antes
    vista."
--- !u!1 &4272813889271840040
