--- !u!114 &8098932001274482695
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4282640595716970916}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 1467013882328345393}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Digital Horizons soon found themselves selling space not only to Virtual Reality
    focused sites. Banks, streaming services, and social media platforms soon joined
    the mix. \n\nSlowly, the conglomerate became the backbone of the internet; an
    updated platform with countless options. \n\nAs of 2038, Digital Horizons, in
    a bid to expand their server tech to the world, opened up their code. Their server
    tech became open source to any who wanted to add the new functionality. \n\nThis
    sparked an internet revolution, with many companies scrambling to integrate the
    systems into their services.\n"
  - "Digital Horizons verkaufte bald Fl\xE4chen nicht nur an Standorte, die sich
    auf Virtual Reality konzentrierten. Bald gesellten sich Banken, Streaming-Dienste
    und Social-Media-Plattformen hinzu. \n\nLangsam entwickelte sich das Konglomerat
    zum R\xFCckgrat des Internets; eine aktualisierte Plattform mit unz\xE4hligen
    Optionen. \n\nAb 2038 hat Digital Horizons seinen Code ge\xF6ffnet, um seine
    Servertechnologie auf die ganze Welt auszudehnen. Ihre Servertechnologie wurde
    als Open Source f\xFCr jeden zug\xE4nglich, der die neue Funktionalit\xE4t hinzuf\xFCgen
    wollte. \n\nDies l\xF6ste eine Internetrevolution aus, bei der viele Unternehmen
    darum k\xE4mpften, die Systeme in ihre Dienste zu integrieren."
  - "Digital Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u306F\u3059\u3050\u306B\u3001\u4EEE\u60F3\u73FE\u5B9F\u306B\u7279\u5316\u3057\u305F\u30B5\u30A4\u30C8\u3060\u3051\u3067\u306A\u304F\u30B9\u30DA\u30FC\u30B9\u3092\u8CA9\u58F2\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306B\u6C17\u4ED8\u304D\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u9280\u884C\u3001\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DF\u30F3\u30B0
    \u30B5\u30FC\u30D3\u30B9\u3001\u30BD\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u30EB \u30E1\u30C7\u30A3\u30A2
    \u30D7\u30E9\u30C3\u30C8\u30D5\u30A9\u30FC\u30E0\u3082\u3059\u3050\u306B\u52A0\u308F\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u3086\u3063\u304F\u308A\u3068\u3001\u3053\u306E\u8907\u5408\u4F01\u696D\u306F\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306E\u30D0\u30C3\u30AF\u30DC\u30FC\u30F3\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u7121\u6570\u306E\u30AA\u30D7\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u5099\u3048\u305F\u6700\u65B0\u306E\u30D7\u30E9\u30C3\u30C8\u30D5\u30A9\u30FC\u30E0\u3002
    \n\n2038 \u5E74\u306E\u6642\u70B9\u3067\u3001Digital Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u306F\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u6280\u8853\u3092\u4E16\u754C\u306B\u62E1\u5927\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u30B3\u30FC\u30C9\u3092\u516C\u958B\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u5F7C\u3089\u306E\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u6280\u8853\u306F\u3001\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u6A5F\u80FD\u3092\u8FFD\u52A0\u3057\u305F\u3044\u4EBA\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u30AA\u30FC\u30D7\u30F3\u30BD\u30FC\u30B9\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u3053\u308C\u304C\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u9769\u547D\u3092\u5F15\u304D\u8D77\u3053\u3057\u3001\u591A\u304F\u306E\u4F01\u696D\u304C\u81EA\u793E\u306E\u30B5\u30FC\u30D3\u30B9\u306B\u30B7\u30B9\u30C6\u30E0\u3092\u7D71\u5408\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u8E8D\u8D77\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Digital Horizons pronto se encontr\xF3 vendiendo espacio no s\xF3lo a sitios
    centrados en la realidad virtual. Los bancos, los servicios de streaming y las
    plataformas de redes sociales pronto se unieron a la mezcla. \n\nPoco a poco,
    el conglomerado se convirti\xF3 en la columna vertebral de Internet; una plataforma
    actualizada con innumerables opciones. \n\nA partir de 2038, Digital Horizons,
    en un intento por expandir su tecnolog\xEDa de servidores al mundo, abri\xF3
    su c\xF3digo. Su tecnolog\xEDa de servidor se volvi\xF3 de c\xF3digo abierto
    para cualquiera que quisiera agregar la nueva funcionalidad. \n\nEsto desat\xF3
    una revoluci\xF3n en Internet, y muchas empresas lucharon por integrar los sistemas
    en sus servicios."
