--- !u!114 &2309158004327428311
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4295518589720390123}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 3582412998168549419}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "This place was made for VR from the ground up, whereas Yoobtube, and Twatch,
    the server was mostly keeping worlds and domains \u2018tacked\u2019 on for extra
    revenue. \n\nSight, hearing, taste, smell, and touch are much more vivid here.
    You can tell that the creators have put a lot of effort in each detail. \n\n\nBe
    careful though: some areas may end up being toxic to you without filters. "
  - "Dieser Ort wurde von Grund auf f\xFCr VR entwickelt, w\xE4hrend Yoobtube und
    Twatch, der Server, haupts\xE4chlich Welten und Domains \u201Eanhefteten\u201C,
    um zus\xE4tzliche Einnahmen zu erzielen. \n\nSehen, H\xF6ren, Schmecken, Riechen
    und F\xFChlen sind hier viel lebendiger. Man merkt, dass sich die Macher bis
    ins Detail viel M\xFChe gegeben haben. \n\n\nSeien Sie jedoch vorsichtig: Einige
    Bereiche k\xF6nnen ohne Filter f\xFCr Sie giftig sein."
  - "\u3053\u306E\u5834\u6240\u306F\u6700\u521D\u304B\u3089 VR \u7528\u306B\u4F5C\u3089\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u3001Yoobtube
    \u3084 Twatch \u306E\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u306F\u4E3B\u306B\u8FFD\u52A0\u53CE\u76CA\u3092\u5F97\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u30EF\u30FC\u30EB\u30C9\u3068\u30C9\u30E1\u30A4\u30F3\u3092\u300C\u56FA\u5B9A\u300D\u3057\u7D9A\u3051\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u3053\u3053\u3067\u306F\u3001\u8996\u899A\u3001\u8074\u899A\u3001\u5473\u899A\u3001\u55C5\u899A\u3001\u89E6\u899A\u304C\u3088\u308A\u9BAE\u660E\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u4F5C\u308A\u624B\u306F\u7D30\u90E8\u306B\u307E\u3067\u591A\u304F\u306E\u52AA\u529B\u3092\u6255\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304C\u308F\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\n\u305F\u3060\u3057\u6CE8\u610F\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u30D5\u30A3\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u3092\u4F7F\u7528\u3057\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3001\u4E00\u90E8\u306E\u5730\u57DF\u3067\u306F\u6709\u5BB3\u306B\u306A\u308B\u53EF\u80FD\u6027\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Este lugar fue creado para la realidad virtual desde cero, mientras que Yoobtube
    y Twatch, el servidor, manten\xEDa principalmente mundos y dominios \"a\xF1adidos\"
    para obtener ingresos adicionales. \n\nLa vista, el o\xEDdo, el gusto, el olfato
    y el tacto son mucho m\xE1s v\xEDvidos aqu\xED. Se nota que los creadores han
    puesto mucho empe\xF1o en cada detalle. \n\n\nEso s\xED, ten cuidado: algunas
    zonas pueden resultar t\xF3xicas para ti sin filtros."
