  m_text: "Clean Water laws have finally been approved by all the nations the world,
    and the corporations have lost some power. Most countries are in the process
    of enforcing these laws. \n\nResponsible use of resources have changed the political
    landscape of the entire Earth. Efficient use of new and old techniques has allowed
    famines to shrink globally. It hasn\u2019t been easy to make these amazing changes.
    Yet\u2026\n\nThe momentum is accelerating. \n"
