--- !u!114 &4085451632290238740
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4347511432907369823}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 2068754719273977748}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Hacking to attain these roles is incredibly rare, and usually require a team
    of coders a very long time. \n\nSecurity in the new internet is much more robust.
    \n\nHowever, most Domains are completely open to users moving through them. \n\nArtists,
    animators, and other creators spend a significant amount of time to alter these
    worlds to suit the Admin\u2019s tastes ( As questionable as some of them may
    or may not be. I won\u2019t judge. )"
  - "Hackerangriffe, um diese Rollen zu erlangen, kommen \xE4u\xDFerst selten vor
    und erfordern in der Regel ein sehr langes Team von Programmierern. \n\nDie Sicherheit
    im neuen Internet ist viel robuster. \n\nDie meisten Dom\xE4nen stehen Benutzern
    jedoch vollst\xE4ndig offen. \n\nK\xFCnstler, Animatoren und andere Sch\xF6pfer
    verbringen viel Zeit damit, diese Welten an den Geschmack des Administrators
    anzupassen (so fragw\xFCrdig einige von ihnen auch sein m\xF6gen oder nicht.
    Ich werde nicht urteilen.)"
  - "\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306E\u5F79\u5272\u3092\u9054\u6210\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u30CF\u30C3\u30AD\u30F3\u30B0\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u307E\u308C\u3067\u3042\u308A\u3001\u901A\u5E38\u306F\u30D7\u30ED\u30B0\u30E9\u30DE\u30FC\u306E\u30C1\u30FC\u30E0\u304C\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u9577\u3044\u6642\u9593\u3092\u5FC5\u8981\u3068\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306E\u30BB\u30AD\u30E5\u30EA\u30C6\u30A3\u306F\u306F\u308B\u304B\u306B\u5805\u7262\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u305F\u3060\u3057\u3001\u307B\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306E\u30C9\u30E1\u30A4\u30F3\u306F\u3001\u305D\u3053\u3092\u79FB\u52D5\u3059\u308B\u30E6\u30FC\u30B6\u30FC\u306B\u5BFE\u3057\u3066\u5B8C\u5168\u306B\u30AA\u30FC\u30D7\u30F3\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u30A2\u30FC\u30C6\u30A3\u30B9\u30C8\u3001\u30A2\u30CB\u30E1\u30FC\u30BF\u30FC\u3001\u305D\u306E\u4ED6\u306E\u30AF\u30EA\u30A8\u30A4\u30BF\u30FC\u306F\u3001\u7BA1\u7406\u8005\u306E\u597D\u307F\u306B\u5408\u308F\u305B\u3066\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u3092\u5909\u66F4\u3059\u308B\u306E\u306B\u304B\u306A\u308A\u306E\u6642\u9593\u3092\u8CBB\u3084\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059
    (\u4E00\u90E8\u306E\u4F5C\u54C1\u306B\u306F\u7591\u308F\u3057\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3082\u3042\u308C\u3070\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3067\u306A\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3082\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u79C1\u306F\u5224\u65AD\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093)\u3002"
  - "Hackear para alcanzar estos roles es incre\xEDblemente raro y, por lo general,
    requiere mucho tiempo de un equipo de codificadores. \n\nLa seguridad en la nueva
    Internet es mucho m\xE1s s\xF3lida. \n\nSin embargo, la mayor\xEDa de los dominios
    est\xE1n completamente abiertos a los usuarios que se mueven a trav\xE9s de ellos.
    \n\nArtistas, animadores y otros creadores dedican una cantidad significativa
    de tiempo a alterar estos mundos para adaptarlos a los gustos del administrador
    (por muy cuestionables que algunos de ellos puedan ser o no. No los juzgar\xE9)."
