  m_text: "A collection of VR based servers with the new DH server tech. \n\nThey
    were created around 2016 and used outdated systems by the mid 2020\u2019s.\n
    \nA hub where people from all nationalities can chill in virtual reality spaces,
    where users can make their own models, worlds, and talk, interact in a 3D space. "
