--- !u!114 &3671547894753726983
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4356782411037208940}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 6154377704669168639}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "A collection of VR based servers with the new DH server tech. \n\nThey were
    created around 2016 and used outdated systems by the mid 2020\u2019s.\n \nA hub
    where people from all nationalities can chill in virtual reality spaces, where
    users can make their own models, worlds, and talk, interact in a 3D space. "
  - "Eine Sammlung VR-basierter Server mit der neuen DH-Servertechnologie. \n\nSie
    wurden etwa im Jahr 2016 erstellt und nutzten Mitte der 2020er Jahre veraltete
    Systeme.\n \nEin Hub, in dem Menschen aller Nationalit\xE4ten in Virtual-Reality-R\xE4umen
    entspannen k\xF6nnen, in dem Benutzer ihre eigenen Modelle und Welten erstellen
    und in einem 3D-Raum sprechen und interagieren k\xF6nnen."
  - "\u65B0\u3057\u3044 DH \u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u6280\u8853\u3092\u5099\u3048\u305F
    VR \u30D9\u30FC\u30B9\u306E\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u306E\u30B3\u30EC\u30AF\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3002
    \n\n\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306F 2016 \u5E74\u9803\u306B\u4F5C\u6210\u3055\u308C\u30012020
    \u5E74\u4EE3\u534A\u3070\u307E\u3067\u306B\u306F\u6642\u4EE3\u9045\u308C\u306E\u30B7\u30B9\u30C6\u30E0\u3092\u4F7F\u7528\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\n
    \n\u30E6\u30FC\u30B6\u30FC\u304C\u72EC\u81EA\u306E\u30E2\u30C7\u30EB\u3084\u4E16\u754C\u3092\u4F5C\u6210\u3057\u30013D
    \u7A7A\u9593\u3067\u5BFE\u8A71\u3057\u305F\u308A\u3001\u5BFE\u8A71\u3057\u305F\u308A\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3001\u4EEE\u60F3\u73FE\u5B9F\u7A7A\u9593\u3067\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308B\u56FD\u7C4D\u306E\u4EBA\u3005\u304C\u304F\u3064\u308D\u3052\u308B\u30CF\u30D6\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - "Una colecci\xF3n de servidores basados \u200B\u200Ben realidad virtual con la
    nueva tecnolog\xEDa de servidor DH. \n\nFueron creados alrededor de 2016 y utilizaban
    sistemas obsoletos a mediados de la d\xE9cada de 2020.\n \nUn centro donde personas
    de todas las nacionalidades pueden relajarse en espacios de realidad virtual,
    donde los usuarios pueden crear sus propios modelos, mundos y hablar e interactuar
    en un espacio 3D."
