--- !u!114 &4675179409455190961
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4362798588936691274}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "And thus, many of the new startups pushed high reputation over short term
    profits. \n\nThis change fostered higher quality products, better pay and incentives
    for workers, and a more balanced view of sustainability. \n\nIn fact some would
    point out that companies like Digital Horizons were the exception, hence their
    positive reputation in the younger generations. They focused on long term goals
    over short gains in the market. Younger investors piled on. \n\nToday, the economy
    is still in flux, swinging like a pendulum. With that, online activities to escape
    high stress is still a very common occurrence. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9137770337806101678, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0,
    type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
