--- !u!114 &7317385220315828542
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4362798588936691274}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 4675179409455190961}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "And thus, many of the new startups pushed high reputation over short term profits.
    \n\nThis change fostered higher quality products, better pay and incentives for
    workers, and a more balanced view of sustainability. \n\nIn fact some would point
    out that companies like Digital Horizons were the exception, hence their positive
    reputation in the younger generations. They focused on long term goals over short
    gains in the market. Younger investors piled on. \n\nToday, the economy is still
    in flux, swinging like a pendulum. With that, online activities to escape high
    stress is still a very common occurrence. "
  - "Und so stellten viele der neuen Start-ups hohe Reputation \xFCber kurzfristige
    Gewinne. \n\nDiese \xC4nderung f\xF6rderte qualitativ hochwertigere Produkte,
    bessere L\xF6hne und Anreize f\xFCr Arbeitnehmer sowie eine ausgewogenere Sicht
    auf Nachhaltigkeit. \n\nTats\xE4chlich w\xFCrden einige darauf hinweisen, dass
    Unternehmen wie Digital Horizons die Ausnahme seien und daher einen guten Ruf
    bei den j\xFCngeren Generationen h\xE4tten. Sie konzentrierten sich auf langfristige
    Ziele und nicht auf kurzfristige Marktgewinne. J\xFCngere Investoren str\xF6mten
    nach. \n\nAuch heute noch ist die Wirtschaft im Wandel und schwingt wie ein Pendel.
    Daher sind Online-Aktivit\xE4ten, um hohem Stress zu entfliehen, immer noch weit
    verbreitet."
  - "\u305D\u306E\u305F\u3081\u3001\u65B0\u8208\u4F01\u696D\u306E\u591A\u304F\u306F\u77ED\u671F\u7684\u306A\u5229\u76CA\u3088\u308A\u3082\u9AD8\u3044\u8A55\u4FA1\u3092\u62BC\u3057\u51FA\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u3053\u306E\u5909\u5316\u306B\u3088\u308A\u3001\u88FD\u54C1\u306E\u54C1\u8CEA\u304C\u5411\u4E0A\u3057\u3001\u52B4\u50CD\u8005\u306E\u8CC3\u91D1\u3068\u30A4\u30F3\u30BB\u30F3\u30C6\u30A3\u30D6\u304C\u5411\u4E0A\u3057\u3001\u6301\u7D9A\u53EF\u80FD\u6027\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3088\u308A\u30D0\u30E9\u30F3\u30B9\u306E\u3068\u308C\u305F\u898B\u65B9\u304C\u4FC3\u9032\u3055\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u5B9F\u969B\u3001Digital Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u4F01\u696D\u306F\u4F8B\u5916\u3067\u3042\u308A\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3086\u3048\u306B\u82E5\u3044\u4E16\u4EE3\u306E\u9593\u3067\u826F\u3044\u8A55\u5224\u304C\u5F97\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3068\u6307\u6458\u3059\u308B\u4EBA\u3082\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u5F7C\u3089\u306F\u5E02\u5834\u306E\u77ED\u671F\u7684\u306A\u5229\u76CA\u3088\u308A\u3082\u9577\u671F\u7684\u306A\u76EE\u6A19\u306B\u7126\u70B9\u3092\u5F53\u3066\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u82E5\u3044\u6295\u8CC7\u5BB6\u304C\u7A4D\u307F\u91CD\u306A\u3063\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u73FE\u5728\u3082\u7D4C\u6E08\u306F\u632F\u308A\u5B50\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306B\u5909\u52D5\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u305D\u306E\u305F\u3081\u3001\u9AD8\u3044\u30B9\u30C8\u30EC\u30B9\u304B\u3089\u9003\u308C\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u30AA\u30F3\u30E9\u30A4\u30F3\u3067\u6D3B\u52D5\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u4F9D\u7136\u3068\u3057\u3066\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u4E00\u822C\u7684\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - "Y as\xED, muchas de las nuevas empresas priorizaron la alta reputaci\xF3n por
    encima de las ganancias a corto plazo. \n\nEste cambio foment\xF3 productos de
    mayor calidad, mejores salarios e incentivos para los trabajadores y una visi\xF3n
    m\xE1s equilibrada de la sostenibilidad. \n\nDe hecho, algunos se\xF1alar\xEDan
    que empresas como Digital Horizons fueron la excepci\xF3n, de ah\xED su reputaci\xF3n
    positiva entre las generaciones m\xE1s j\xF3venes. Se centraron en objetivos
    a largo plazo en lugar de ganancias a corto plazo en el mercado. Los inversores
    m\xE1s j\xF3venes se sumaron. \n\nHoy en d\xEDa, la econom\xEDa todav\xEDa est\xE1
    en constante cambio, oscilando como un p\xE9ndulo. Adem\xE1s, las actividades
    en l\xEDnea para escapar del estr\xE9s elevado siguen siendo algo muy com\xFAn."
