--- !u!114 &1166648984444346173
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4604012421748957326}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "However, in this future, replacement limbs and eyes, and even some internal
    organs, have made it to the general public. \n\nThese new replacements are incredibly
    expensive now, with an cyborg eye easily in the hundreds of thousands of dollars.
    \n\nWith the science behind VR feeding research and development money into the
    medical sector, any organs related to the brain and the nervous system are progressing
    a bit faster than say, limb replacement. \n\nNo one has made a coffee pot to
    attach to a human, yet."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9137770337806101678, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0,
    type: 2}
