--- !u!114 &5109707865842787399
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4604012421748957326}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 1166648984444346173}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "However, in this future, replacement limbs and eyes, and even some internal
    organs, have made it to the general public. \n\nThese new replacements are incredibly
    expensive now, with an cyborg eye easily in the hundreds of thousands of dollars.
    \n\nWith the science behind VR feeding research and development money into the
    medical sector, any organs related to the brain and the nervous system are progressing
    a bit faster than say, limb replacement. \n\nNo one has made a coffee pot to
    attach to a human, yet."
  - "In Zukunft haben es jedoch Ersatzgliedma\xDFen und -augen und sogar einige innere
    Organe der breiten \xD6ffentlichkeit zug\xE4nglich gemacht. \n\nDiese neuen Ersatzteile
    sind jetzt unglaublich teuer, wobei ein Cyborg-Auge leicht Hunderttausende Dollar
    kosten kann. \n\nDa die Wissenschaft hinter VR Forschungs- und Entwicklungsgelder
    in den medizinischen Sektor einspeist, schreiten alle mit dem Gehirn und dem
    Nervensystem verbundenen Organe etwas schneller voran als beispielsweise der
    Ersatz von Gliedma\xDFen. \n\nBisher hat noch niemand eine Kaffeekanne hergestellt,
    die man an einen Menschen h\xE4ngen kann."
  - "\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3001\u3053\u306E\u672A\u6765\u3067\u306F\u3001\u4EA4\u63DB\u7528\u306E\u624B\u8DB3\u3084\u76EE\u3001\u3055\u3089\u306B\u306F\u5185\u81D3\u306E\u4E00\u90E8\u304C\u4E00\u822C\u793E\u4F1A\u306B\u767B\u5834\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306E\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u4EE3\u66FF\u54C1\u306F\u73FE\u5728\u4FE1\u3058\u3089\u308C\u306A\u3044\u307B\u3069\u9AD8\u4FA1\u3067\u3042\u308A\u3001\u30B5\u30A4\u30DC\u30FC\u30B0\u306E\u76EE\u306B\u306F\u7C21\u5358\u306B\u6570\u5341\u4E07\u30C9\u30EB\u304C\u304B\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\nVR \u306E\u80CC\u5F8C\u306B\u3042\u308B\u79D1\u5B66\u304C\u7814\u7A76\u958B\u767A\u8CC7\u91D1\u3092\u533B\u7642\u5206\u91CE\u306B\u4F9B\u7D66\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u305F\u3081\u3001\u8133\u3084\u795E\u7D4C\u7CFB\u306B\u95A2\u9023\u3059\u308B\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308B\u5668\u5B98\u306F\u3001\u305F\u3068\u3048\u3070\u624B\u8DB3\u306E\u7F6E\u63DB\u3088\u308A\u3082\u5C11\u3057\u901F\u304F\u9032\u6B69\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u4EBA\u9593\u306B\u53D6\u308A\u4ED8\u3051\u308B\u30B3\u30FC\u30D2\u30FC\u30DD\u30C3\u30C8\u3092\u4F5C\u3063\u305F\u4EBA\u306F\u307E\u3060\u8AB0\u3082\u3044\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002"
  - "Sin embargo, en el futuro, las extremidades y los ojos de repuesto, e incluso
    algunos \xF3rganos internos, ya estar\xE1n disponibles para el p\xFAblico en
    general. \n\nEstos nuevos reemplazos son incre\xEDblemente caros ahora, con un
    ojo de cyborg que f\xE1cilmente cuesta cientos de miles de d\xF3lares. \n\nDado
    que la ciencia detr\xE1s de la realidad virtual aporta dinero para investigaci\xF3n
    y desarrollo al sector m\xE9dico, cualquier \xF3rgano relacionado con el cerebro
    y el sistema nervioso est\xE1 progresando un poco m\xE1s r\xE1pido que, por ejemplo,
    el reemplazo de extremidades. \n\nHasta el momento nadie ha fabricado una cafetera
    para unirla a un ser humano."
--- !u!1 &4607849730775010595
