--- !u!114 &4924562706266605595
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4607849730775010595}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 2972167045534514476}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Eventually the concerns reached the highest levels of government, and brought
    new generations of politicians that replaced the old across the world. Older
    leaders were replaced with younger and the whole world just\u2026 shifted. \n\nIt
    appeared slow at first, but the wave of change silently overtook the foundation
    of world politics. \n\n\nLaws were suddenly in place to prevent people from profiting
    from corporate interests, and many lawmakers went to prison for repeated offenses.
    \n \n"
  - "Schlie\xDFlich erreichten die Bedenken die h\xF6chsten Regierungsebenen und
    brachten neue Generationen von Politikern hervor, die die alten auf der ganzen
    Welt abl\xF6sten. \xC4ltere F\xFChrungskr\xE4fte wurden durch j\xFCngere ersetzt
    und die ganze Welt ver\xE4nderte sich einfach. \n\nZun\xE4chst schien es langsam,
    aber die Welle des Wandels erfasste stillschweigend die Grundlagen der Weltpolitik.
    \n\n\nPl\xF6tzlich gab es Gesetze, die Menschen daran hinderten, von Unternehmensinteressen
    zu profitieren, und viele Gesetzgeber gingen wegen wiederholter Verst\xF6\xDFe
    ins Gef\xE4ngnis."
  - "\u6700\u7D42\u7684\u306B\u3001\u3053\u306E\u61F8\u5FF5\u306F\u653F\u5E9C\u306E\u6700\u9AD8\u30EC\u30D9\u30EB\u306B\u307E\u3067\u9054\u3057\u3001\u4E16\u754C\u4E2D\u306B\u53E4\u3044\u653F\u6CBB\u5BB6\u306B\u4EE3\u308F\u308B\u65B0\u4E16\u4EE3\u306E\u653F\u6CBB\u5BB6\u304C\u8A95\u751F\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u5E74\u914D\u306E\u30EA\u30FC\u30C0\u30FC\u304C\u82E5\u3044\u30EA\u30FC\u30C0\u30FC\u306B\u53D6\u3063\u3066\u4EE3\u308F\u3089\u308C\u3001\u4E16\u754C\u5168\u4F53\u304C\u307E\u3055\u306B\u2026\u5909\u5316\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u6700\u521D\u306F\u3086\u3063\u304F\u308A\u3068\u898B\u3048\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u3001\u5909\u5316\u306E\u6CE2\u306F\u9759\u304B\u306B\u4E16\u754C\u653F\u6CBB\u306E\u57FA\u76E4\u3092\u98F2\u307F\u8FBC\u307F\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\n\u4EBA\u3005\u304C\u4F01\u696D\u306E\u5229\u76CA\u306B\u3088\u3063\u3066\u5229\u76CA\u3092\u5F97\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u9632\u3050\u6CD5\u5F8B\u304C\u7A81\u7136\u65BD\u884C\u3055\u308C\u3001\u591A\u304F\u306E\u8B70\u54E1\u304C\u518D\u72AF\u3067\u5211\u52D9\u6240\u5165\u308A\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Con el tiempo, las preocupaciones llegaron a los niveles m\xE1s altos del gobierno
    y trajeron nuevas generaciones de pol\xEDticos que reemplazaron a las antiguas
    en todo el mundo. Los l\xEDderes m\xE1s viejos fueron reemplazados por m\xE1s
    j\xF3venes y el mundo entero simplemente\u2026 cambi\xF3. \n\nAl principio pareci\xF3
    lento, pero la ola de cambio se apoder\xF3 silenciosamente de los cimientos de
    la pol\xEDtica mundial. \n\n\nDe repente se promulgaron leyes para impedir que
    las personas se lucraran con los intereses corporativos, y muchos legisladores
    fueron a prisi\xF3n por reincidencias."
--- !u!1 &4610949381388001815
