--- !u!114 &1475532612692569547
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4689199941128027368}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 2694346636751646485}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Height:  4\u2019 11\u201D (149 CM)\nWeight:  105 Pounds ( 47KG)\nBloodtype:
    A+\n\nLikes: \n\n* Tea * Ice Cream * Visual Novels * Doggos * Puzzle Games *
    Dark Humor * Candle Lit Dinners *\n\nDislikes: \n\n* Lying * Hot Weather * Taxes
    * Jump Scares * "
  - "H\xF6he: 4 Fu\xDF 11 Zoll (149 cm)\nGewicht: 105 Pfund (47 kg)\nBlutgruppe:
    A+\n\nGef\xE4llt mir: \n\n* Tee * Eis * Bildromane * Doggos * Puzzlespiele *
    Schwarzer Humor * Abendessen bei Kerzenschein *\n\nAbneigungen: \n\n* L\xFCgen
    * Hei\xDFes Wetter * Steuern * Jump Scares *"
  - "\u8EAB\u9577: 4' 11\" (149 CM)\n\u91CD\u91CF: 105 \u30DD\u30F3\u30C9 (47KG)\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B:
    A+\n\n\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E: \n\n* \u7D05\u8336 * \u30A2\u30A4\u30B9\u30AF\u30EA\u30FC\u30E0
    * \u30D3\u30B8\u30E5\u30A2\u30EB\u30CE\u30D9\u30EB * \u30C9\u30C3\u30B0\u30B9
    * \u30D1\u30BA\u30EB\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0 * \u30C0\u30FC\u30AF\u30E6\u30FC\u30E2\u30A2
    * \u30AD\u30E3\u30F3\u30C9\u30EB\u30E9\u30A4\u30C8\u30C7\u30A3\u30CA\u30FC *\n\n\u5ACC\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E:
    \n\n* \u5618 * \u6691\u3044\u6C17\u5019 * \u7A0E\u91D1 * \u98DB\u3073\u964D\u308A\u306E\u6050\u6016
    *"
  - "Altura: 4' 11\" (149 CM)\nPeso: 105 libras (47 kg)\nTipo de sangre: A+\n\nGustos:
    \n\n* T\xE9 * Helado * Novelas visuales * Doggos * Juegos de rompecabezas * Humor
    negro * Cenas a la luz de las velas *\n\nNo le gusta: \n\n* Mentir * Clima caluroso
    * Impuestos * Sustos de salto *"
