--- !u!114 &6226178321597133337
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4718249385824606813}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 968576707758923807}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Everything a person needs in one place. One of the popular convenience stores
    in Japan, chocked full of everything a solo person needs. \n\nHot food bar in
    the back too!"
  - "Alles, was ein Mensch braucht, an einem Ort. Einer der beliebtesten Convenience-Stores
    in Japan, vollgepackt mit allem, was ein Alleinreisender braucht. \n\nIm hinteren
    Bereich gibt es auch eine Bar mit warmem Essen!"
  - "\u4EBA\u306B\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u3082\u306E\u304C\u3059\u3079\u3066 1 \u304B\u6240\u306B\u96C6\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u3072\u3068\u308A\u66AE\u3089\u3057\u306B\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u3082\u306E\u304C\u304E\u3063\u3057\u308A\u3068\u8A70\u307E\u3063\u305F\u3001\u65E5\u672C\u3092\u4EE3\u8868\u3059\u308B\u30B3\u30F3\u30D3\u30CB\u30A8\u30F3\u30B9\u30B9\u30C8\u30A2\u3002
    \n\n\u5965\u306B\u306F\u30DB\u30C3\u30C8\u30D5\u30FC\u30C9\u30D0\u30FC\u3082\uFF01"
  - "Todo lo que una persona necesita en un solo lugar. Una de las tiendas de conveniencia
    m\xE1s populares de Jap\xF3n, repleta de todo lo que una persona sola necesita.
    \n\n\xA1Barra de comida caliente en la parte de atr\xE1s tambi\xE9n!"
