--- !u!114 &2116341804185729404
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4778231452196078848}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 3306013474384398262}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Are Aliens Watching us?\n\nAre aliens inside our internet? \L\LAre there AI
    unaccounted for that are watching us? Watching our Streams and Videos?\n\nDuring
    our exploration of the Solar System, we have discovered whole water worlds that
    may, in fact, harbor complex life. \n"
  - "Beobachten uns Au\xDFerirdische?\n\nSind Au\xDFerirdische in unserem Internet?
    \L\LGibt es eine unerkl\xE4rliche KI, die uns beobachtet? Sehen Sie sich unsere
    Streams und Videos an?\n\nW\xE4hrend unserer Erkundung des Sonnensystems haben
    wir ganze Wasserwelten entdeckt, die tats\xE4chlich komplexes Leben beherbergen
    k\xF6nnten."
  - "\u5B87\u5B99\u4EBA\u306F\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u3092\u898B\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F\n\n\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306E\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306E\u4E2D\u306B\u5B87\u5B99\u4EBA\u306F\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F
    \L\L\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u3092\u76E3\u8996\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u884C\u65B9\u4E0D\u660E\u306E
    AI \u306F\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B?\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30E0\u3084\u30D3\u30C7\u30AA\u3092\u898B\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u304B?\n\n\u592A\u967D\u7CFB\u306E\u63A2\u67FB\u4E2D\u306B\u3001\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306F\u5B9F\u969B\u306B\u8907\u96D1\u306A\u751F\u547D\u304C\u4F4F\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308B\u53EF\u80FD\u6027\u306E\u3042\u308B\u6C34\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u5168\u4F53\u3092\u767A\u898B\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "\xBFNos est\xE1n mirando los extraterrestres?\n\n\xBFHay extraterrestres dentro
    de nuestra Internet? \L\L\xBFHay IA desaparecidas que nos est\xE1n observando?
    \xBFEst\xE1s viendo nuestras transmisiones y videos?\n\nDurante nuestra exploraci\xF3n
    del Sistema Solar, hemos descubierto mundos acu\xE1ticos completos que, de hecho,
    pueden albergar vida compleja."
