  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 5152929286388321213}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "A large manor, bathed in hues of lavender. The large, gothic, spires break up
    the canopy of the massive pine tree forest. \n\nThe temperature is nice."
  - "Ein gro\xDFes Herrenhaus, getaucht in Lavendelt\xF6ne. Die gro\xDFen gotischen
    T\xFCrme durchbrechen das Bl\xE4tterdach des riesigen Kiefernwaldes. \n\nDie
    Temperatur ist sch\xF6n."
  - "\u30E9\u30D9\u30F3\u30C0\u30FC\u8272\u306B\u67D3\u307E\u308B\u5E83\u5927\u306A\u90B8\u5B85\u3002\u5927\u304D\u306A\u30B4\u30B7\u30C3\u30AF\u69D8\u5F0F\u306E\u5C16\u5854\u304C\u3001\u5DE8\u5927\u306A\u677E\u6797\u306E\u5929\u84CB\u3092\u6253\u3061\u7834\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u6C17\u6E29\u306F\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002"
  - "Una gran mansi\xF3n ba\xF1ada en tonos lavanda. Las grandes agujas g\xF3ticas
    rompen el dosel del enorme bosque de pinos. \n\nLa temperatura es agradable."
