  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4962767844517995592}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 6473939929379084}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Height:  5\u2019 10\u201D (178 CM)\nWeight:  175 Pounds ( 82KG)\nBloodtype:
    AB-\n\nLikes: \n\n* Hot Baths * Tuna Pizza * Reading Fanfics * Engaging Stories
    * Rum * \n\nDislikes: \n\n* Hypocrites * Cold Showers * Summer * Mosquitoes *
    Boredom * Bethesda *\n"
  - "H\xF6he: 5 Fu\xDF 10 Zoll (178 cm)\nGewicht: 175 Pfund (82 kg)\nBlutgruppe:
    AB-\n\nGef\xE4llt mir: \n\n* Hei\xDFe B\xE4der * Thunfischpizza * Fanfics lesen
    * Fesselnde Geschichten * Rum * \n\nAbneigungen: \n\n* Heuchler * Kalte Duschen
    * Sommer * M\xFCcken * Langeweile * Bethesda *"
  - "\u8EAB\u9577: 5' 10\" (178 CM)\n\u91CD\u91CF: 175 \u30DD\u30F3\u30C9 (82KG)\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B\uFF1AAB-\n\n\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E:
    \n\n* \u6E29\u304B\u3044\u304A\u98A8\u5442 * \u30DE\u30B0\u30ED\u306E\u30D4\u30B6
    * \u30D5\u30A1\u30F3\u30D5\u30A3\u30AF\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u306E\u8AAD\u66F8 *
    \u9B45\u529B\u7684\u306A\u7269\u8A9E * \u30E9\u30E0\u9152 * \n\n\u5ACC\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E:
    \n\n* \u507D\u5584\u8005 * \u51B7\u305F\u3044\u30B7\u30E3\u30EF\u30FC * \u590F
    * \u868A * \u9000\u5C48 * \u30D9\u30BB\u30B9\u30C0 *"
  - "Altura: 5' 10\" (178 CM)\nPeso: 175 libras (82 kg)\nTipo de sangre: AB-\n\nGustos:
    \n\n* Ba\xF1os calientes * Pizza de at\xFAn * Lectura de fanfics * Historias
    interesantes * Ron * \n\nNo le gusta: \n\n* Hip\xF3critas * Duchas fr\xEDas *
    Verano * Mosquitos * Aburrimiento * Bethesda *"
