  m_text: "Middle 30\u2019s and in decent shape, the dude looks drained from the
    work at the store.  Japanese native, with a touch of stubble on his chin, his
    eyes are sharp, but tired. \n\nHe may be an NPC, but he looks to have a serious
    backstory to him! His charming smile takes some work to get, totally worth it.
    \n\nMy curiosity is getting the better of me."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
