--- !u!114 &2172439238171460741
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5019621549668786075}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7702865172503277505}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Middle 30\u2019s and in decent shape, the dude looks drained from the work at
    the store.  Japanese native, with a touch of stubble on his chin, his eyes are
    sharp, but tired. \n\nHe may be an NPC, but he looks to have a serious backstory
    to him! His charming smile takes some work to get, totally worth it. \n\nMy curiosity
    is getting the better of me."
  - "Der Typ ist Mitte 30 und in guter Verfassung und sieht von der Arbeit im Laden
    ersch\xF6pft aus.  Der geb\xFCrtige Japaner hat einen Hauch von Stoppeln am Kinn
    und seine Augen sind scharf, aber m\xFCde. \n\nEr mag ein NPC sein, aber er scheint
    eine ernsthafte Hintergrundgeschichte zu haben! Sein bezauberndes L\xE4cheln
    zu bekommen erfordert einiges an Arbeit, es lohnt sich auf jeden Fall. \n\nMeine
    Neugier \xFCberw\xE4ltigt mich."
  - "30\u4EE3\u534A\u3070\u3001\u305D\u3053\u305D\u3053\u306E\u4F53\u578B\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3053\u306E\u7537\u306F\u3001\u5E97\u3067\u306E\u4ED5\u4E8B\u306B\u75B2\u308C\u679C\u3066\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u898B\u3048\u308B\u3002 
    \u65E5\u672C\u4EBA\u3067\u3001\u984E\u306B\u306F\u7121\u7CBE\u3072\u3052\u304C\u3042\u308A\u3001\u76EE\u306F\u92ED\u3044\u304C\u75B2\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3002
    \n\n\u5F7C\u306F NPC \u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u91CD\u5927\u306A\u30D0\u30C3\u30AF\u30B9\u30C8\u30FC\u30EA\u30FC\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5F7C\u306E\u9B45\u529B\u7684\u306A\u7B11\u9854\u3092\u624B\u306B\u5165\u308C\u308B\u306B\u306F\u5C11\u3057\u52AA\u529B\u304C\u5FC5\u8981\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3060\u3051\u306E\u4FA1\u5024\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u597D\u5947\u5FC3\u304C\u52DD\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "De unos 30 a\xF1os y en buena forma, el tipo parece agotado por el trabajo en
    la tienda.  Nativo de Jap\xF3n, con un toque de barba en la barbilla, sus ojos
    son agudos, pero cansados. \n\nPuede que sea un NPC, \xA1pero parece tener una
    historia de fondo seria! Su encantadora sonrisa requiere algo de trabajo y vale
    la pena. \n\nMi curiosidad se est\xE1 apoderando de m\xED."
