--- !u!114 &2138362406134843329
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5072533808093038501}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 2238465159481753969}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "As of 2039, Twatch is still #1 for streaming with Youbtube not far behind. \n\nAll
    types of games, content, cooking shows, and hot tub streams sprinkled through
    give all types of people interactive content. \n\nViewers love to support their
    streamer via credits, and have plugins with their VR to directly mess with a
    game they are playing. \n\nConverting to 3D hasn\u2019t changed the core content
    much, with the exception of adding social places to gather and enjoy while watching,
    more on those locations in the Locations Tab. \n"
  - "Im Jahr 2039 ist Twatch immer noch die Nummer 1 beim Streaming, YouTube liegt
    nicht weit dahinter. \n\nAlle Arten von Spielen, Inhalten, Kochshows und Whirlpool-Streams
    bieten allen Arten von Menschen interaktive Inhalte. \n\nZuschauer lieben es,
    ihren Streamer durch Credits zu unterst\xFCtzen und Plugins mit ihrer VR zu haben,
    um direkt mit einem Spiel, das sie spielen, zu experimentieren. \n\nDurch die
    Konvertierung in 3D hat sich am Kerninhalt nicht viel ge\xE4ndert, mit Ausnahme
    der Hinzuf\xFCgung sozialer Orte, an denen man sich treffen und beim Ansehen
    genie\xDFen kann; mehr zu diesen Orten im Tab \u201EStandorte\u201C."
  - "2039 \u5E74\u306E\u6642\u70B9\u3067\u3001Twatch \u306F\u4F9D\u7136\u3068\u3057\u3066\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DF\u30F3\u30B0\u3067
    1 \u4F4D\u3067\u3042\u308A\u3001Youtube \u3082\u305D\u308C\u306B\u8CA0\u3051\u3066\u3044\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002
    \n\n\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308B\u7A2E\u985E\u306E\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u3001\u30B3\u30F3\u30C6\u30F3\u30C4\u3001\u6599\u7406\u756A\u7D44\u3001\u30DB\u30C3\u30C8\u30BF\u30D6
    \u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30E0\u304C\u6563\u308A\u3070\u3081\u3089\u308C\u3001\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308B\u7A2E\u985E\u306E\u4EBA\u3005\u306B\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30E9\u30AF\u30C6\u30A3\u30D6\u306A\u30B3\u30F3\u30C6\u30F3\u30C4\u3092\u63D0\u4F9B\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u8996\u8074\u8005\u306F\u30AF\u30EC\u30B8\u30C3\u30C8\u3092\u901A\u3058\u3066\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DE\u30FC\u3092\u30B5\u30DD\u30FC\u30C8\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u597D\u307F\u3001VR
    \u306B\u30D7\u30E9\u30B0\u30A4\u30F3\u3092\u5165\u308C\u3066\u30D7\u30EC\u30A4\u4E2D\u306E\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u3092\u76F4\u63A5\u64CD\u4F5C\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u597D\u307F\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n3D \u3078\u306E\u5909\u63DB\u306B\u3088\u3063\u3066\u3001\u30B3\u30A2 \u30B3\u30F3\u30C6\u30F3\u30C4\u306F\u3042\u307E\u308A\u5909\u66F4\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304C\u3001\u96C6\u307E\u3063\u3066\u8996\u8074\u3057\u306A\u304C\u3089\u697D\u3057\u3081\u308B\u30BD\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u30EB
    \u30B9\u30DA\u30FC\u30B9\u304C\u8FFD\u52A0\u3055\u308C\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3089\u306E\u5834\u6240\u304C
    [\u30ED\u30B1\u30FC\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3] \u30BF\u30D6\u306B\u8FFD\u52A0\u3055\u308C\u305F\u70B9\u304C\u7570\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "A partir de 2039, Twatch sigue siendo el n\xFAmero 1 en streaming y YouTube
    no se queda atr\xE1s. \n\nTodo tipo de juegos, contenido, programas de cocina
    y transmisiones de jacuzzis distribuidos brindan a todo tipo de personas contenido
    interactivo. \n\nA los espectadores les encanta apoyar a su transmisor a trav\xE9s
    de cr\xE9ditos y tienen complementos con su realidad virtual para alterar directamente
    el juego que est\xE1n jugando. \n\nLa conversi\xF3n a 3D no ha cambiado mucho
    el contenido principal, con la excepci\xF3n de agregar lugares sociales para
    reunirse y disfrutar mientras miran, m\xE1s sobre esas ubicaciones en la pesta\xF1a
    Ubicaciones."
