--- !u!114 &4529499000892023270
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5085422439001934476}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "What stops them from pulling the plug? Or worse? \n\nWhat if they are
    spying on us?\n\nEven though Digital Horizons gave away the patent for the server
    technology years ago, the rumors still persist. \n\nDigital Horizons does not
    own the internet, at least on the surface. \n\nIn fact, for a company, they have
    an amazing track record respecting privacy rights, and ensuring their hardware
    and software is safe. This track record is the very reason why many are expecting
    the worse. \n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9137770337806101678, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0,
    type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
  m_fontMaterials: []
  m_fontColor32:
    serializedVersion: 2
    rgba: 4294967295
