--- !u!114 &4562769247179047270
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5085422439001934476}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 4529499000892023270}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "What stops them from pulling the plug? Or worse? \n\nWhat if they are spying
    on us?\n\nEven though Digital Horizons gave away the patent for the server technology
    years ago, the rumors still persist. \n\nDigital Horizons does not own the internet,
    at least on the surface. \n\nIn fact, for a company, they have an amazing track
    record respecting privacy rights, and ensuring their hardware and software is
    safe. This track record is the very reason why many are expecting the worse.
    \n"
  - "Was h\xE4lt sie davon ab, den Stecker zu ziehen? Oder schlimmer? \n\nWas ist,
    wenn sie uns ausspionieren?\n\nAuch wenn Digital Horizons das Patent f\xFCr die
    Servertechnologie schon vor Jahren abgegeben hat, halten sich die Ger\xFCchte
    noch immer hartn\xE4ckig. \n\nDigital Horizons besitzt das Internet nicht, zumindest
    oberfl\xE4chlich betrachtet. \n\nTats\xE4chlich kann ein Unternehmen eine erstaunliche
    Erfolgsbilanz vorweisen, wenn es darum geht, Datenschutzrechte zu respektieren
    und sicherzustellen, dass seine Hardware und Software sicher ist. Diese Erfolgsbilanz
    ist genau der Grund, warum viele mit dem Schlimmsten rechnen."
  - "\u5F7C\u3089\u304C\u30D7\u30E9\u30B0\u3092\u629C\u304F\u306E\u3092\u59A8\u3052\u308B\u3082\u306E\u306F\u4F55\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F\u305D\u308C\u3068\u3082\u3082\u3063\u3068\u60AA\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F
    \n\n\u5F7C\u3089\u304C\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u3092\u30B9\u30D1\u30A4\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3089\u3069\u3046\u3057\u307E\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\n\nDigital
    Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u306F\u4F55\u5E74\u3082\u524D\u306B\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u6280\u8853\u306E\u7279\u8A31\u3092\u8B72\u6E21\u3057\u305F\u306B\u3082\u304B\u304B\u308F\u3089\u305A\u3001\u305D\u306E\u5642\u306F\u4ECA\u3082\u7D9A\u3044\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\nDigital Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u306F\u3001\u5C11\u306A\u304F\u3068\u3082\u5730\u4E0A\u3067\u306F\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u3092\u6240\u6709\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002
    \n\n\u5B9F\u969B\u3001\u4F01\u696D\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306F\u3001\u30D7\u30E9\u30A4\u30D0\u30B7\u30FC\u6A29\u3092\u5C0A\u91CD\u3057\u3001\u30CF\u30FC\u30C9\u30A6\u30A7\u30A2\u3068\u30BD\u30D5\u30C8\u30A6\u30A7\u30A2\u306E\u5B89\u5168\u6027\u3092\u78BA\u4FDD\u3059\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3046\u70B9\u3067\u9A5A\u304F\u3079\u304D\u5B9F\u7E3E\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306E\u5B9F\u7E3E\u3053\u305D\u304C\u3001\u591A\u304F\u306E\u4EBA\u304C\u3088\u308A\u60AA\u3044\u72B6\u6CC1\u3092\u4E88\u60F3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u7406\u7531\u306A\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - "\xBFQu\xE9 les impide desconectarse? \xBFO peor? \n\n\xBFY si nos est\xE1n espiando?\n\nAunque
    Digital Horizons cedi\xF3 la patente de la tecnolog\xEDa de servidor hace a\xF1os,
    los rumores a\xFAn persisten. \n\nDigital Horizons no es due\xF1o de Internet,
    al menos en la superficie. \n\nDe hecho, para ser una empresa, tienen un historial
    sorprendente en cuanto a respetar los derechos de privacidad y garantizar que
    su hardware y software sean seguros. Este historial es la raz\xF3n por la que
    muchos esperan lo peor."
