  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5099111980192310433}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 5170590127846258563}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Having a chip implanted on the outside of your skull in order to enjoy a movie
    in VR appears utterly ludicrous. \n\nMany parents were appalled. The number of
    old people yelling at the clouds increased with each passing year. \n\nThe applications
    of this new hardware in conjunction with Digital Horizon\u2019s new server tech
    dazzled the public. \n\nFrom things such as virtual surgery training, to live
    streaming redeems, to space walk education, the Dive locked itself in as the
    apex of spatial computing. \n\nAnd it happened quickly."
  - "Sich einen Chip an der Au\xDFenseite des Sch\xE4dels implantieren zu lassen,
    um einen Film in VR genie\xDFen zu k\xF6nnen, erscheint v\xF6llig l\xE4cherlich.
    \n\nViele Eltern waren entsetzt. Die Zahl der alten Menschen, die die Wolken
    anschreien, nahm mit jedem Jahr zu. \n\nDie Anwendungen dieser neuen Hardware
    in Verbindung mit der neuen Servertechnologie von Digital Horizon begeisterten
    die \xD6ffentlichkeit. \n\nVon Dingen wie virtuellem Operationstraining \xFCber
    Live-Streaming-Einl\xF6sungen bis hin zu Weltraumspazierg\xE4ngen hat sich der
    Dive als H\xF6hepunkt des r\xE4umlichen Computing etabliert. \n\nUnd es ging
    schnell."
  - "VR \u3067\u6620\u753B\u3092\u697D\u3057\u3080\u305F\u3081\u306B\u982D\u84CB\u9AA8\u306E\u5916\u5074\u306B\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u3092\u57CB\u3081\u8FBC\u3080\u3068\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306F\u3001\u307E\u3063\u305F\u304F\u3070\u304B\u3052\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u601D\u3048\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u591A\u304F\u306E\u89AA\u306F\u6115\u7136\u3068\u3057\u305F\u3002\u96F2\u306B\u5411\u304B\u3063\u3066\u53EB\u3076\u8001\u4EBA\u306E\u6570\u306F\u5E74\u3005\u5897\u52A0\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\nDigital Horizo\u200B\u200Bn \u306E\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u6280\u8853\u3068\u7D44\u307F\u5408\u308F\u305B\u305F\u3053\u306E\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u30CF\u30FC\u30C9\u30A6\u30A7\u30A2\u306E\u30A2\u30D7\u30EA\u30B1\u30FC\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u306F\u3001\u4E00\u822C\u306E\u4EBA\u3005\u3092\u9A5A\u304B\u305B\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u4EEE\u60F3\u624B\u8853\u30C8\u30EC\u30FC\u30CB\u30F3\u30B0\u304B\u3089\u30E9\u30A4\u30D6
    \u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DF\u30F3\u30B0\u5F15\u304D\u63DB\u3048\u3001\u5B87\u5B99\u904A\u6CF3\u6559\u80B2\u307E\u3067\u3001Dive
    \u306F\u7A7A\u9593\u30B3\u30F3\u30D4\u30E5\u30FC\u30C6\u30A3\u30F3\u30B0\u306E\u9802\u70B9\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306E\u5730\u4F4D\u3092\u78BA\u7ACB\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u305D\u3057\u3066\u305D\u308C\u306F\u3059\u3050\u306B\u8D77\u3053\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Tener un chip implantado en el exterior del cr\xE1neo para poder disfrutar de
    una pel\xEDcula en realidad virtual parece absolutamente rid\xEDculo. \n\nMuchos
    padres quedaron consternados. El n\xFAmero de ancianos que gritaban a las nubes
    aumentaba cada a\xF1o que pasaba. \n\nLas aplicaciones de este nuevo hardware
    junto con la nueva tecnolog\xEDa de servidor de Digital Horizon deslumbraron
    al p\xFAblico. \n\nDesde cosas como la capacitaci\xF3n en cirug\xEDa virtual
    hasta la transmisi\xF3n en vivo y la educaci\xF3n sobre caminatas espaciales,
    Dive se convirti\xF3 en la c\xFAspide de la computaci\xF3n espacial. \n\nY sucedi\xF3
    r\xE1pidamente."
