--- !u!114 &4361449687295492462
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5129466891073522343}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 2223950551741491654}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "The normal way of browsing the internet needs to be replaced. Their main goal
    was to have virtual reality replace the normal internet. \n\nWith large companies
    investing copious amounts of capital to the cause, Digital Horizons set forth
    to create a copy of the world wide web inside their own, massive, server farms.
    \n\nFor 5 years, they remained a niche side of the internet, but their server
    technology steadily garnered attention. The added bandwidth for more detailed
    worlds and websites, coupled with the massive speed increase, became a high demand
    product. \n"
  - "Das normale Surfen im Internet muss ersetzt werden. Ihr Hauptziel war es, dass
    die virtuelle Realit\xE4t das normale Internet ersetzt. \n\nDa gro\xDFe Unternehmen
    reichlich Kapital in die Sache investieren, machte sich Digital Horizons daran,
    eine Kopie des World Wide Web in ihren eigenen, riesigen Serverfarmen zu erstellen.
    \n\nF\xFCnf Jahre lang blieben sie eine Nische im Internet, doch ihre Servertechnologie
    erregte immer mehr Aufmerksamkeit. Die zus\xE4tzliche Bandbreite f\xFCr detailliertere
    Welten und Websites, gepaart mit der massiven Geschwindigkeitssteigerung, wurde
    zu einem stark nachgefragten Produkt."
  - "\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u3092\u95B2\u89A7\u3059\u308B\u901A\u5E38\u306E\u65B9\u6CD5\u3092\u5909\u3048\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u5F7C\u3089\u306E\u4E3B\u306A\u76EE\u6A19\u306F\u3001\u901A\u5E38\u306E\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u3092\u4EEE\u60F3\u73FE\u5B9F\u306B\u7F6E\u304D\u63DB\u3048\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u5927\u4F01\u696D\u304C\u3053\u306E\u76EE\u7684\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u5DE8\u984D\u306E\u8CC7\u672C\u3092\u6295\u8CC7\u3059\u308B\u4E2D\u3001Digital
    Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u306F\u81EA\u793E\u306E\u5927\u898F\u6A21\u306A\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC
    \u30D5\u30A1\u30FC\u30E0\u5185\u306B World Wide Web \u306E\u30B3\u30D4\u30FC\u3092\u4F5C\u6210\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306B\u7740\u624B\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n5 \u5E74\u9593\u3001\u540C\u793E\u306F\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306E\u30CB\u30C3\u30C1\u306A\u5074\u9762\u306B\u7559\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u3001\u305D\u306E\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u6280\u8853\u306F\u7740\u5B9F\u306B\u6CE8\u76EE\u3092\u96C6\u3081\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u3088\u308A\u8A73\u7D30\u306A\u4E16\u754C\u3084
    Web \u30B5\u30A4\u30C8\u5411\u3051\u306B\u5E2F\u57DF\u5E45\u304C\u8FFD\u52A0\u3055\u308C\u3001\u901F\u5EA6\u3082\u5927\u5E45\u306B\u5411\u4E0A\u3057\u305F\u305F\u3081\u3001\u9700\u8981\u306E\u9AD8\u3044\u88FD\u54C1\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Es necesario sustituir la forma habitual de navegar por Internet. Su principal
    objetivo era que la realidad virtual sustituyera a Internet normal. \n\nCon grandes
    empresas invirtiendo grandes cantidades de capital en la causa, Digital Horizons
    se propuso crear una copia de la red mundial dentro de sus propias granjas de
    servidores masivas. \n\nDurante 5 a\xF1os, siguieron siendo un nicho de Internet,
    pero su tecnolog\xEDa de servidor atrajo atenci\xF3n constantemente. El ancho
    de banda a\xF1adido para mundos y sitios web m\xE1s detallados, junto con el
    aumento masivo de la velocidad, se convirti\xF3 en un producto de gran demanda."
--- !u!1 &5132739767515453652
