--- !u!114 &2837391920334323483
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5132739767515453652}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 8625352185951704962}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - 'A theme park exclusively centered around streamers, Dancing For Subs has rides,
    good food, and even a water park!


    I hope the crepes are good!

'
  - "Dancing For Subs ist ein Themenpark, der sich ausschlie\xDFlich auf Streamer
    konzentriert und Fahrgesch\xE4fte, gutes Essen und sogar einen Wasserpark bietet!\n\nIch
    hoffe, die Cr\xEApes sind gut!"
  - "\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DE\u30FC\u306E\u307F\u3092\u4E2D\u5FC3\u3068\u3057\u305F\u30C6\u30FC\u30DE
    \u30D1\u30FC\u30AF\u3067\u3042\u308B\u30C0\u30F3\u30B7\u30F3\u30B0 \u30D5\u30A9\u30FC
    \u30B5\u30D6\u30B9\u306B\u306F\u3001\u4E57\u308A\u7269\u3001\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u3044\u98DF\u4E8B\u3001\u30A6\u30A9\u30FC\u30BF\u30FC
    \u30D1\u30FC\u30AF\u307E\u3067\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\n\u30AF\u30EC\u30FC\u30D7\u304C\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u3044\u3068\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D\uFF01"
  - "Dancing For Subs, un parque tem\xE1tico centrado exclusivamente en serpentinas,
    tiene atracciones, buena comida e incluso un parque acu\xE1tico.\n\nEspero que
    las crepes est\xE9n buenas!"
--- !u!1 &5133847773482337093
