      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "With the latest Dive Set introduced by Digital Horizons, VR has tripled
    in use. And with that, of course comes the increase of use in VR Gab. \n\nThe
    increased bandwidth of the new server tech has dramatically increased the quality
    and size of both the worlds and the models, adding more \u201Cinteraction.\n\nTo
    you, this place is huge. \n\nThere are so many places to visit. Millions of realms
    sit at your fingertips, and are on average, way more developed than you noticed
    on any of the larger websites."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
