--- !u!114 &206756582418001967
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5306405799211571510}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 8341939018958565301}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Theories of the Internet encompass many things, from urban legends, to conspiracy
    theories surrounding government agencies, and / or corporations. \n\nThe new
    internet made possible by Digital Horizons increased bandwidth for larger spaces.
    And with it, an increase in reports of unexplainable phenomena. \n"
  - "Theorien \xFCber das Internet umfassen viele Dinge, von urbanen Legenden bis
    hin zu Verschw\xF6rungstheorien rund um Regierungsbeh\xF6rden und/oder Unternehmen.
    \n\nDas durch Digital Horizons erm\xF6glichte neue Internet erh\xF6ht die Bandbreite
    f\xFCr gr\xF6\xDFere R\xE4ume. Und damit einhergehend eine Zunahme von Berichten
    \xFCber unerkl\xE4rliche Ph\xE4nomene."
  - "\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306E\u7406\u8AD6\u306B\u306F\u3001\u90FD\u5E02\u4F1D\u8AAC\u304B\u3089\u653F\u5E9C\u6A5F\u95A2\u3084\u4F01\u696D\u3092\u3081\u3050\u308B\u9670\u8B00\u8AD6\u307E\u3067\u3001\u3055\u307E\u3056\u307E\u306A\u3082\u306E\u304C\u542B\u307E\u308C\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\nDigital Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u306B\u3088\u3063\u3066\u53EF\u80FD\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u306B\u3088\u308A\u3001\u3088\u308A\u5927\u304D\u306A\u30B9\u30DA\u30FC\u30B9\u306E\u5E2F\u57DF\u5E45\u304C\u5897\u52A0\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u305D\u308C\u306B\u4F34\u3044\u3001\u8AAC\u660E\u4E0D\u80FD\u306A\u73FE\u8C61\u306E\u5831\u544A\u3082\u5897\u52A0\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Las teor\xEDas de Internet abarcan muchas cosas, desde leyendas urbanas, hasta
    teor\xEDas de conspiraci\xF3n en torno a agencias gubernamentales y/o corporaciones.
    \n\nLa nueva Internet hecha posible por Digital Horizons aument\xF3 el ancho
    de banda para espacios m\xE1s grandes. Y con ello, un aumento de las denuncias
    de fen\xF3menos inexplicables."
