--- !u!114 &4265943945993652224
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5350692671280499146}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 6155017053264848826}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "We still don\u2019t know if these AI can reproduce; can they foster a child
    from their own code? There are still many questions to answer in this future.
    \n\nI am sure the answer is multifaceted in nature. "
  - "Wir wissen immer noch nicht, ob sich diese KI reproduzieren kann; K\xF6nnen
    sie ein Kind aus ihrem eigenen Kodex aufnehmen? Auch in dieser Zukunft sind noch
    viele Fragen zu beantworten. \n\nIch bin sicher, dass die Antwort vielschichtiger
    Natur ist."
  - "\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306E AI \u304C\u518D\u73FE\u3067\u304D\u308B\u304B\u3069\u3046\u304B\u306F\u307E\u3060\u308F\u304B\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002\u5F7C\u3089\u306F\u81EA\u5206\u305F\u3061\u306E\u30B3\u30FC\u30C9\u304B\u3089\u5B50\u4F9B\u3092\u80B2\u3066\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\u3053\u306E\u5C06\u6765\u306B\u304A\u3044\u3066\u306F\u3001\u7B54\u3048\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\u306A\u3089\u306A\u3044\u7591\u554F\u304C\u307E\u3060\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u305D\u306E\u7B54\u3048\u306F\u672C\u8CEA\u7684\u306B\u591A\u9762\u7684\u3067\u3042\u308B\u3068\u78BA\u4FE1\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Todav\xEDa no sabemos si estas IA pueden reproducirse; \xBFPueden acoger a un
    ni\xF1o seg\xFAn su propio c\xF3digo? Todav\xEDa quedan muchas preguntas por
    responder en este futuro. \n\nEstoy seguro de que la respuesta es de naturaleza
    multifac\xE9tica."
