  m_text: "In 2040, medical care has evolved into the realm of cyber punk a bit.
    \n\nCancer is on the chopping block with new strains being quashed the moment
    they are discovered. The good news is a relative dying from cancer is incredibly
    rare now. \n\nYes, you can still get a cold. \n"
