--- !u!114 &8796988029086751428
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6071307303789459764}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 2260798295439991128}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "The better the tech, the longer a synthgen lasted before needing to be replaced.
    A sizable amount of streamers loved this tech. During sleeping-only streams,
    users would allow the synthgens to run the stream. \n\nIt wasn\u2019t just v-tubers.
    Live streamers could also make their own scans. \n\nCurrently the public is mixed
    about these changes, and it caused many conflicts inside their communities. \n\nCompanies
    used this side effect to their advantage; creating copies of popular influencers
    to sell their wares. At the start of the boom, it was mostly done illegally. "
  - "Je besser die Technologie, desto l\xE4nger hielt ein Synthesizer, bevor er ersetzt
    werden musste. Eine betr\xE4chtliche Anzahl von Streamern war von dieser Technologie
    begeistert. W\xE4hrend Streams, die nur im Ruhezustand sind, w\xFCrden Benutzer
    den Synthgens erlauben, den Stream auszuf\xFChren. \n\nEs waren nicht nur V-Knollen.
    Live-Streamer k\xF6nnten auch eigene Scans durchf\xFChren. \n\nDerzeit ist die
    \xD6ffentlichkeit \xFCber diese Ver\xE4nderungen gemischt und hat viele Konflikte
    innerhalb ihrer Gemeinden verursacht. \n\nDiesen Nebeneffekt nutzten Unternehmen
    zu ihrem Vorteil; Erstellen von Kopien beliebter Influencer, um ihre Waren zu
    verkaufen. Zu Beginn des Booms geschah dies gr\xF6\xDFtenteils illegal."
  - "\u6280\u8853\u304C\u512A\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308C\u3070\u3044\u308B\u307B\u3069\u3001\u30B7\u30F3\u30BB\u30B8\u30A7\u30F3\u306F\u4EA4\u63DB\u3059\u308B\u307E\u3067\u306E\u5BFF\u547D\u304C\u9577\u304F\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u304B\u306A\u308A\u306E\u6570\u306E\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DE\u30FC\u304C\u3053\u306E\u30C6\u30AF\u30CE\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u3092\u6C17\u306B\u5165\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u30B9\u30EA\u30FC\u30D7\u306E\u307F\u306E\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30E0\u4E2D\u3001\u30E6\u30FC\u30B6\u30FC\u306F\u30B7\u30F3\u30BB\u30B8\u30A7\u30F3\u304C\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30E0\u3092\u5B9F\u884C\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8A31\u53EF\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\nV\u30C1\u30E5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u3060\u3051\u3067\u306F\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002\u30E9\u30A4\u30D6\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DE\u30FC\u306F\u72EC\u81EA\u306E\u30B9\u30AD\u30E3\u30F3\u3092\u884C\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u73FE\u5728\u3001\u4E00\u822C\u306E\u4EBA\u3005\u306F\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306E\u5909\u5316\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u8907\u96D1\u306A\u610F\u898B\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u304A\u308A\u3001\u30B3\u30DF\u30E5\u30CB\u30C6\u30A3\u5185\u3067\u591A\u304F\u306E\u7D1B\u4E89\u3092\u5F15\u304D\u8D77\u3053\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u4F01\u696D\u306F\u3053\u306E\u526F\u4F5C\u7528\u3092\u6709\u5229\u306B\u5229\u7528\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u4EBA\u6C17\u306E\u30A4\u30F3\u30D5\u30EB\u30A8\u30F3\u30B5\u30FC\u306E\u30B3\u30D4\u30FC\u3092\u4F5C\u6210\u3057\u3066\u5546\u54C1\u3092\u8CA9\u58F2\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3002\u30D6\u30FC\u30E0\u306E\u521D\u671F\u306B\u306F\u3001\u307B\u3068\u3093\u3069\u304C\u9055\u6CD5\u306B\u884C\u308F\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Cuanto mejor era la tecnolog\xEDa, m\xE1s duraba un sintetizador antes de necesitar
    ser reemplazado. A una cantidad considerable de streamers les encant\xF3 esta
    tecnolog\xEDa. Durante las transmisiones solo para dormir, los usuarios permitir\xEDan
    que los sintetizadores ejecutaran la transmisi\xF3n. \n\nNo fueron s\xF3lo los
    v-tubers. Los transmisores en vivo tambi\xE9n podr\xEDan realizar sus propios
    escaneos. \n\nActualmente, el p\xFAblico est\xE1 mezclado acerca de estos cambios,
    y causaron muchos conflictos dentro de sus comunidades. \n\nLas empresas aprovecharon
    este efecto secundario; creando copias de personas influyentes populares para
    vender sus productos. Al comienzo del auge, la mayor parte de las actividades
    se hac\xEDan de forma ilegal."
