--- !u!114 &1237675886824370959
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6169468018084128028}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 6954652607194224953}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "The LLM\u2019s of the 2020\u2019s were never artificial intelligence. \n\nLLM
    stands for Large Language Model. \n\nIn simpler terms, an LLM is a computer program
    that has been fed enough examples to be able to recognize and interpret human
    language or other types of complex data.\n"
  - "Die LLMs der 2020er Jahre waren nie k\xFCnstliche Intelligenz. \n\nLLM steht
    f\xFCr Large Language Model. \n\nEinfacher ausgedr\xFCckt ist ein LLM ein Computerprogramm,
    das mit gen\xFCgend Beispielen gef\xFCttert wurde, um menschliche Sprache oder
    andere Arten komplexer Daten erkennen und interpretieren zu k\xF6nnen."
  - "2020 \u5E74\u4EE3\u306E LLM \u306F\u6C7A\u3057\u3066\u4EBA\u5DE5\u77E5\u80FD\u3067\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\nLLM \u306F\u30E9\u30FC\u30B8\u8A00\u8A9E\u30E2\u30C7\u30EB\u306E\u7565\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u7C21\u5358\u306B\u8A00\u3046\u3068\u3001LLM \u306F\u3001\u4EBA\u9593\u306E\u8A00\u8A9E\u3084\u305D\u306E\u4ED6\u306E\u7A2E\u985E\u306E\u8907\u96D1\u306A\u30C7\u30FC\u30BF\u3092\u8A8D\u8B58\u3057\u3066\u89E3\u91C8\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u3001\u5341\u5206\u306A\u30B5\u30F3\u30D7\u30EB\u304C\u4E0E\u3048\u3089\u308C\u305F\u30B3\u30F3\u30D4\u30E5\u30FC\u30BF\u30FC
    \u30D7\u30ED\u30B0\u30E9\u30E0\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - "Los LLM de la d\xE9cada de 2020 nunca fueron inteligencia artificial. \n\nLLM
    significa Modelo de lenguaje grande. \n\nEn t\xE9rminos m\xE1s simples, un LLM
    es un programa inform\xE1tico que ha recibido suficientes ejemplos para poder
    reconocer e interpretar el lenguaje humano u otros tipos de datos complejos."
