--- !u!114 &1573009301825375656
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6216499428891332334}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 9183806946462533222}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Brain Pattern technology has already been a serious work in progress for a long
    time. In fact, the failed tests have been incorporated with AI to create what
    the internet calls \u201CSynthgens.\u201D \n\nSee the attached Lore in the Other\u2019s
    tab. \n\nSynthgens are in essence human brain pattern scans, augmented with AI
    in order to create human like copies of human beings. \n\nThey only exist in
    the internet as mascots. \n\nAlthough, some people have found ways to monetize
    them for content. \n"
  - "An der Brain-Pattern-Technologie wird bereits seit langem ernsthaft gearbeitet.
    Tats\xE4chlich wurden die fehlgeschlagenen Tests mit KI integriert, um das zu
    schaffen, was das Internet \u201ESynthgene\u201C nennt. \n\nSiehe die beigef\xFCgte
    \xDCberlieferung im Reiter \u201EAndere\u201C. \n\nBei Synthgenen handelt es
    sich im Wesentlichen um Musterscans menschlicher Gehirne, die mit KI erg\xE4nzt
    werden, um menschen\xE4hnliche Kopien von Menschen zu erstellen. \n\nSie existieren
    im Internet nur als Maskottchen. \n\nAllerdings haben einige Leute Wege gefunden,
    ihre Inhalte zu monetarisieren."
  - "Brain Pattern \u30C6\u30AF\u30CE\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u306F\u3001\u3059\u3067\u306B\u9577\u3044\u9593\u771F\u5263\u306B\u53D6\u308A\u7D44\u3093\u3067\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u5B9F\u969B\u3001\u5931\u6557\u3057\u305F\u30C6\u30B9\u30C8\u306B\u306F
    AI \u304C\u7D44\u307F\u8FBC\u307E\u308C\u3001\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u3067\u300CSynthgen\u300D\u3068\u547C\u3070\u308C\u308B\u3082\u306E\u304C\u4F5C\u6210\u3055\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u300C\u305D\u306E\u4ED6\u300D\u30BF\u30D6\u306B\u3042\u308B\u6DFB\u4ED8\u306E\u4F1D\u627F\u3092\u53C2\u7167\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002
    \n\nSynthgen \u306F\u672C\u8CEA\u7684\u306B\u306F\u4EBA\u9593\u306E\u8133\u306E\u30D1\u30BF\u30FC\u30F3\u3092\u30B9\u30AD\u30E3\u30F3\u3057\u3001\u4EBA\u9593\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u4EBA\u9593\u306E\u30B3\u30D4\u30FC\u3092\u4F5C\u6210\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B
    AI \u3067\u5F37\u5316\u3055\u308C\u305F\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3002 \n\n\u5F7C\u3089\u306F\u30DE\u30B9\u30B3\u30C3\u30C8\u3068\u3057\u3066\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u4E0A\u306B\u306E\u307F\u5B58\u5728\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u305F\u3060\u3057\u3001\u30B3\u30F3\u30C6\u30F3\u30C4\u3068\u3057\u3066\u53CE\u76CA\u5316\u3059\u308B\u65B9\u6CD5\u3092\u898B\u3064\u3051\u305F\u4EBA\u3082\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "La tecnolog\xEDa Brain Pattern ya ha sido un trabajo serio en progreso durante
    mucho tiempo. De hecho, las pruebas fallidas se han incorporado a la IA para
    crear lo que Internet llama \"sintet\xF3genos\". \n\nVea el Lore adjunto en la
    pesta\xF1a Otros. \n\nLos sintetizadores son, en esencia, escaneos de patrones
    del cerebro humano, aumentados con IA para crear copias de seres humanos similares
    a las humanas. \n\nS\xF3lo existen en Internet como mascotas. \n\nSin embargo,
    algunas personas han encontrado formas de monetizar su contenido."
