  m_text: "Comrade Del is a Zone survivor, forged by the harsh realities of his domain.
    \nBitter cold, radiation, snow, and merciless denizens, his personality mirrors
    the world. \n\nHe is calm and soft spoken, with a can do attitude. He seems to
    be watching you very carefully. \n\nSo far, he seems very cautious around you.
    \n\nYou can\u2019t blame him, considering you dodged several groups of renegades
    finding this place. \n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
