  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6312276930785829920}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 122761109673719640}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Comrade Del is a Zone survivor, forged by the harsh realities of his domain.
    \nBitter cold, radiation, snow, and merciless denizens, his personality mirrors
    the world. \n\nHe is calm and soft spoken, with a can do attitude. He seems to
    be watching you very carefully. \n\nSo far, he seems very cautious around you.
    \n\nYou can\u2019t blame him, considering you dodged several groups of renegades
    finding this place. \n"
  - "Genosse Del ist ein \xDCberlebender der Zone, geformt durch die harten Realit\xE4ten
    seiner Dom\xE4ne. \nBittere K\xE4lte, Strahlung, Schnee und gnadenlose Bewohner
    \u2013 seine Pers\xF6nlichkeit spiegelt die Welt wider. \n\nEr spricht ruhig
    und sanft, mit der Einstellung, etwas zu tun. Er scheint dich sehr aufmerksam
    zu beobachten. \n\nBisher scheint er in deiner N\xE4he sehr vorsichtig zu sein.
    \n\nSie k\xF6nnen es ihm nicht ver\xFCbeln, wenn man bedenkt, dass Sie mehreren
    Gruppen von Abtr\xFCnnigen ausgewichen sind, als Sie diesen Ort gefunden haben."
  - "\u540C\u5FD7\u30C7\u30EB\u306F\u30BE\u30FC\u30F3\u306E\u751F\u5B58\u8005\u3067\u3042\u308A\u3001\u5F7C\u306E\u9818\u57DF\u306E\u53B3\u3057\u3044\u73FE\u5B9F\u306B\u3088\u3063\u3066\u935B\u3048\u3089\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\u53B3\u3057\u3044\u5BD2\u3055\u3001\u653E\u5C04\u7DDA\u3001\u96EA\u3001\u305D\u3057\u3066\u7121\u6148\u60B2\u306A\u4F4F\u6C11\u3001\u5F7C\u306E\u6027\u683C\u306F\u4E16\u754C\u3092\u53CD\u6620\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u5F7C\u306F\u7A4F\u3084\u304B\u3067\u7A4F\u3084\u304B\u306A\u53E3\u8ABF\u3067\u3001\u4F55\u3067\u3082\u3067\u304D\u308B\u614B\u5EA6\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u5F7C\u306F\u3042\u306A\u305F\u3092\u3068\u3066\u3082\u6CE8\u610F\u6DF1\u304F\u898B\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u4ECA\u306E\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3001\u5F7C\u306F\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u5468\u308A\u3067\u306F\u3068\u3066\u3082\u8B66\u6212\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u304C\u3053\u306E\u5834\u6240\u3092\u898B\u3064\u3051\u305F\u53CD\u9006\u8005\u306E\u30B0\u30EB\u30FC\u30D7\u3092\u3044\u304F\u3064\u304B\u907F\u3051\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8003\u3048\u308B\u3068\u3001\u5F7C\u3092\u8CAC\u3081\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3067\u304D\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002"
  - "El camarada Del es un superviviente de la Zona, forjado por las duras realidades
    de su dominio. \nFr\xEDo intenso, radiaci\xF3n, nieve y habitantes despiadados,
    su personalidad refleja el mundo. \n\nEs tranquilo y de voz suave, con una actitud
    positiva. Parece estar observ\xE1ndote con mucha atenci\xF3n. \n\nHasta ahora,
    parece muy cauteloso contigo. \n\nNo puedes culparlo, considerando que esquivaste
    a varios grupos de renegados al encontrar este lugar."
