--- !u!114 &8553856603151991375
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6369815439805926490}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 4389100384582863527}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "The reason is simple: users have reported feeling watched from the shadows when
    alone. \n\n\LAre they using surveillance AI to watch what you do and reporting
    that to the nation\u2019s governments? \n\nThis feeling has persisted so long,
    and for so many users, that the rumors are starting to gain some traction. "
  - "Der Grund ist einfach: Benutzer haben berichtet, dass sie sich alleine aus dem
    Schatten beobachtet f\xFChlten. \n\n\LBenutzen sie \xDCberwachungs-KI, um zu
    \xFCberwachen, was Sie tun, und melden Sie dies den Regierungen des Landes? \n\nDieses
    Gef\xFChl h\xE4lt so lange und bei so vielen Benutzern an, dass die Ger\xFCchte
    allm\xE4hlich an Bedeutung gewinnen."
  - "\u7406\u7531\u306F\u7C21\u5358\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30E6\u30FC\u30B6\u30FC\u306F\u3001\u4E00\u4EBA\u3067\u3044\u308B\u3068\u304D\u306B\u5F71\u304B\u3089\u76E3\u8996\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3068\u611F\u3058\u308B\u3068\u5831\u544A\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\L\u5F7C\u3089\u306F\u76E3\u8996 AI \u3092\u4F7F\u3063\u3066\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u884C\u52D5\u3092\u76E3\u8996\u3057\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3092\u5404\u56FD\u653F\u5E9C\u306B\u5831\u544A\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B?
    \n\n\u3053\u306E\u611F\u60C5\u306F\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u9577\u3044\u9593\u3001\u305D\u3057\u3066\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u591A\u304F\u306E\u30E6\u30FC\u30B6\u30FC\u306E\u9593\u3067\u6301\u7D9A\u3057\u3066\u304D\u305F\u305F\u3081\u3001\u3053\u306E\u5642\u306F\u3042\u308B\u7A0B\u5EA6\u306E\u52E2\u3044\u3092\u6301\u3061\u59CB\u3081\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "La raz\xF3n es simple: los usuarios han informado que se sienten observados
    desde las sombras cuando est\xE1n solos. \n\n\L\xBFEst\xE1n utilizando inteligencia
    artificial de vigilancia para observar lo que usted hace e informarlo a los gobiernos
    de la naci\xF3n? \n\nEste sentimiento ha persistido durante tanto tiempo, y para
    tantos usuarios, que los rumores est\xE1n empezando a ganar fuerza."
