--- !u!114 &137081111399117908
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6813243050872810713}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 6226354395435659187}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "The name of this full setup? \n\nThe Dive.\n\nWith VR as it\u2019s main focus,
    sight, hearing, touch, smell, and taste were all there. It was muted compared
    to real life though. The reason for this was simple: the digital signals from
    the CPU chip don\u2019t translate as well to a bio signal.\n\nAs of 2040, over
    35 percent of the world\u2019s population has the Dead Man\u2019s Chip \u2018installed\u2019
    onto their foreheads. With Digital Horizon\u2019s 10 year almost flawless track
    record, many people trusts the company to find the best approach. "
  - "Der Name dieses vollst\xE4ndigen Setups? \n\nDer Tauchgang.\n\nMit VR als Hauptaugenmerk
    waren Sehen, H\xF6ren, F\xFChlen, Riechen und Schmecken alle da. Im Vergleich
    zum wirklichen Leben war es jedoch ged\xE4mpft. Der Grund daf\xFCr war einfach:
    Die digitalen Signale vom CPU-Chip lassen sich nicht so gut in ein Biosignal
    umwandeln.\n\nIm Jahr 2040 haben \xFCber 35 Prozent der Weltbev\xF6lkerung den
    Chip des toten Mannes auf ihrer Stirn \u201Einstalliert\u201C. Angesichts der
    10-j\xE4hrigen nahezu fehlerfreien Erfolgsbilanz von Digital Horizon vertrauen
    viele Menschen darauf, dass das Unternehmen den besten Ansatz findet."
  - "\u3053\u306E\u5B8C\u5168\u306A\u30BB\u30C3\u30C8\u30A2\u30C3\u30D7\u306E\u540D\u524D\u306F\u4F55\u3067\u3059\u304B?
    \n\n\u30C0\u30A4\u30D6\u3002\n\nVR \u3092\u4E3B\u306A\u7126\u70B9\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3001\u8996\u899A\u3001\u8074\u899A\u3001\u89E6\u899A\u3001\u55C5\u899A\u3001\u5473\u899A\u304C\u3059\u3079\u3066\u305D\u3053\u306B\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u73FE\u5B9F\u306B\u6BD4\u3079\u308B\u3068\u5730\u5473\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3051\u3069\u3002\u305D\u306E\u7406\u7531\u306F\u5358\u7D14\u3067\u3001CPU
    \u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u304B\u3089\u306E\u30C7\u30B8\u30BF\u30EB\u4FE1\u53F7\u306F\u751F\u4F53\u4FE1\u53F7\u306B\u3046\u307E\u304F\u5909\u63DB\u3055\u308C\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3089\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\n2040\u5E74\u306E\u6642\u70B9\u3067\u3001\u4E16\u754C\u4EBA\u53E3\u306E35\u30D1\u30FC\u30BB\u30F3\u30C8\u4EE5\u4E0A\u304C\u984D\u306B\u30C7\u30C3\u30C9\u30DE\u30F3\u30BA\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u3092\u300C\u88C5\u7740\u300D\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    Digital Horizo\u200B\u200Bn \u306E 10 \u5E74\u9593\u306B\u308F\u305F\u308B\u307B\u307C\u5B8C\u74A7\u306A\u5B9F\u7E3E\u306B\u3088\u308A\u3001\u591A\u304F\u306E\u4EBA\u304C\u540C\u793E\u304C\u6700\u9069\u306A\u30A2\u30D7\u30ED\u30FC\u30C1\u3092\u898B\u3064\u3051\u3089\u308C\u308B\u3068\u4FE1\u983C\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "\xBFEl nombre de esta configuraci\xF3n completa? \n\nLa inmersi\xF3n.\n\nCon
    la realidad virtual como enfoque principal, la vista, el o\xEDdo, el tacto, el
    olfato y el gusto estaban ah\xED. Sin embargo, fue silenciado en comparaci\xF3n
    con la vida real. La raz\xF3n de esto era simple: las se\xF1ales digitales del
    chip de la CPU no se traducen tan bien en una se\xF1al biol\xF3gica.\n\nEn 2040,
    m\xE1s del 35 por ciento de la poblaci\xF3n mundial tendr\xE1 el chip del hombre
    muerto \"instalado\" en la frente. Con el historial casi impecable de 10 a\xF1os
    de Digital Horizon, muchas personas conf\xEDan en la empresa para encontrar el
    mejor enfoque."
--- !u!1 &6813310392062312849
