      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Height:  5\u2019 7\u201D (170 CM)\nWeight: 210 Pounds ( 95 KG)\nBloodtype:
    A\n\nLead Supervisor of \u201CProject Elysium\u201D, Cliff is a straight-laced
    older gentleman with several grown up kids. Cliff is a kind and compassionate
    man. \n\nTo many in the lab, he is regarded as an older father type, a mentor.
    He is very good at listening. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
