--- !u!114 &6339116432130649073
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6987772171656507003}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 2472580859923475481}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Height:  5\u2019 7\u201D (170 CM)\nWeight: 210 Pounds ( 95 KG)\nBloodtype: A\n\nLead
    Supervisor of \u201CProject Elysium\u201D, Cliff is a straight-laced older gentleman
    with several grown up kids. Cliff is a kind and compassionate man. \n\nTo many
    in the lab, he is regarded as an older father type, a mentor. He is very good
    at listening. "
  - "H\xF6he: 5 Fu\xDF 7 Zoll (170 cm)\nGewicht: 210 Pfund (95 kg)\nBlutgruppe: A\n\nCliff,
    der leitende Leiter von \u201EProject Elysium\u201C, ist ein geradliniger \xE4lterer
    Herr mit mehreren erwachsenen Kindern. Cliff ist ein freundlicher und mitf\xFChlender
    Mann. \n\nF\xFCr viele im Labor gilt er als \xE4lterer Vatertyp, als Mentor.
    Er kann sehr gut zuh\xF6ren."
  - "\u8EAB\u9577: 5' 7\" (170 CM)\n\u91CD\u91CF: 210 \u30DD\u30F3\u30C9 (95 KG)\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B:
    A\n\n\u300C\u30D7\u30ED\u30B8\u30A7\u30AF\u30C8 \u30A8\u30EA\u30B8\u30A6\u30E0\u300D\u306E\u4E3B\u4EFB\u30B9\u30FC\u30D1\u30FC\u30D0\u30A4\u30B6\u30FC\u3067\u3042\u308B\u30AF\u30EA\u30D5\u306F\u3001\u6570\u4EBA\u306E\u6210\u4EBA\u3057\u305F\u5B50\u4F9B\u3092\u6301\u3064\u5805\u5B9F\u306A\u5E74\u914D\u306E\u7D33\u58EB\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30AF\u30EA\u30D5\u306F\u89AA\u5207\u3067\u601D\u3044\u3084\u308A\u306E\u3042\u308B\u7537\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u7814\u7A76\u5BA4\u306E\u591A\u304F\u306E\u4EBA\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3001\u5F7C\u306F\u5E74\u4E0A\u306E\u7236\u89AA\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u5B58\u5728\u3001\u6307\u5C0E\u8005\u3068\u307F\u306A\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u5F7C\u306F\u805E\u304F\u306E\u304C\u3068\u3066\u3082\u4E0A\u624B\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - "Altura: 6' 1\" (185 CM)\nPeso: 165 libras (75 kg)\nTipo dAltura: 5' 7\" (170
    CM)\nPeso: 210 libras (95 kg)\nTipo de sangre: A\n\nSupervisor principal del
    \"Proyecto Elysium\", Cliff es un caballero mayor y serio con varios hijos adultos.
    Cliff es un hombre amable y compasivo. \n\nMuchos en el laboratorio lo consideran
    un tipo de padre mayor, un mentor. Es muy bueno escuchando. sangre: B-\n\nGustos:
    \n\nManga * C\xE1lculo * D\xF6ner * Cerveza Light * Computadoras * Amistades\n\nNo
    le gusta: \n\nIgnorancia * Vino * Doblado Anime * Cosas que interrumpen el trabajo.
    *"
