--- !u!114 &7252571625440088814
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7080490296607067124}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 3723357907347353776}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "The transportation hub between domains. A station bristling with high tech,
    high speed trains, and shops. \n\nPeople, lots and lots of people. Everywhere.
    It seems to always be busy. \n"
  - "Der Transportknotenpunkt zwischen Dom\xE4nen. Ein Bahnhof voller Hightech, Hochgeschwindigkeitsz\xFCge
    und Gesch\xE4fte. \n\nMenschen, viele, viele Menschen. \xDCberall. Es scheint
    immer viel los zu sein."
  - "\u30C9\u30E1\u30A4\u30F3\u9593\u306E\u4EA4\u901A\u306E\u8981\u6240\u3002\u30CF\u30A4\u30C6\u30AF\u3001\u9AD8\u901F\u9244\u9053\u3001\u30B7\u30E7\u30C3\u30D7\u304C\u3072\u3057\u3081\u304F\u99C5\u3002
    \n\n\u4EBA\u3001\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u306E\u4EBA\u3002\u3069\u3053\u3067\u3082\u3002\u3044\u3064\u3082\u5FD9\u3057\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - "El centro de transporte entre dominios. Una estaci\xF3n repleta de alta tecnolog\xEDa,
    trenes de alta velocidad y tiendas. \n\nGente, much\xEDsima gente. En todos lados.
    Parece estar siempre ocupado."
