--- !u!114 &1344018210720760927
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7213741159704449219}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 1665297399969147282}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Most content creators that are not bots have moved to the deeper recesses of
    the server. With the right software, you can dodge the majority of the assault.
    \n\nWe all assumed with the new tech from Digital Horizons, they would start
    from scratch. \n\LHowever, our hopes were dashed with a half baked solution,
    with some content being outright bugged out because of conflicting software.
    \n\nThe servers that companies and bigger content creators own are separate,
    and work better with the full experience available to all.\n"
  - "Die meisten Content-Ersteller, die keine Bots sind, sind in die tieferen Bereiche
    des Servers abgewandert. Mit der richtigen Software k\xF6nnen Sie den meisten
    Angriffen entgehen. \n\nWir gingen alle davon aus, dass sie mit der neuen Technologie
    von Digital Horizons bei Null anfangen w\xFCrden. \n\LUnsere Hoffnungen wurden
    jedoch durch eine unausgegorene L\xF6sung zunichte gemacht, da einige Inhalte
    aufgrund widerspr\xFCchlicher Software v\xF6llig fehlerhaft waren. \n\nDie Server,
    die Unternehmen und gr\xF6\xDFere Content-Ersteller besitzen, sind getrennt und
    funktionieren besser, da allen das volle Erlebnis zur Verf\xFCgung steht."
  - "\u30DC\u30C3\u30C8\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\u307B\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306E\u30B3\u30F3\u30C6\u30F3\u30C4\u4F5C\u6210\u8005\u306F\u3001\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u306E\u5965\u6DF1\u304F\u306B\u79FB\u52D5\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u9069\u5207\u306A\u30BD\u30D5\u30C8\u30A6\u30A7\u30A2\u3092\u4F7F\u7528\u3059\u308C\u3070\u3001\u653B\u6483\u306E\u5927\u90E8\u5206\u3092\u56DE\u907F\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306F\u7686\u3001Digital Horizo\u200B\u200Bns \u306E\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u6280\u8853\u3092\u4F7F\u3063\u3066\u30BC\u30ED\u304B\u3089\u59CB\u3081\u308B\u3060\u308D\u3046\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\L\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3001\u30BD\u30D5\u30C8\u30A6\u30A7\u30A2\u306E\u7AF6\u5408\u306B\u3088\u308A\u4E00\u90E8\u306E\u30B3\u30F3\u30C6\u30F3\u30C4\u304C\u5B8C\u5168\u306B\u30D0\u30B0\u30A2\u30A6\u30C8\u3055\u308C\u3001\u4E2D\u9014\u534A\u7AEF\u306A\u30BD\u30EA\u30E5\u30FC\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3067\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306E\u671F\u5F85\u306F\u6253\u3061\u7815\u304B\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u4F01\u696D\u3068\u5927\u898F\u6A21\u306A\u30B3\u30F3\u30C6\u30F3\u30C4\u30AF\u30EA\u30A8\u30FC\u30BF\u30FC\u304C\u6240\u6709\u3059\u308B\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u306F\u5206\u96E2\u3055\u308C\u3066\u304A\u308A\u3001\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u4EBA\u304C\u5229\u7528\u3067\u304D\u308B\u5B8C\u5168\u306A\u30A8\u30AF\u30B9\u30DA\u30EA\u30A8\u30F3\u30B9\u3067\u3088\u308A\u9069\u5207\u306B\u52D5\u4F5C\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "La mayor\xEDa de los creadores de contenido que no son bots se han trasladado
    a los rincones m\xE1s profundos del servidor. Con el software adecuado, puedes
    esquivar la mayor\xEDa de los ataques. \n\nTodos asumimos que con la nueva tecnolog\xEDa
    de Digital Horizons comenzar\xEDan desde cero. \n\LSin embargo, nuestras esperanzas
    se vieron frustradas con una soluci\xF3n a medias, con parte del contenido completamente
    eliminado debido a un software conflictivo. \n\nLos servidores que poseen las
    empresas y los creadores de contenido m\xE1s importantes est\xE1n separados y
    funcionan mejor con la experiencia completa disponible para todos."
