--- !u!114 &4873343274146510736
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7255437390989228810}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7650271549998740870}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "A high desert with a temperate ecology. Rivers of what looks like lava meander
    across the landscape. In the distance, a humongous Castle is completely encamped
    inside a small village. \n"
  - "Eine Hochw\xFCste mit einer gem\xE4\xDFigten \xD6kologie. Fl\xFCsse, die wie
    Lava aussehen, schl\xE4ngeln sich durch die Landschaft. In der Ferne liegt eine
    riesige Burg, die vollst\xE4ndig in einem kleinen Dorf eingeschlossen ist."
  - "\u6E29\u5E2F\u306E\u751F\u614B\u7CFB\u3092\u6301\u3064\u9AD8\u5730\u306E\u7802\u6F20\u3002\u6EB6\u5CA9\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306B\u898B\u3048\u308B\u5DDD\u304C\u98A8\u666F\u3092\u6A2A\u5207\u3063\u3066\u86C7\u884C\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u9060\u304F\u306B\u3042\u308B\u5DE8\u5927\u306A\u57CE\u304C\u5C0F\u3055\u306A\u6751\u306E\u4E2D\u306B\u5B8C\u5168\u306B\u9663\u53D6\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Un desierto alto con una ecolog\xEDa templada. R\xEDos de lo que parecen lava
    serpentean por el paisaje. A lo lejos, un enorme castillo est\xE1 completamente
    acampado dentro de un peque\xF1o pueblo."
