--- !u!114 &5689422354389366666
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7475916370005583378}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 8334672624363065849}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "This method is extremely dangerous and full of vulnerabilities. And the researchers
    are well aware of this. \n\nThere are so many unknowns, so many ways a hostile
    party could take advantage of those vulnerabilities. \n\nWill Full Dive ever
    reach mass consumer adoption? We simply don\u2019t know. \nRight now there are
    two brave individuals testing the technique right now.  I guess, we leave it
    to them. \n\nTo you."
  - "Diese Methode ist \xE4u\xDFerst gef\xE4hrlich und voller Schwachstellen. Und
    die Forscher sind sich dessen durchaus bewusst. \n\nEs gibt so viele Unbekannte
    und so viele M\xF6glichkeiten, wie eine feindliche Partei diese Schwachstellen
    ausnutzen k\xF6nnte. \n\nWird Full Dive jemals die breite Akzeptanz bei den Verbrauchern
    erreichen? Wir wissen es einfach nicht. \nIm Moment testen zwei mutige Personen
    die Technik.  Ich sch\xE4tze, wir \xFCberlassen es ihnen. \n\nZu dir."
  - "\u3053\u306E\u65B9\u6CD5\u306F\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u5371\u967A\u3067\u3042\u308A\u3001\u8106\u5F31\u6027\u304C\u6E80\u8F09\u3067\u3059\u3002\u305D\u3057\u3066\u7814\u7A76\u8005\u305F\u3061\u306F\u3053\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3088\u304F\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u672A\u77E5\u306E\u90E8\u5206\u304C\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u591A\u304F\u3001\u6575\u5BFE\u52E2\u529B\u304C\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306E\u8106\u5F31\u6027\u3092\u5229\u7528\u3059\u308B\u53EF\u80FD\u6027\u304C\u3042\u308B\u65B9\u6CD5\u306F\u6570\u591A\u304F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\nFull Dive \u306F\u4E00\u822C\u6D88\u8CBB\u8005\u306B\u5E83\u304F\u666E\u53CA\u3059\u308B\u65E5\u304C\u6765\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B?\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306F\u5358\u306B\u77E5\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002
    \n\u73FE\u5728\u30012 \u4EBA\u306E\u52C7\u6562\u306A\u4EBA\u7269\u304C\u3053\u306E\u30C6\u30AF\u30CB\u30C3\u30AF\u3092\u30C6\u30B9\u30C8\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002 
    \u305F\u3076\u3093\u3001\u5F7C\u3089\u306B\u4EFB\u305B\u307E\u3059\u3002 \n\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u3078\u3002"
  - "Este m\xE9todo es extremadamente peligroso y est\xE1 lleno de vulnerabilidades.
    Y los investigadores lo saben muy bien. \n\nHay tantas inc\xF3gnitas, tantas
    formas en que una parte hostil podr\xEDa aprovechar esas vulnerabilidades. \n\n\xBFFull
    Dive alg\xFAn d\xEDa alcanzar\xE1 la adopci\xF3n masiva por parte de los consumidores?
    Simplemente no lo sabemos. \nEn este momento hay dos personas valientes probando
    la t\xE9cnica.  Supongo que se lo dejamos a ellos. \n\nA usted."
