--- !u!114 &5513547815907865018
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7548238512427990204}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 8630385292455578692}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Domains are sections of servers that were introduced during the massive change
    of Digital Horizon\u2019s internet upgrades. \n\nDomains are localized areas
    of control for an individual user, or group. It\u2019s like a profile banner
    in a 3D space. \n\nThe idea went viral after a user changed the entire look of
    their section of the server with questionable memes about \u2018skibidi toilets\u2019
    and lewd copy pastas. "
  - "Dom\xE4nen sind Abschnitte von Servern, die im Zuge der massiven \xC4nderung
    der Internet-Upgrades von Digital Horizon eingef\xFChrt wurden. \n\nDom\xE4nen
    sind lokalisierte Kontrollbereiche f\xFCr einen einzelnen Benutzer oder eine
    Gruppe. Es ist wie ein Profilbanner in einem 3D-Raum. \n\nDie Idee ging viral,
    nachdem ein Benutzer das gesamte Erscheinungsbild seines Serverbereichs mit fragw\xFCrdigen
    Memes \xFCber \u201ESkibidi-Toiletten\u201C und anz\xFCgliche Nachahmungen von
    Pasta ver\xE4ndert hatte."
  - "\u30C9\u30E1\u30A4\u30F3\u306F\u3001Digital Horizo\u200B\u200Bn \u306E\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8
    \u30A2\u30C3\u30D7\u30B0\u30EC\u30FC\u30C9\u306E\u5927\u898F\u6A21\u306A\u5909\u66F4\u4E2D\u306B\u5C0E\u5165\u3055\u308C\u305F\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u306E\u30BB\u30AF\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u30C9\u30E1\u30A4\u30F3\u306F\u3001\u500B\u3005\u306E\u30E6\u30FC\u30B6\u30FC\u307E\u305F\u306F\u30B0\u30EB\u30FC\u30D7\u304C\u5236\u5FA1\u3067\u304D\u308B\u30ED\u30FC\u30AB\u30E9\u30A4\u30BA\u3055\u308C\u305F\u9818\u57DF\u3067\u3059\u3002
    3D \u7A7A\u9593\u306E\u30D7\u30ED\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u30EB \u30D0\u30CA\u30FC\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u30E6\u30FC\u30B6\u30FC\u304C\u300C\u30B9\u30AD\u30D3\u30C7\u30A3\u30C8\u30A4\u30EC\u300D\u3084\u5351\u52A3\u306A\u30B3\u30D4\u30FC\u30D1\u30B9\u30BF\u306B\u95A2\u3059\u308B\u7591\u308F\u3057\u3044\u30DF\u30FC\u30E0\u3067\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u306E\u30BB\u30AF\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u5168\u4F53\u306E\u5916\u89B3\u3092\u5909\u66F4\u3057\u305F\u5F8C\u3001\u3053\u306E\u30A2\u30A4\u30C7\u30A2\u306F\u6025\u901F\u306B\u5E83\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Los dominios son secciones de servidores que se introdujeron durante el cambio
    masivo de las actualizaciones de Internet de Digital Horizon. \n\nLos dominios
    son \xE1reas de control localizadas para un usuario individual o grupo. Es como
    un banner de perfil en un espacio 3D. \n\nLa idea se volvi\xF3 viral despu\xE9s
    de que un usuario cambiara todo el aspecto de su secci\xF3n del servidor con
    memes cuestionables sobre \"ba\xF1os skibidi\" y copias de pastas lascivas."
