  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 285403709359288082}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Height:  5\u2019 2\u201D (154 CM)\nWeight:  Excuse Me??\nBloodtype: O Pos\n\nLikes:
    \n\nStreaming * Family * Technology * Mint Green Tea * Nature Hiking * Organizing\n\nDislikes:
    \n\nRash thinking * Chaotic Situations * Noisy Areas * Coffee * Condescending
    Attitudes\n"
  - "H\xF6he: 5 Fu\xDF 2 Zoll (154 cm)\nGewicht: Entschuldigung??\nBlutgruppe: O
    Pos\n\nLikes: \n\nStreaming * Familie * Technologie * Minzgr\xFCner Tee * Naturwandern
    * Organisieren\n\nAbneigungen: \n\nVorschnelles Denken * Chaotische Situationen
    * Laute Bereiche * Kaffee * Herablassende Haltung"
  - "\u8EAB\u9577: 5' 2\" (154 CM)\n\u4F53\u91CD: \u3059\u307F\u307E\u305B\u3093??\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B:
    O\u578B\n\n\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E: \n\n\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DF\u30F3\u30B0
    * \u5BB6\u65CF * \u30C6\u30AF\u30CE\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC * \u30DF\u30F3\u30C8 \u30B0\u30EA\u30FC\u30F3
    \u30C6\u30A3\u30FC * \u81EA\u7136\u30CF\u30A4\u30AD\u30F3\u30B0 * \u7D44\u7E54\u5316\n\n\u5ACC\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E\uFF1A
    \n\n\u6027\u6025\u306A\u601D\u8003 * \u6DF7\u4E71\u3057\u305F\u72B6\u6CC1 * \u9A12\u304C\u3057\u3044\u5834\u6240
    * \u30B3\u30FC\u30D2\u30FC * \u898B\u4E0B\u3057\u305F\u614B\u5EA6"
  - "Altura: 5' 2\" (154 CM)\nPeso: \xBFDisculpe?\nTipo de sangre: O Pos\n\nGustos:
    \n\nStreaming * Familia * Tecnolog\xEDa * T\xE9 verde menta * Senderismo en la
    naturaleza * Organizaci\xF3n\n\nNo le gusta: \n\nPensamiento precipitado * Situaciones
    ca\xF3ticas * \xC1reas ruidosas * Caf\xE9 * Actitudes condescendientes"
