--- !u!114 &4203635430363978809
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7918223938216586779}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "These events were normally attributed to the novel and new technology
    and existing bugs. After many attempts by developers to quash said bugs, the
    issues persisted. \n\nSettings would change suddenly with no one being held responsible.
    Others would point out that someone either forgot they changed it, or they are
    trolling (these types of incidents were very common).\n\nHaunted Domains isn\u2019t
    a thing: yet. \n\nWith some servers having heavy amounts of synthgens on it,
    the reports would spike. \n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9137770337806101678, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0,
    type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
  m_fontMaterials: []
