--- !u!114 &6751562512289031613
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7918223938216586779}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 4203635430363978809}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "These events were normally attributed to the novel and new technology and existing
    bugs. After many attempts by developers to quash said bugs, the issues persisted.
    \n\nSettings would change suddenly with no one being held responsible. Others
    would point out that someone either forgot they changed it, or they are trolling
    (these types of incidents were very common).\n\nHaunted Domains isn\u2019t a
    thing: yet. \n\nWith some servers having heavy amounts of synthgens on it, the
    reports would spike. \n"
  - "Diese Ereignisse wurden normalerweise auf die neuartige und neue Technologie
    sowie bestehende Fehler zur\xFCckgef\xFChrt. Nach vielen Versuchen der Entwickler,
    diese Fehler zu beseitigen, blieben die Probleme bestehen. \n\nDie Einstellungen
    w\xFCrden sich pl\xF6tzlich \xE4ndern, ohne dass jemand daf\xFCr verantwortlich
    gemacht werden k\xF6nnte. Andere w\xFCrden darauf hinweisen, dass jemand entweder
    vergessen hat, dass er es ge\xE4ndert hat, oder dass er trollt (diese Art von
    Vorf\xE4llen kam sehr h\xE4ufig vor).\n\nHaunted Domains gibt es noch nicht.
    \n\nDa auf einigen Servern gro\xDFe Mengen an Synthgens vorhanden sind, w\xFCrden
    die Berichte in die H\xF6he schnellen."
  - "\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306E\u51FA\u6765\u4E8B\u306F\u901A\u5E38\u3001\u65AC\u65B0\u306A\u30C6\u30AF\u30CE\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u3068\u65E2\u5B58\u306E\u30D0\u30B0\u306B\u8D77\u56E0\u3059\u308B\u3068\u8003\u3048\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u958B\u767A\u8005\u304C\u4E0A\u8A18\u306E\u30D0\u30B0\u3092\u89E3\u6D88\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u4F55\u5EA6\u3082\u8A66\u307F\u305F\u5F8C\u3082\u3001\u554F\u984C\u306F\u89E3\u6C7A\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u8AB0\u3082\u8CAC\u4EFB\u3092\u8CA0\u308F\u306A\u3044\u307E\u307E\u3001\u8A2D\u5B9A\u304C\u7A81\u7136\u5909\u66F4\u3055\u308C\u308B\u53EF\u80FD\u6027\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u8AB0\u304B\u304C\u5909\u66F4\u3057\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3092\u5FD8\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u304B\u3001\u8352\u3089\u3057\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u304B\u306E\u3069\u3061\u3089\u304B\u3060\u3068\u6307\u6458\u3059\u308B\u4EBA\u3082\u3044\u307E\u3059
    (\u3053\u306E\u7A2E\u306E\u4E8B\u4EF6\u306F\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u4E00\u822C\u7684\u3067\u3057\u305F)\u3002\n\nHaunted
    Domains \u306F\u307E\u3060\u5B58\u5728\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002 \n\n\u4E00\u90E8\u306E\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u306B\u5927\u91CF\u306E\u30B7\u30F3\u30BB\u30B8\u30A7\u30F3\u304C\u5B58\u5728\u3059\u308B\u3068\u3001\u30EC\u30DD\u30FC\u30C8\u304C\u6025\u5897\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Estos eventos normalmente se atribu\xEDan a la nueva tecnolog\xEDa y a los errores
    existentes. Despu\xE9s de muchos intentos por parte de los desarrolladores de
    solucionar dichos errores, los problemas persistieron. \n\nLa configuraci\xF3n
    cambiar\xEDa repentinamente sin que nadie fuera responsable. Otros se\xF1alar\xEDan
    que alguien olvid\xF3 que lo cambiaron o que est\xE1 trolleando (este tipo de
    incidentes eran muy comunes).\n\nHaunted Domains no existe: todav\xEDa. \n\nDado
    que algunos servidores tienen grandes cantidades de sintetizadores, los informes
    aumentar\xEDan."
--- !u!1 &7920361983109245320
