--- !u!114 &37130905501699697
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7920361983109245320}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 7170231319603491824}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Blunt, yet polite, with waves of seething sarcasm leaking out. \n\nThe conductor
    of the Japan High Speed Rail high speed train that moves through the internet.
    \n\nAoi Miyuki is an AI designed by the Japan High Speed Rail  to comfort and
    socialize with the train\u2019s travelers. \n\nVerified sources on the internet
    believe she became \u2018sentient\u2019 in 2034. How did they know? \n"
  - "Unverbl\xFCmt und doch h\xF6flich, aus dem Wellen brodelnden Sarkasmus hervorstr\xF6men.
    \n\nDer Schaffner des Hochgeschwindigkeitszuges Japan High Speed \u200B\u200BRail,
    der sich durch das Internet bewegt. \n\nAoi Miyuki ist eine KI, die von der Japan
    High Speed \u200B\u200BRail entwickelt wurde, um die Zugreisenden zu tr\xF6sten
    und mit ihnen in Kontakt zu treten. \n\nBest\xE4tigte Quellen im Internet gehen
    davon aus, dass sie im Jahr 2034 \u201Ef\xFChlend\u201C wurde. Woher wussten
    sie das?"
  - "\u3076\u3063\u304D\u3089\u307C\u3046\u3067\u3042\u308A\u306A\u304C\u3089\u793C\u5100\u6B63\u3057\u304F\u3001\u6012\u6D9B\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u76AE\u8089\u304C\u6F0F\u308C\u51FA\u3066\u304F\u308B\u3002
    \n\n\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u3092\u4ECB\u3057\u3066\u79FB\u52D5\u3059\u308B\u65E5\u672C\u9AD8\u901F\u9244\u9053\u306E\u9AD8\u901F\u9244\u9053\u306E\u8ECA\u638C\u3002
    \n\n\u8475\u307F\u3086\u304D\u306F\u3001\u5217\u8ECA\u306E\u4E57\u5BA2\u3092\u6170\u3081\u3001\u4EA4\u6D41\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u65E5\u672C\u9AD8\u901F\u9244\u9053\u306B\u3088\u3063\u3066\u8A2D\u8A08\u3055\u308C\u305F
    AI \u3067\u3059\u3002 \n\n\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u4E0A\u306E\u691C\u8A3C\u6E08\u307F\u306E\u60C5\u5831\u6E90\u306F\u3001\u5F7C\u5973\u304C
    2034 \u5E74\u306B\u300C\u77E5\u899A\u300D\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u3068\u4FE1\u3058\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u5F7C\u3089\u306F\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3063\u3066\u77E5\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B?"
  - "Contundente, pero educado, con oleadas de sarcasmo hirviente que se filtran.
    \n\nEl conductor del tren de alta velocidad Japan High Speed \u200B\u200BRail
    que se desplaza a trav\xE9s de internet. \n\nAoi Miyuki es una IA dise\xF1ada
    por Japan High Speed \u200B\u200BRail para consolar y socializar con los viajeros
    del tren. \n\nFuentes verificadas en Internet creen que se volvi\xF3 \"consciente\"
    en 2034. \xBFC\xF3mo lo supieron?"
