--- !u!114 &5187813438155675207
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8056457838247330151}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 3052383229327210842}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "The point of this two chip design was to allow a customer to pull the CPU Module
    off to remove one\u2019s self from the internet, no matter the situation. \n\nYou
    could upgrade your CPU Chip, or add a different type with different security
    thresholds. The governments even had chips specifically for people with higher
    security clearances. \n\nA nice side effect of the Dead Man\u2019s chip was it\u2019s
    ability to help burn excess fat as battery power. \n\nThe hard code built into
    the Dead Man\u2019s Chip prevented any sort of hacking, although people still
    voiced their concerns. \n"
  - "Der Zweck dieses Zwei-Chip-Designs bestand darin, es einem Kunden zu erm\xF6glichen,
    das CPU-Modul abzunehmen, um sich aus dem Internet zu entfernen, egal in welcher
    Situation. \n\nSie k\xF6nnen Ihren CPU-Chip aktualisieren oder einen anderen
    Typ mit anderen Sicherheitsschwellen hinzuf\xFCgen. Die Regierungen hatten sogar
    Chips speziell f\xFCr Personen mit h\xF6herer Sicherheitsfreigabe. \n\nEin netter
    Nebeneffekt des Dead Man-Chips war seine F\xE4higkeit, \xFCbersch\xFCssiges Fett
    als Batteriestrom zu verbrennen. \n\nDer im Dead Man\u2019s Chip eingebaute harte
    Code verhinderte jegliche Art von Hacking, obwohl die Leute immer noch ihre Bedenken
    \xE4u\xDFerten."
  - "\u3053\u306E 2 \u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u8A2D\u8A08\u306E\u30DD\u30A4\u30F3\u30C8\u306F\u3001\u72B6\u6CC1\u306B\u95A2\u4FC2\u306A\u304F\u3001\u9867\u5BA2\u304C
    CPU \u30E2\u30B8\u30E5\u30FC\u30EB\u3092\u53D6\u308A\u5916\u3057\u3066\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u304B\u3089\u81EA\u5206\u81EA\u8EAB\u3092\u5207\u308A\u96E2\u305B\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\nCPU \u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u3092\u30A2\u30C3\u30D7\u30B0\u30EC\u30FC\u30C9\u3057\u305F\u308A\u3001\u7570\u306A\u308B\u30BB\u30AD\u30E5\u30EA\u30C6\u30A3\u3057\u304D\u3044\u5024\u3092\u6301\u3064\u5225\u306E\u30BF\u30A4\u30D7\u3092\u8FFD\u52A0\u3057\u305F\u308A\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002\u653F\u5E9C\u306F\u3001\u3088\u308A\u9AD8\u3044\u30BB\u30AD\u30E5\u30EA\u30C6\u30A3\u8A31\u53EF\u3092\u6301\u3064\u4EBA\u3005\u5C02\u7528\u306E\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u3055\u3048\u7528\u610F\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\nDead Man\u2019s \u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u306E\u512A\u308C\u305F\u526F\u4F5C\u7528\u306F\u3001\u30D0\u30C3\u30C6\u30EA\u30FC\u96FB\u529B\u3068\u3057\u3066\u4F59\u5206\u306A\u8102\u80AA\u306E\u71C3\u713C\u3092\u52A9\u3051\u308B\u6A5F\u80FD\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u30C7\u30C3\u30C9\u30DE\u30F3\u30BA\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u306B\u7D44\u307F\u8FBC\u307E\u308C\u305F\u30CF\u30FC\u30C9\u30B3\u30FC\u30C9\u306F\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308B\u7A2E\u985E\u306E\u30CF\u30C3\u30AD\u30F3\u30B0\u3092\u9632\u6B62\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u3001\u4EBA\u3005\u306F\u4F9D\u7136\u3068\u3057\u3066\u61F8\u5FF5\u306E\u58F0\u3092\u4E0A\u3052\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "El objetivo de este dise\xF1o de dos chips era permitir que un cliente quitara
    el m\xF3dulo de la CPU para desconectarse de Internet, sin importar la situaci\xF3n.
    \n\nPuede actualizar el chip de su CPU o agregar un tipo diferente con diferentes
    umbrales de seguridad. Los gobiernos incluso ten\xEDan chips espec\xEDficos para
    personas con mayores autorizaciones de seguridad. \n\nUn buen efecto secundario
    del chip del Hombre Muerto fue su capacidad para ayudar a quemar el exceso de
    grasa como energ\xEDa de la bater\xEDa. \n\nEl c\xF3digo integrado en el chip
    del Hombre Muerto impidi\xF3 cualquier tipo de pirater\xEDa, aunque la gente
    a\xFAn expres\xF3 sus preocupaciones."
