  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 4492216673236068137}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - 'A prominent star in the VRGab community, her world is nestled inside the VR
    Gab Servers, with attachments into the twatch servers for safe for work streaming.


'
  - "Als prominenter Star in der VRGab-Community ist ihre Welt in den VR Gab-Servern
    eingebettet, mit Anh\xE4ngen an die Twatch-Server f\xFCr sicheres Streaming am
    Arbeitsplatz."
  - "VRGab \u30B3\u30DF\u30E5\u30CB\u30C6\u30A3\u306E\u8457\u540D\u306A\u30B9\u30BF\u30FC\u3067\u3042\u308B\u5F7C\u5973\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u306F
    VR Gab \u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u5185\u306B\u3042\u308A\u3001\u4F5C\u54C1\u306E\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DF\u30F3\u30B0\u3092\u5B89\u5168\u306B\u884C\u3046\u305F\u3081\u306B
    twatch \u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u306B\u6DFB\u4ED8\u30D5\u30A1\u30A4\u30EB\u304C\u7D44\u307F\u8FBC\u307E\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Una estrella prominente en la comunidad VRGab, su mundo est\xE1 ubicado dentro
    de los servidores VR Gab, con archivos adjuntos en los servidores twatch para
    una transmisi\xF3n segura para el trabajo."
