  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "In the end, the internet changed to a 3D space, with holographic screens
    on computers and laptops, with glasses like VR allowing augmented reality that
    ran fast and efficiently. \n\nDuring this evolution, Digital Horizons dumped
    billions into research and development into Human Biological Interfaces.\n \nEven
    though they had your standard VR headsets available, and they were very popular
    (they were standard eyeglass size, with tracking done via small bands that attached
    to your limbs) , they hinted at a new interface that could be used not just for
    internet and VR, but for everything. \n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9137770337806101678, guid: 9476861b6a9cdca409e8769907d1a9d0,
    type: 2}
