--- !u!114 &3734700694550459070
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8101762865521485757}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 1649891142256465908}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Larger servers are sectioned off in zones, and even include food courts, movie
    theaters, basketball courts, so on. \n\nA good example is the Twatch server.
    \n\nThey even went so far as to add full office buildings for large stream teams,
    to give them a place to conduct meetings online for collaborations. \n\nLarge
    streamers, some with lots of capital, have been capable of creating their own
    domains attached to the twatch servers, set up almost like theme parks for the
    server: a testament to the capability of the new server technology. \n"
  - "Gr\xF6\xDFere Server sind in Zonen unterteilt und umfassen sogar Food-Courts,
    Kinos, Basketballpl\xE4tze usw. \n\nEin gutes Beispiel ist der Twatch-Server.
    \n\nSie gingen sogar so weit, komplette B\xFCrogeb\xE4ude f\xFCr gro\xDFe Stream-Teams
    zu errichten, um ihnen einen Ort f\xFCr die Durchf\xFChrung von Online-Meetings
    zur Zusammenarbeit zu bieten. \n\nGro\xDFe Streamer, von denen einige \xFCber
    viel Kapital verf\xFCgten, waren in der Lage, ihre eigenen Domains zu erstellen,
    die an die Twatch-Server angeschlossen waren und fast wie Themenparks f\xFCr
    die Server eingerichtet wurden: ein Beweis f\xFCr die Leistungsf\xE4higkeit der
    neuen Servertechnologie."
  - "\u5927\u304D\u306A\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u306F\u30BE\u30FC\u30F3\u306B\u533A\u5207\u3089\u308C\u3066\u304A\u308A\u3001\u30D5\u30FC\u30C9
    \u30B3\u30FC\u30C8\u3001\u6620\u753B\u9928\u3001\u30D0\u30B9\u30B1\u30C3\u30C8\u30DC\u30FC\u30EB
    \u30B3\u30FC\u30C8\u306A\u3069\u3082\u542B\u307E\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u826F\u3044\u4F8B\u306F Twatch \u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u5F7C\u3089\u306F\u3001\u5927\u898F\u6A21\u306A\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30E0
    \u30C1\u30FC\u30E0\u5411\u3051\u306B\u5B8C\u5168\u306A\u30AA\u30D5\u30A3\u30B9
    \u30D3\u30EB\u3092\u5897\u7BC9\u3057\u3066\u3001\u30B3\u30E9\u30DC\u30EC\u30FC\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u30AA\u30F3\u30E9\u30A4\u30F3\u3067\u4F1A\u8B70\u3092\u884C\u3046\u5834\u6240\u3092\u63D0\u4F9B\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3055\u3048\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u591A\u304F\u306E\u8CC7\u91D1\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u5927\u898F\u6A21\u306A\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DE\u30FC\u306F\u3001twatch
    \u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u306B\u63A5\u7D9A\u3055\u308C\u305F\u72EC\u81EA\u306E\u30C9\u30E1\u30A4\u30F3\u3092\u4F5C\u6210\u3057\u3066\u3001\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC\u306E\u30C6\u30FC\u30DE\u30D1\u30FC\u30AF\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306B\u30BB\u30C3\u30C8\u30A2\u30C3\u30D7\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u3053\u308C\u306F\u3001\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u30B5\u30FC\u30D0\u30FC
    \u30C6\u30AF\u30CE\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u306E\u80FD\u529B\u306E\u8A3C\u62E0\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - "Los servidores m\xE1s grandes est\xE1n divididos en zonas e incluso incluyen
    patios de comidas, cines, canchas de baloncesto, etc. \n\nUn buen ejemplo es
    el servidor Twatch. \n\nIncluso llegaron a agregar edificios de oficinas completos
    para equipos de flujo grandes, para brindarles un lugar donde realizar reuniones
    en l\xEDnea para colaboraciones. \n\nLos grandes streamers, algunos con mucho
    capital, han sido capaces de crear sus propios dominios adjuntos a los servidores
    de Twatch, configurados casi como parques tem\xE1ticos para el servidor: un testimonio
    de la capacidad de la nueva tecnolog\xEDa de servidores."
