--- !u!114 &9014354993982013539
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8239250629545765438}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 4830958825198140174}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "At least I know his name from his tag: Shoma Kojima. I am sure I refer to them
    by their last name. \n\nSo the chat brought up some information. \n\nKojima quit
    his corporate job. Is that normal in Japan?\n\nA salaryman he explained. It seems
    work culture is completely different in Japan. \n\nI knew that kind of. I didn\u2019t
    expect anime references to be that close to the truth though."
  - "Zumindest kenne ich seinen Namen von seinem Tag: Shoma Kojima. Ich bin sicher,
    dass ich sie mit ihrem Nachnamen anspreche. \n\nDer Chat brachte also einige
    Informationen hervor. \n\nKojima hat seinen Firmenjob gek\xFCndigt. Ist das in
    Japan normal?\n\nEin Gehaltsempf\xE4nger, erkl\xE4rte er. Es scheint, dass die
    Arbeitskultur in Japan v\xF6llig anders ist. \n\nSo etwas kannte ich. Allerdings
    h\xE4tte ich nicht erwartet, dass die Anime-Referenzen so nah an der Wahrheit
    sind."
  - "\u5C11\u306A\u304F\u3068\u3082\u79C1\u306F\u30BF\u30B0\u304B\u3089\u5F7C\u306E\u540D\u524D\u3092\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\uFF1A\u5C0F\u5CF6\u7FD4\u99AC\u3002\u79C1\u306F\u5F7C\u3089\u3092\u59D3\u3067\u547C\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308B\u3068\u78BA\u4FE1\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u305D\u3053\u3067\u30C1\u30E3\u30C3\u30C8\u3067\u3044\u304F\u3064\u304B\u306E\u60C5\u5831\u304C\u5F97\u3089\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u5C0F\u5CF6\u3055\u3093\u306F\u4F1A\u793E\u3092\u8F9E\u3081\u305F\u3002\u65E5\u672C\u3067\u306F\u305D\u308C\u304C\u666E\u901A\u306A\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F\n\n\u30B5\u30E9\u30EA\u30FC\u30DE\u30F3\u304C\u8AAC\u660E\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\u3002\u65E5\u672C\u3068\u306F\u52B4\u50CD\u6587\u5316\u304C\u5168\u304F\u9055\u3046\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u306F\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u30A2\u30CB\u30E1\u306E\u5F15\u7528\u304C\u3053\u308C\u307B\u3069\u771F\u5B9F\u306B\u8FD1\u3044\u3068\u306F\u601D\u3044\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002"
  - "Al menos s\xE9 su nombre por su etiqueta: Shoma Kojima. Estoy seguro de que
    me refiero a ellos por su apellido. \n\nEntonces el chat arroj\xF3 cierta informaci\xF3n.
    \n\nKojima renunci\xF3 a su trabajo corporativo. \xBFEs eso normal en Jap\xF3n?\n\nUn
    asalariado, explic\xF3. Parece que la cultura laboral es completamente diferente
    en Jap\xF3n. \n\nSab\xEDa ese tipo de cosas. Sin embargo, no esperaba que las
    referencias al anime estuvieran tan cerca de la verdad."
