--- !u!114 &5086102030899919563
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8308829423490648585}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 287160012432112778}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "This is his final project before he retires.\n\nSome whisper that Claire is
    attached to Cliff off the books, and will soon take over the lab for him. \n\nFinding
    out the connection might be useful. Maybe you should ask Shirobi?\n"
  - "Dies ist sein letztes Projekt, bevor er in den Ruhestand geht.\n\nEinige fl\xFCstern,
    dass Claire heimlich an Cliff h\xE4ngt und bald das Labor f\xFCr ihn \xFCbernehmen
    wird. \n\nEs k\xF6nnte hilfreich sein, den Zusammenhang herauszufinden. Vielleicht
    solltest du Shirobi fragen?"
  - "\u3053\u308C\u306F\u5F7C\u304C\u5F15\u9000\u3059\u308B\u524D\u306E\u6700\u5F8C\u306E\u30D7\u30ED\u30B8\u30A7\u30AF\u30C8\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\n\u30AF\u30EC\u30A2\u306F\u30AF\u30EA\u30D5\u306B\u57F7\u7740\u3057\u3066\u304A\u308A\u3001\u9593\u3082\u306A\u304F\u30AF\u30EA\u30D5\u306B\u4EE3\u308F\u3063\u3066\u7814\u7A76\u5BA4\u3092\u5F15\u304D\u7D99\u3050\u3060\u308D\u3046\u3068\u3055\u3055\u3084\u304F\u4EBA\u3082\u3044\u308B\u3002
    \n\n\u95A2\u4FC2\u3092\u8ABF\u3079\u308B\u3068\u5F79\u306B\u7ACB\u3064\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002\u30B7\u30ED\u30D3\u3055\u3093\u306B\u805E\u3044\u3066\u307F\u305F\u307B\u3046\u304C\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F"
  - "Este es su proyecto final antes de jubilarse.\n\nAlgunos susurran que Claire
    est\xE1 apegada a Cliff fuera de los libros y que pronto se har\xE1 cargo del
    laboratorio por \xE9l. \n\nDescubrir la conexi\xF3n puede resultar \xFAtil. \xBFQuiz\xE1s
    deber\xEDas preguntarle a Shirobi?"
