--- !u!114 &747727132050914661
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8382462277190600701}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 154096264716900708}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Holographic displays float around, sending advertisements to the masses. Loud,
    and boisterous music, mixed with the chatter of thousands of people saturate
    the air to the point it becomes a solid mass of white noise. \n"
  - "Holografische Displays schweben herum und senden Werbung an die Massen. Laute
    und ausgelassene Musik, gemischt mit dem Geplapper Tausender Menschen, durchdringt
    die Luft bis zu dem Punkt, dass sie zu einer massiven Masse aus wei\xDFem Rauschen
    wird."
  - "\u30DB\u30ED\u30B0\u30E9\u30D5\u30A3\u30C3\u30AF \u30C7\u30A3\u30B9\u30D7\u30EC\u30A4\u304C\u5468\u56F2\u306B\u6D6E\u304B\u3073\u4E0A\u304C\u308A\u3001\u5927\u8846\u306B\u5E83\u544A\u3092\u9001\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u5927\u58F0\u3067\u9A12\u3005\u3057\u3044\u97F3\u697D\u304C\u3001\u4F55\u5343\u4EBA\u3082\u306E\u4EBA\u3005\u306E\u304A\u3057\u3083\u3079\u308A\u3068\u6DF7\u3056\u308A\u5408\u3063\u3066\u3001\u7A7A\u6C17\u304C\u98FD\u548C\u3057\u3001\u30DB\u30EF\u30A4\u30C8\u30CE\u30A4\u30BA\u306E\u56FA\u307E\u308A\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Las pantallas hologr\xE1ficas flotan y env\xEDan anuncios a las masas. La m\xFAsica
    fuerte y bulliciosa, mezclada con el parloteo de miles de personas, satura el
    aire hasta el punto de convertirlo en una masa s\xF3lida de ruido blanco."
