--- !u!114 &6946479513077434532
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8517633180113215220}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 408127670995821506}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "A bowling alley on the internet? Has a small stand with food and drinks, including
    alcohol, and 12 bowling lanes. \n\nYou even have to rent shoes!\n"
  - "Eine Bowlingbahn im Internet? Verf\xFCgt \xFCber einen kleinen Stand mit Speisen
    und Getr\xE4nken, einschlie\xDFlich Alkohol, und 12 Bowlingbahnen. \n\nSie m\xFCssen
    sogar Schuhe mieten!"
  - "\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u4E0A\u306E\u30DC\u30A6\u30EA\u30F3\u30B0\u5834\uFF1F\u30A2\u30EB\u30B3\u30FC\u30EB\u3092\u542B\u3080\u98DF\u3079\u7269\u3084\u98F2\u307F\u7269\u3092\u63D0\u4F9B\u3059\u308B\u5C0F\u3055\u306A\u30B9\u30BF\u30F3\u30C9\u3068
    12 \u306E\u30DC\u30FC\u30EA\u30F3\u30B0 \u30EC\u30FC\u30F3\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u9774\u306E\u30EC\u30F3\u30BF\u30EB\u3082\u5FC5\u8981\u3067\u3059\uFF01"
  - "\xBFUna bolera en Internet? Tiene un peque\xF1o puesto con comida y bebidas,
    incluido alcohol, y 12 pistas de bolos. \n\n\xA1Incluso tienes que alquilar zapatos!"
