--- !u!114 &7204851314680660019
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8645297102072395526}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 4745452588105629104}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "A cozy home nestled in a Japanese suburb: full size bath, solid kitchen, laundry
    room, and 3 bedrooms. \n\nThere is a nagging feeling I know this place. Wracking
    my brain\u2026\n"
  - "Ein gem\xFCtliches Zuhause in einem japanischen Vorort: gro\xDFes Bad, solide
    K\xFCche, Waschk\xFCche und 3 Schlafzimmer. \n\nIch habe das qu\xE4lende Gef\xFChl,
    diesen Ort zu kennen. Zermartert mir den Kopf..."
  - "\u65E5\u672C\u306E\u90CA\u5916\u306B\u4F47\u3080\u5C45\u5FC3\u5730\u306E\u826F\u3044\u5BB6\u3002\u30D5\u30EB\u30B5\u30A4\u30BA\u306E\u30D0\u30B9\u3001\u9811\u4E08\u306A\u30AD\u30C3\u30C1\u30F3\u3001\u30E9\u30F3\u30C9\u30EA\u30FC\u30EB\u30FC\u30E0\u3001\u30D9\u30C3\u30C9\u30EB\u30FC\u30E0
    3 \u5BA4\u3002 \n\n\u79C1\u306F\u3053\u306E\u5834\u6240\u3092\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3057\u3064\u3053\u3044\u611F\u3058\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u982D\u3092\u60A9\u307E\u305B\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u2026"
  - "Una casa acogedora ubicada en un suburbio japon\xE9s: ba\xF1o grande, cocina
    s\xF3lida, lavadero y 3 dormitorios. \n\nHay una sensaci\xF3n persistente de
    que conozco este lugar. Destrozando mi cerebro..."
