--- !u!114 &8038758409389593959
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8650674828802295718}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 4286721025193750102}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Customers had full control. \n\nIt was a chip implanted into your forehead.
    This chip used the biological power of your own body to run, and it was very
    efficient. It was tied to your hearing, sight, sense of touch, and taste centers
    of your brain using specialized fiberoptic cabling. \n\nEven installed, it remained
    inert. You would have to slap a CPU Module on where the Dead Man\u2019s Chip
    was located to activate it. \n"
  - "Die Kunden hatten die volle Kontrolle. \n\nEs war ein Chip, der in Ihre Stirn
    implantiert wurde. Dieser Chip nutzte die biologische Kraft Ihres eigenen K\xF6rpers,
    um zu funktionieren, und er war sehr effizient. Es wurde \xFCber spezielle Glasfaserkabel
    mit Ihren H\xF6r-, Seh-, Tastsinn- und Geschmackszentren Ihres Gehirns verbunden.
    \n\nSelbst im eingebauten Zustand blieb es inert. Sie m\xFCssten ein CPU-Modul
    auf die Stelle schlagen, an der sich der Chip des toten Mannes befand, um ihn
    zu aktivieren."
  - "\u9867\u5BA2\u306F\u5B8C\u5168\u306B\u30B3\u30F3\u30C8\u30ED\u30FC\u30EB\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u305D\u308C\u306F\u984D\u306B\u57CB\u3081\u8FBC\u307E\u308C\u305F\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3002\u3053\u306E\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u306F\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u4F53\u306E\u751F\u7269\u5B66\u7684\u306A\u529B\u3092\u5229\u7528\u3057\u3066\u52D5\u4F5C\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u3001\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u52B9\u7387\u7684\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002\u305D\u308C\u306F\u3001\u7279\u6B8A\u306A\u5149\u30D5\u30A1\u30A4\u30D0\u30FC\u30B1\u30FC\u30D6\u30EB\u3092\u4F7F\u7528\u3057\u3066\u3001\u8133\u306E\u8074\u899A\u3001\u8996\u899A\u3001\u89E6\u899A\u3001\u5473\u899A\u306E\u4E2D\u67A2\u306B\u7D50\u3073\u4ED8\u3051\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u53D6\u308A\u4ED8\u3051\u3066\u3082\u3001\u4E0D\u6D3B\u6027\u306E\u307E\u307E\u3067\u3057\u305F\u3002\u30C7\u30C3\u30C9\u30DE\u30F3\u30BA\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u3092\u30A2\u30AF\u30C6\u30A3\u30D6\u306B\u3059\u308B\u306B\u306F\u3001\u30C7\u30C3\u30C9\u30DE\u30F3\u30BA\u30C1\u30C3\u30D7\u304C\u914D\u7F6E\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u5834\u6240\u306B
    CPU \u30E2\u30B8\u30E5\u30FC\u30EB\u3092\u53E9\u304D\u3064\u3051\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Los clientes ten\xEDan control total. \n\nEra un chip implantado en tu frente.
    Este chip utilizaba el poder biol\xF3gico de su propio cuerpo para funcionar
    y era muy eficiente. Estaba vinculado a los centros cerebrales de la audici\xF3n,
    la vista, el sentido del tacto y el gusto mediante un cableado de fibra \xF3ptica
    especializado. \n\nIncluso instalado, permaneci\xF3 inerte. Tendr\xEDas que colocar
    un m\xF3dulo de CPU en el lugar donde se encontraba el chip del hombre muerto
    para activarlo."
--- !u!1 &8655452137435013186
