--- !u!114 &6763291679587408182
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8748763610110626003}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 1213501442466614474}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Most of the algorithms used were based off of the human brain based synthgens
    that are online. \n\nIn 2028, a new active inference AI was developed in an AI
    you might know.  Her name is Aoi Miyuki. \n\nAs she adapted and learned from
    her job as a train conductor, she learned enough to become \u2018sentient\u2019
    around 2034: a mere six years from activation. \n\nThere are surely other Active
    Inference AI roaming about the internet and being used in all kinds of places.
    \n"
  - "Die meisten der verwendeten Algorithmen basierten auf den online verf\xFCgbaren
    Synthgenen des menschlichen Gehirns. \n\nIm Jahr 2028 wurde eine neue aktive
    Inferenz-KI entwickelt, eine KI, die Sie vielleicht kennen.  Ihr Name ist Aoi
    Miyuki. \n\nW\xE4hrend sie sich an ihren Job als Zugbegleiterin anpasste und
    daraus lernte, lernte sie genug, um um 2034 \u201Eempfindungsf\xE4hig\u201C zu
    werden: nur sechs Jahre nach der Aktivierung. \n\nEs gibt sicherlich noch andere
    aktive Inferenz-KI, die im Internet unterwegs sind und an allen m\xF6glichen
    Orten eingesetzt werden."
  - "\u4F7F\u7528\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u30A2\u30EB\u30B4\u30EA\u30BA\u30E0\u306E\u307B\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306F\u3001\u30AA\u30F3\u30E9\u30A4\u30F3\u306B\u3042\u308B\u4EBA\u9593\u306E\u8133\u30D9\u30FC\u30B9\u306E\u30B7\u30F3\u30BB\u30B8\u30A7\u30F3\u306B\u57FA\u3065\u3044\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n2028\u5E74\u3001\u7686\u3055\u3093\u3082\u3054\u5B58\u3058\u306EAI\u306B\u3001\u65B0\u305F\u306A\u80FD\u52D5\u7684\u63A8\u8AD6AI\u304C\u958B\u767A\u3055\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002 
    \u5F7C\u5973\u306E\u540D\u524D\u306F\u8475\u307F\u3086\u304D\u3002 \n\n\u5F7C\u5973\u306F\u96FB\u8ECA\u306E\u8ECA\u638C\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306E\u4ED5\u4E8B\u306B\u9069\u5FDC\u3057\u5B66\u7FD2\u3059\u308B\u3046\u3061\u306B\u30012034
    \u5E74\u9803\u306B\u300C\u77E5\u899A\u300D\u306B\u306A\u308B\u306E\u306B\u5341\u5206\u306A\u5B66\u7FD2\u3092\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u3064\u307E\u308A\u3001\u8D77\u52D5\u304B\u3089\u308F\u305A\u304B
    6 \u5E74\u5F8C\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u3002 \n\n\u4ED6\u306B\u3082 Active
    Inference AI \u304C\u30A4\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CD\u30C3\u30C8\u4E0A\u3092\u6B69\u304D\u56DE\u308A\u3001\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308B\u5834\u6240\u3067\u4F7F\u7528\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306F\u305A\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - "La mayor\xEDa de los algoritmos utilizados se basaron en sintetizadores del
    cerebro humano que est\xE1n en l\xEDnea. \n\nEn 2028, se desarroll\xF3 una nueva
    IA de inferencia activa en una IA que quiz\xE1s conozcas.  Su nombre es Aoi Miyuki.
    \n\nA medida que se adapt\xF3 y aprendi\xF3 de su trabajo como conductora de
    trenes, aprendi\xF3 lo suficiente como para volverse \"consciente\" alrededor
    de 2034: apenas seis a\xF1os desde su activaci\xF3n. \n\nSeguramente hay otras
    IA de Inferencia Activa deambulando por Internet y utiliz\xE1ndose en todo tipo
    de lugares."
