--- !u!114 &5990926103042939655
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8774986339376014193}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 4724119775310280439}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Height:  5\u2019 2\u201D (157 CM)\nWeight:  110 Pounds ( 50KG)\nBloodtype: O-\n\nLikes:
    \n\nCocktails * Pink * Cats * Comfy Vibes\nVR Concerts * Crossword Puzzles\n\nDislikes:
    \n\nLong Shifts * Water * Drama * Lizards * Silence * Dark Places."
  - "H\xF6he: 5 Fu\xDF 2 Zoll (157 cm)\nGewicht: 110 Pfund (50 kg)\nBlutgruppe: O-\n\nGef\xE4llt
    mir: \n\nCocktails * Pink * Katzen * Comfy Vibes\nVR-Konzerte * Kreuzwortr\xE4tsel\n\nAbneigungen:
    \n\nLange Schichten * Wasser * Drama * Eidechsen * Stille * Dunkle Orte."
  - "\u8EAB\u9577: 5' 2\" (157 CM)\n\u91CD\u91CF: 110 \u30DD\u30F3\u30C9 (50KG)\n\u8840\u6DB2\u578B\uFF1AO-\n\n\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E:
    \n\n\u30AB\u30AF\u30C6\u30EB * \u30D4\u30F3\u30AF * \u732B * \u5FC3\u5730\u3088\u3044\u96F0\u56F2\u6C17\nVR\u30B3\u30F3\u30B5\u30FC\u30C8
    * \u30AF\u30ED\u30B9\u30EF\u30FC\u30C9\u30D1\u30BA\u30EB\n\n\u5ACC\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E:
    \n\n\u9577\u6642\u9593\u52E4\u52D9 * \u6C34 * \u30C9\u30E9\u30DE * \u30C8\u30AB\u30B2
    * \u6C88\u9ED9 * \u6697\u3044\u5834\u6240\u3002"
  - "Altura: 5' 2\" (157 CM)\nPeso: 110 libras (50 kg)\nTipo de sangre: O-\n\nGustos:
    \n\nC\xF3cteles * Rosa * Gatos * Vibraciones c\xF3modas\nConciertos de realidad
    virtual * Crucigramas\n\nNo le gusta: \n\nTurnos largos * Agua * Drama * Lagartos
    * Silencio * Lugares oscuros."
