--- !u!114 &770657393048085358
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8846602943296122504}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 6512274112532689936}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "A high speed tech store full of computers, VR equipment, Cell Phones, PDAs,
    and other high end tech supplies. \n\nBeing on Twatch, the name fits well. \n"
  - "Ein Hochgeschwindigkeits-Tech-Laden voller Computer, VR-Ausr\xFCstung, Mobiltelefone,
    PDAs und anderer High-End-Tech-Artikel. \n\nDa ich auf Twatch bin, passt der
    Name gut."
  - "\u30B3\u30F3\u30D4\u30E5\u30FC\u30BF\u30FC\u3001VR \u6A5F\u5668\u3001\u643A\u5E2F\u96FB\u8A71\u3001PDA\u3001\u305D\u306E\u4ED6\u306E\u30CF\u30A4\u30A8\u30F3\u30C9
    \u30C6\u30AF\u30CE\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u7528\u54C1\u304C\u6E80\u8F09\u306E\u9AD8\u901F\u30C6\u30AF\u30CE\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC
    \u30B9\u30C8\u30A2\u3002 \n\nTwatch \u306B\u3042\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3001\u3053\u306E\u540D\u524D\u306F\u3074\u3063\u305F\u308A\u3067\u3059\u3002"
  - "Una tienda de tecnolog\xEDa de alta velocidad llena de computadoras, equipos
    de realidad virtual, tel\xE9fonos celulares, PDA y otros suministros de tecnolog\xEDa
    de punta. \n\nAl estar en Twatch, el nombre encaja bien."
