--- !u!114 &7591115673701316282
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 9201056079049567833}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad07be330008fea4fa1861cc93418640, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 3941665078193247957}
  languageKeys:
  - English
  - German
  - Japanese
  - Spanish
  languageValues:
  - "Users of certain domains have reported individuals with more admin powers than
    they should be allowed to have. \n\nMost of these streamers are of the v-tubing
    variety, and live stream on many different platforms. \n\nThey look like demons
    in all flavors: cat girls, incubi , succubi, oni, and imps. \n"
  - "Benutzer bestimmter Dom\xE4nen haben Personen gemeldet, die \xFCber mehr Administratorrechte
    verf\xFCgen, als ihnen eigentlich zustehen sollten. \n\nDie meisten dieser Streamer
    sind vom Typ V-Tubing und streamen live auf vielen verschiedenen Plattformen.
    \n\nSie sehen aus wie D\xE4monen in allen Variationen: Katzenm\xE4dchen, Inkuben,
    Sukkuben, Oni und Kobolde."
  - "\u7279\u5B9A\u306E\u30C9\u30E1\u30A4\u30F3\u306E\u30E6\u30FC\u30B6\u30FC\u304B\u3089\u3001\u8A31\u53EF\u3055\u308C\u308B\u3079\u304D\u4EE5\u4E0A\u306E\u7BA1\u7406\u6A29\u9650\u3092\u6301\u3064\u500B\u4EBA\u304C\u5831\u544A\u3055\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002
    \n\n\u3053\u308C\u3089\u306E\u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DE\u30FC\u306E\u307B\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306F
    V-Tube \u306E\u7A2E\u985E\u3067\u3042\u308A\u3001\u3055\u307E\u3056\u307E\u306A\u30D7\u30E9\u30C3\u30C8\u30D5\u30A9\u30FC\u30E0\u3067\u30E9\u30A4\u30D6
    \u30B9\u30C8\u30EA\u30FC\u30DF\u30F3\u30B0\u3092\u884C\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002
    \n\n\u5F7C\u3089\u306F\u732B\u5A18\u3001\u30A4\u30F3\u30AD\u30E5\u30D3\u3001\u30B5\u30AD\u30E5\u30D0\u30B9\u3001\u9B3C\u3001\u5C0F\u9B3C\u306A\u3069\u3001\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308B\u7A2E\u985E\u306E\u60AA\u9B54\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306B\u898B\u3048\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  - "Los usuarios de ciertos dominios han informado de personas con m\xE1s poderes
    administrativos de los que deber\xEDan tener. \n\nLa mayor\xEDa de estos transmisores
    son del tipo v-tubing y transmiten en vivo en muchas plataformas diferentes.
    \n\nParecen demonios de todos los sabores: chicas gato, \xEDncubos, s\xFAcubos,
    oni y diablillos."
